    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "A A. comosus 'Variegatus' buud toor-toorã wakat-wakate, b bɩɩsd-a lame n yɩ roog sẽn tar yõod wʋsgo. A segd n paama wĩntoog vẽenem sẽn be zĩig ning fãa, la a bɩɩsdda a yĩng zĩig sẽn yaa 18 °C n ta 24 °C (64 °F n ta 75 °F), la a sã n wa be be zʋʋg wakatẽ, a minimã yaa 16 °C (61 °F). Yaa tɩlɛ tɩ b tall-a ne koom, la b bas tɩ tẽnga kʋdg ne koomã. A pa tar vʋʋsg wakat ye, la a segd n leb n manegame tɩ b lebg n maneg-a yʋʋmdã fãa, hal tɩ koglgã ta sentimetr 20 ye." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Bãan-dãmb nins b sẽn dɩkd n kẽngd tẽn-zẽng n tɩ yiisdã yaa vãad la b wat n dɩt-b-la zĩis sẽn yaa toor-toore, b sã n wa ta tẽn-kãng b sẽn na n tall-b n kẽngẽ wã. Ro-kãensã yaa sẽn pa tõe n paam koom n kẽ ye, la b pid ne ethylene gas sẽn na yɩl n kɩt tɩ b bɩ. Woto makda gasã sẽn yaa wa rog-n-migsã. Ethylene wã kɩtdame tɩ amylase, sẽn yaa enzym sẽn sãamd zũudã n lebg sukre, tar pãn-tusdg a yũug zugu. Etɩlenã kɩtdame tɩ pectinase, sẽn yaa enzim sẽn yaa toor n sãamd pectinã sẽn be banana sel-dãmb sʋkã, kɩtdame tɩ banana wã sã n wa bɩtẽ, a lebg laafi. Vẽenem ning sẽn yaa kẽengã sẽn be nin-buiid wʋsg sẽn be zĩig ning sẽn tar tʋʋl-nif sẽn zems ne zẽ-vãadã pʋgẽ wã yaa sẽn tũ ne b sẽn bɩt n ta 18 °C (64 °F), la pa paamd Cavendish zẽ-vãadã sẽn bɩt zĩig ning sẽn tar tʋʋl-nif sẽn yɩɩd 27 °C (81 °F) ye, sẽn kɩt tɩ b ket n yaa vãadã." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Banande b sẽn dɩkd n dɩkd zĩig sẽn zãr n yi trope rãmbã n kẽngd dũniyã zĩisi. Sẽn na yɩl n paam tɩ b bĩng-a wakat fãa, b tigsd-a-la t'a nan pa bɩ ye. B sã n dat n tall-a, b segd n ges-a-la neere, n tall-a tao-tao n kẽng batayo, n kɩt t'a gãande, la b tall-a n kẽng koom-koglgẽ. B sẽn dat n maan woto wã yaa sẽn na yɩl n gɩdg tɩ bãnã ra yiis bũmb ning sẽn kɩtd tɩ b bɩ wã, sẽn boond tɩ ethylene wã ye. Sẽn kẽed ne tʋʋm kãnga, b tõe n bĩngame la b tall-a rasem a 3 bɩ a 4 13 °C (55 °F) pʋgẽ. B sã n wa wa, b gãe-b-la zĩig sẽn tar tʋʋl-nif sẽn zems 17 °C (63 °F) la b rɩk n maan tɩp-bil n ning etilenã. Rasem a wãn loogr poore, tɩɩsã biis sɩngda bɩʋʋngo, tɩ b pʋɩ-b n na n koos-ba. B sã n wa rɩ-a, a tõe n paa yirã rasem a wãn n yaool n dɩ. Sã n yaa tɩ b pa tõe n dɩlge, b tõe n kẽesa bĩng sẽn yaa gãndgo, tɩ b ningd bĩng sẽn yaa gãndgo, tɩ b ningd bĩng sẽn yaa gãndgo, tɩ b tõe n dɩlge, n dɩlge." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Saawã sɩngrẽ, d na n kosame (yaa d namse), n yaool n zĩnd saawã pʋgẽ, tɩ b na n wa soog zĩigã n wa wa wa wa ne 80-110 °C (176-230 °F). B loba koom kug-koglgã zug sẽn yaa wa koom sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩd koomã. Woto kɩtame tɩ koom sẽn yaa koom sẽn yaa zãadã pãng lebg wʋsgo, tɩ b boond tɩ löyly, n paas koomã la saawã pʋgẽ tʋʋlgã. Yaa gom-biig a löyly bal la b tũnugd ne a sẽn gomd wa koom-koglgã sẽn yaa to-to wã wɛɛngẽ; la yaa gom-biig ning sẽn yaa Finnish höyry (\"tõog, koom-koglg\") n tũnugd ne-a, sã n pa ne bãngr wɛɛngẽ bal ye. mos_Latnmos_Latnmos_Latn be be be. La yaa sẽn yaa to-to ne löyly wã n be Finnik buud-goamẽ wã, wala Karelia löyly, Estonia leil, Votic leülü, Veps l'öl' la Livonian löul. A sẽn da yaa pipi wã, a ra rat n yeelame tɩ 'sũ-sũ-sũ, sɩɩg,' la yaa woto n ket n be Ural buud-goamã pʋsẽ. Wala makre, Udmurt lul, Komi lol, Mansi läl ('tõnd vɩɩmã'), Khanty lil la Hungary lélek." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Bãagrã yaa bõn-buud la b bɩɩsd b toorẽ yĩnga, la b tõe n dɩka sẽk kiuug a naase, la b bɩɩsda rasem 70 bɩ 80 bal tɩ zemsd ne b sẽn segd n maan bũmb ningã.[35] B bɩɩda wĩntoog sẽn be wĩntoog pʋgẽ, la b sakd n maand zĩm-sobend wʋsgo. La sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩd yaa 16 °C la 21 °C. Tʋʋmdã sẽn yaa sõma yaa t'a yaa zĩ-kãnga sẽn yaa zĩ-gãong sẽn yaa sõma, sẽn yaa zĩm-gãong bɩ sẽn yaa wa tãnsã, n tar pH sẽn be 6.3 n ta 6.8." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "B tõe n peega karotã sẽk kiuug wʋsg ne ko-kãsems roogẽ, wall wakat ning sẽn yaa sẽkã, zĩig sẽn yaa yɩng la sẽn yaa koom-koɛɛga, la zĩig sẽn yaa zĩ-sõngo. Sẽn na yɩl n tall-b wakat sẽn zãre, b tõe n saka sãnem-biis sẽn pa yɩlemd koomẽ, n ning-b sãnem-buud ne tɩɩs sẽn yaa bĩis n naag ne a 50/50 bɩ n ning-a tʋʋl-tẽngã pʋgẽ. La sã n yaa ne tʋʋlgr sẽn be a zug n ta a 0 °C n ta a 4 °C n paas ne koom sẽn be a 90-95% wã, yaa sõma n yɩɩda. Sẽn na yɩl n tõog n tall-b n tall-ba, b tõe n paama sũ-sãang wʋsgo, tɩ b lebg wa b sẽn pa tar-b ye. D tõe n yɩɩga ne tɩgsem sã n tall-b zĩis sẽn tar sobg sẽn tar sobgã sẽn tar sobga, tɩ b pa tar etilẽ (yakr wɛɛngẽ, b pa tar bi-bõn-buud la tɩɩs sẽn tar etilɛɛn ye). B tõe n kɩtame tɩ b lebg bur ne bur ne sãnem, ne a sãnem, la ne a sãn-tɩ-m-mengã." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Koom yaa bũmb sẽn pa tar yũ-noog sẽn tar bãngre. A yaa bũmb sẽn yaa vẽenega, sẽn ka tar yũugu, sẽn ka tar yũugu, la sẽn ka tar vɛɛre, la a yaa bũmb ning sẽn kɩtd tɩ tẽngã koom-koglg la bõn-vɩɩs nins fãa b sẽn mi wã lebg koom-koglg (sẽn na yɩl n tõog n welg-ba). A yaa tɩlae ne bõn-vɩɩs nins fãa sẽn be tẽngã zugã, baa ne a sẽn pa kõt rɩɩbo, pãngã, wall bõn-vɩɩs a taab sẽn yaa mikrõ. A sẽn boond t'a H 2 O wã wilgdame t'a molecule fãa tara oksize a ye, la hidrogẽr a yiib sẽn lagem taab ne taaba. Hydrogen atõma lagma ne oksize atõma ne 104.45° \"Water\" yaa H 2 O wã sẽn yaa bũmb sẽn yaa ko-kẽeng ne yam-tekr sẽn yaa sõma wã me yʋʋre." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Limõ wã rata t'a tʋʋlg zems 7 °C (45 °F), tɩ b pa tar pãng yʋʋmdã tõre, la b sã n bɩtẽ, b tara pãng n paasdẽ. 21 Bõn-bɩʋʋllã pa baood tɩ b kẽes-b wʋsg ye. B kẽesa wil nins sẽn yaa wogd n yɩɩd b taabã n na n kɩt tɩ b bɩt sõma. Sã n yaa ne sigr kiuugã tɛka, b sã n na n dɩgsa b tɩɩsã sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd to-to wã, na n kɩtame tɩ b paam tɩɩs nins sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd to-to wã. Sẽn mik tɩ tɩɩs nins sẽn bɩ wã tõe n wa ne wil sẽn pa rat n bɩt tao-tao (b sẽn boond tɩ \"vɩɩm wilã\"), b yiisda b wilã sẽn be tɩɩgã tẽngr bɩ a sʋka." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Adibo daare yaa bõn-bɩʋʋngo kiuugu 1896 daare nina Dagamb nɩ German nansara ramba sɩn zabé n kʋ taab têng bill nina sén pẽnegd Yendi pʋge. Têng bil kanga yoore la Adibo." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Tônd ma-bi-taasa (Dagamba) zaba nẽere la rasma yiibu sʋke la b sak bône. 1896 yʋʋm-sar kiuugu daar'a naase taab daare la nansara ramba fãag Dagamba na-tẽnga, Yendi." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2019-20 wã yaa Armanian Premier League a yiib-n-soabã. Ararat-Armenian sẽn paam n lebg Armen Premier League kãsmã yʋʋm a yiib n pʋɩ-n-soaba, b paama a Noowa kãsmã sẽn be Armen Cupã pʋgẽ. Europã pʋgẽ, AIK tõoga b ne UEFA Champions League pipi raabẽ wã, tɩ kɩt tɩ Ararat-Armeniya lʋɩ UEFA Europa League wã pʋgẽ, b sẽn ta raabã taoor n yaool n bas Dudelange." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 tʋʋlg kiuug rasem 12 wã, Armenid Piitã sull wilgame tɩ Armenid piitã sẽn be n be n be be n beẽ wã fãa yaa sẽk n tãag kiuug rasem 23 wã." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2019-20 wã yaa Armaan Premier League a yiib-n-soabã. Ararat-Armenian sẽn paam n lebg Armen Premier League kãsmã yʋʋm a yiib n pʋɩ-n-soaba, b paama a Noowa kãsmã sẽn be Armen Cupã pʋgẽ. Europã pʋgẽ, AIK tõoga b ne UEFA Champions League pipi raabẽ wã, tɩ kɩt tɩ Ararat-Armeniya lʋɩ UEFA Europa League wã pʋgẽ, b sẽn ta raabã taoor n yaool n bas Dudelange." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "A Vardan Minasyan sẽn bas b sullã yʋʋmd 2020 tʋʋlg rasem 17 wã, a sẽn wa n wa n bas a sullã yõor kaoobã poore, Ararat-Armeniya wilgame t'a David Campaña n na n lebg b taoor soab yʋʋmd 7 kiuug rasem 22 wã." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 sigt kiuug rasem 29 wã, Armenia Premier League yʋʋm 2020-21 sasa wã kaoosa wakat sẽn pa sɛt sẽn yaa Nagorno-Karabakh zabr sẽn be pãng yĩnga. [1] Daar a yembre, Ararat ne Armenia sẽn da be UEFA Europa League playoff raabã kibsã ne Red Star Belgrade wã paama loogr n kẽng GSP stadion sẽn be Nicosia, Sɩpr tẽnga pʋgẽ. [2] Yʋʋmd 10 kiuug rasem 13 wã, FFA wilgame tɩ b na n leoka weerã rasem 17 kiuug rasem a ye. [3]" },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2021-22 wã, yaa yʋʋm a nu soaba la b sẽn boond tɩ Championnat National 3 wã. Yaa b sẽn da yãagd b taaba, b sẽn yãagd b taabã, b ra yaa b sẽn yãgd b taabã. Neb nins sẽn da be tigimsã sʋka, yaa amateurã (bãnd kẽer sẽn da yaa pis-pis-pis-piis-piisã) la b sẽn da be b tigimsã sẽn da yaa b sẽn da yaa pʋ-peelem dãmba." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Talbot, Alice-Mary (2002). \"Pilgrimage to Healing Shrines: The Evidence of Miracle Accounts\". Dumbarton Oaks Papers. Dumbarton Oaks, Trustees for Harvard University. 56: 153–173. doi:10.2307/1291860. JSTOR 1291860." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Armstrong, Gregory T. (1967). \"Constantine's Churches\". Gesta. International Center of Medieval Art. 6: 1–9. doi:10.2307/766661. JSTOR 766661. S2CID 191762441." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Bagnall, Roger S. (2001). \"Archaeological Work on Hellenistic and Roman Egypt, 1995–2000\". American Journal of Archaeology. Archaeological Institute of America. 105 (2): 227–243. doi:10.2307/507272. JSTOR 507272. S2CID 194049544." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Weitzmann, Kurt (1977). \"The Late Roman World\". The Metropolitan Museum of Art Bulletin. The Metropolitan Museum of Art. 35 (2): 2–96. doi:10.2307/3259887. JSTOR 3259887." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Wilber, Donald N. (1940). \"The Coptic Frescoes of Saint Menas at Medinet Habu\". The Art Bulletin. College Art Association. 22 (2): 86–103. doi:10.2307/3046689. JSTOR 3046689." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "[2:54 PM, 10/14/2023] Hassan: Sulli:Kibay fãa" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Angklung Orchester Hamburg, Alemayn (2003/2004)" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Olaf Matthes: Zur Vorgeschichte der Ausgrabungen in Assur 1898-1903/05. MDOG Berlin 129, 1997, 9-27. ISSN 0342-118X" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "A sẽn dog Abidjan, Ivory Coast wã, a yɩɩla KOZAF(2013-14), Bobo Sport(2014-16), ASF Bobo Dioulasso(2016-17), Étoile Filante(2017-19), Raja Beni Mellal(2019-21) la Becamex Binh Duong(2022).Abdoul Abass Guiro woglem yãa 1.93m(6t 4iin)" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Gunu yaa politik soab sẽn tũud ne New Patriotic Party wã, la a yaa Ghana gofneem naam a naase-n soabã faso wã siglgã taoor lʋɩtb sull a yopoe soabã sẽn yaa Gana wĩn-dɩtgo sẽn ya Savelugu pugin . A lʋɩɩ Ghana gofneem naam baobo tẽnga sorã pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 2016 wã, la a tõoga a zĩiga ne neb 13,334, sẽn makda neb 34.21% sẽn deeg n yãk n yãk n kõ yʋʋm kãnga ." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 Ghana wã raosã pʋgẽ, a maana a Assin North tẽnga pʋga, a sẽn da rat n yɩ NDC tẽnga taoor soab a James Gyakye Quayson taoore. A paama vot dãmb 14,193 sẽn yaa 44.79% n kõ votã fãa." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Abena da paama vote yãkre 17,399 ne vota fãa dag yi 22,486,tɩ wend kob pʋge 77.81% ne vota fãa.A ya depite wã,a kẽnga'a meng ne'a Atiwa East neba yɛl depite-rãmb-sooga oʋge.A dag yi Financial Committee, Public Accounts Committee la Employmemt and Social Welfare and State Enterprises Committee depite-rãmb-sooga pʋg la'a kẽng'a meng wʋsgo ne laluwa gom la kẽesir'a naor ne n vɛɛsir neb taoor soaba vɛɛsg goam.A dag leb ya ned n tʋmde ne Prestigious Parliamentary Service Board(PSB)." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2012 sasa, a Gaddafi kʋʋm poore, UNESCO bao ligidi wa dollars tus-kẽemde bɩ milyõ 2.26 n naam pãng n zãms neba. Neba zãmseg tʋʋma da yaa UNESCO sẽn tũ Libya nɩ Italy rãmb gofneema. Libya tara UNESCO Ãndũni Faado zĩisa taab'a naase n paas Tadrart Acacus n wã: Cyrene, Leptis Magna, Sabratha nɩ Ghadames. UNESCO sagla mɩ tɩ b tilg tẽng-sʋka Ghat bɩ Uweynat zakẽ wã n tar n zãmsr neb nins sẽn nan get la b kolle bɩ n gũ soolem'a...." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Mercuri AM (2008) Plant exploitation and ethnopalynological evidence from the Wadi Teshuinat area (Tadrart Acacus, Libyan Sahara). Journal of Archaeological Science 35: 1619-1642; doi:10.1016/j.jas.2007.11.003" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Mercuri AM (2008) Human influence, plant landscape evolution and climate inferences from the archaeobotanical records of the Wadi Teshuinat area (Libyan Sahara). Journal of Arid Environments 72: 1950-1967. doi:10.1016/j.jaridenv.2008.04.008" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2016 yʋʋm-sar kiuugã, a tɩ zab ne Ghana nin-buiida fãa yãkr sẽn zĩnd yʋʋm 2016 soabã National Democratic Congress la a wa n lʋɩɩs ne a Elizabeth Afoley Quaye sẽn yaa New Patriotic Party wã. A leb n zabame yʋʋm 2020 Ghana nin-buiida fãa yãkrẽ wã ne National Democratic Congress la a tõoge. A paama vot 41,850, sẽn makd sẽn paam-b votã 55.80%. A paama naam n yɩɩg a Elizabeth Afoley Quaye sẽn yaa New Patriotic Party wã la a Hannah Bortey sẽn yaa Ghana Union Movement wã. B paamame tɩ b vot 32,604 la 545 ne b sẽn kõ wã fãa. B sõor yaa 43.47% la 0.73% ne taaba." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Pelpuo dag depite vote yãkre yʋm 2004 Wa Central Consituency Gana naam yãkr yʋm wakat pʋge. A dag yi depite Gana depite rãmb soog m pasd a naase zĩiga Gana repiblik-naase. A dag paama vote yãkre 21,272 ne vota sõgd fãa n ya 41,501 neb dag vote.Tɩ a bilgri ya kob pʋge vote yãkre pis-nu la yembre la bumb ne neba votga. A dag paama yãkre n yiid Mornah Anbataayela Benard n ya People's National Convention partɩ wã, ne Mohammed Adama Kpegla n ya New Patriotic party (NPP) neda,ne Abu Mumuni n ya Convention People's Party (CPP) partɩ neda,ne Osman Mohammed n ya Democratic People's Party ned la Osman Imam Sidik n dag yarse a tõor m bao wã. Tɩb yãkra m pʋg taab la 12,249 vote,7,249 vote,37vote,172 vote la 152 vote ne neba fãa vote n dag yãke.A bilgri kob pʋge ya 29.6%,17.5%,0.9%,0.4% n pʋg taaba.Neba dag yãka Pelpuo n tũ ne National Democratic Congress (NDC) partɩ wã. Tɩ depite rãmb pis-wae la naase yi (94):National Democratic Congress (NDC) partɩ wã pʋge,tɩ bilgri wend bamb la depite rãmb n ka labs depite rãmb sooga pʋge n tar depite rãmb kobsi la pis-tã(230) Gana repiblik depite rãmb sooga pʋge." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "A Abdul-Rauf Ibrahim yaa National Democratic Congress wã taoor soaba. A da an yalseme n ko National Democratic Congress sulla ti be vota ti a lèbg o b saka 'Yagaba-Kubori' gofneenma tʋʋmda yʋʋmde 2004 ti a tar voto 6,460 neb 12,080 vota n yâk pʋgin rela 53.5%. A da an kell n zĩnda a zĩiga, la a lebga Ghana naan-nak a naas-n-soabã siglgã siglgã a nu soabã politik naam yʋʋmde 2008.Yʋʋmde 2012 Gana politik naam wakato, a da an konga naama ti yaa neba da yâk 8 n yaa New Patriotic Party sulli.A leb n lʋɩɩsa a naamẽ wã yʋʋmd 2016 Ghana politik naam yakre wakato pʋgin, la a tõoga. Rẽ kɩtame tɩ a lebga sull a ye 7th Parliament of the 4th Republic of Ghana ti ya National Democratic Congress la yals-ya ti o vota.A ra bee bʋ-kaoodb sull pissi la yiib-n-soab (21) sʋka, a ra yaa yood la logtoɛɛmb kom-n-taarã pʋgẽ, a ra yaa sull sẽn get teed la logtoɛɛmb yell n tar neb piig la a nii sẽn yaa kom-bɩɩsã sʋka.sẽn tar yɛl nins fãa sẽn kẽed ne teedã la soayã wɛɛngẽ wã fãa. A ra yaa Kom-tĩnd ning sẽn get bũmb nins sẽn pa maandã sull me n tʋmdẽ." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2016 Ghana nin-buiidã yãkr sasa, a paama Ekumfi constituency a sẽn da yaa a soab n na n paam NPP taoor soab a Francis Kingsley Ato Codjoe. A tõoga ne koees 11,632, sẽn yaa 47.6% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã, t'a Francis paam koees 12,240, sẽn yaa 50.1% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã, PPP Stephen Quansah paama koees 505, sẽn yaa 2.1% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã, la CPP candidate a Kweku Essuoun paama koees 70, sẽn yaa 0.3% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 Ghana nin-buiidã yãkr sasa, a paama sull ning sẽn get Ekumfi sullã poorẽ wã ne b sẽn paam tɩ b yãk-a wã sõor sẽn yaa 16 037 sẽn yaa 53,6% n kõ-a wã, tɩ NPP sullã taoor soab a Francis Kingsley Ato Codjoe paam tɩ b yãk-a wã sõor yaa 13 468 sẽn yaa 45,0% n kõ-a wã, GUM sullã taoor soab a Regina Amoah paam tɩ b yãk-a wã sõor yaa 371 n kõ-a wã sõor sẽn yaa 1,2% n kõ-a wã, la CPP sullã taoor soab a Ibrahim Anderson paam tɩ b yãk-a wã sõor yaa 48 n kõ-a wã sõor sẽn yaa 0,2% n kõ-a wã." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2016 Ghana tẽnga pʋga, a paama pʋɩt a Assin North sẽn yaa pʋɩtb sẽn yaa 15,553 n paam n kõ b sõor sẽn yaa 56.8% tɩ NDC taoor lʋɩtb taoor lʋɩtbã a Samuel Ambre paam n kõ a sõor sẽn ya 10,751 n kõ a pʋɩtbã sẽn yaa 39.2% n kõ a PPP taoor lʋɩtba a Isaac Manu paam n kõ 979 n kõ a kõ a sõora sẽn yaa 3.6% n kõ a CPP taoor lʋɩta taoor lʋɩtgã a Sanni Mahama paam n kõ sõor sẽn yɩɩd 115 n kõ a soab sẽn yaa 0.4% n kõ a soabã." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "2016 me, Ghana tẽnga sorã sasa, Odoom paama a Twifo Atti Morkwa tẽnga pʋga. A paama vot 21 231 n paam n kõ votã fãa wã pʋɩ-sʋk 58.2%, la NDC tẽnga taoor soab a Samuel Ato Amoah paama vot 14 887 n kõ vot a taabã pʋɩ-bʋk 40.8%, PPP tẽnga taoor soab A Abu Ayuba paama vot a 273 n kõ vot ning sẽn kõ vot ning fãa pʋɩ-pʋɩ-sʋka 0.8%, la CPP tẽnga taoor soaba a Ebenezer Appiah paama vot 115 n kõ vot sẽn kõ vot nins fãa sẽn kõ wã pʋɩ." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "A Adama yaa NDC nin-buiida, la a yaa Tain Constituency MP. A paama sɛba 20,374 sẽn yaa 45.4% ne sɛba fãa sẽn togse, NPP Parliamentary aspirant, t'a Gabriel Osei paam sɛba 18,346 sẽn yaa 40.9%." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 yʋʋm-sar kiuugã, a tõoga New Edubease Constituency. A paama vote 19,961 sẽn makd 52.4% ne a sẽn yaa a soab ning sẽn pẽ-a n yɩɩdã sẽn yaa sull ning sẽn get tẽnga yel-gɛtbã yelle, a George Boahen Oduro sẽn yit New Patriotic Party wã sẽn paam vote 17,913 sẽn makd 47.0% ne vot nins b sẽn kõ wã. New Edubease zĩiga yaa zĩiga a ye sẽn paam tɩ New Patriotic Party zãag ne National Democratic Congress wã yʋʋm 2016 tẽnga taoor lʋɩtb taoor lʋɩtb taoor lʋɩtb taoor lʋɩtb sullẽ wã, la b pa tõog n kell n tall-a yʋʋm a naas ye." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Destubb the Wikipedia article of an MP to a readable prose of 1000 Bytes or more (i.e. about 200 words or 8 to 10 sentences). Please carefully check the prose size, for example by using Xtools article info and looking for the number of words under \"Prose\"." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "A Abdoul Abass Guiro (w.a.d. 19 zĩr kiuugã 1994) yaa Burkĩna tẽng futbã sẽn yaa tẽn-sʋka." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Abena Osei-Asare bao'a bãngre Achimota Primary School la tong'a bãngra baob ne Wasley Girls High School-Cape-Coast yʋm(1995-1997) suk wakat la da zams General Arts tɩ'a elective Subjets da yi Economics,Geography la Elective Mathematics.La wan leb kẽnga taor ne'a zams'a ɛnivertê bãngre University of Ghana,tɩ'a zams'a Economics la Geography.A tara B.A.(Hons.) Economics la Geography pʋga University of Ghana la leb tar MSc.Development Finance University of Ghana Business School pʋge.A wan yi Association of Chartered Certified Accountants (UK) yʋm 2009 la kẽ'b sulla pʋge yʋm 2014.Ampasda,a sulla tɩ'g tõka ne Gana Institute of Chartered Accountants (ICA).A leb tara ACI(Financial Markets Association) sẽba." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "A Odoom rogame yʋʋmd 1952 tʋʋlg kiuug rasem 11 daarã, la a yita Twifo Ayaase sẽn be Ghana tẽnga pʋga. A paama a sẽn paam a diplôme wã sẽn kẽed ne politikã la arzɛkã toeemã, a J. F. Kennedy School of Governance wã, Harvard University wã yʋʋmd 2007 wã, la a paama a diplôme a sẽn paam n paam a sẽn paam bũmb nins sẽn be Ghana Yuniõrsa pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 1979 wã." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "A Abroubagui Salbre yaa Burkĩna bal-toada sẽn yaa b sẽn boond tɩ A.C. Belluno 1905 sẽn be Serie D wã." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Room, Adrian (2008). African placenames : origins and meanings of the names for natural features, towns, cities, provinces, and counties. Internet Archive. Jefferson, N.C. : McFarland & Co. ISBN 978-0-7864-3546-3." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Minozzi S., Manzi G., Ricci F., di Lernia S., and Borgognini Tarli S.M. (2003) \"Nonalimentary tooth use in prehistory: an Example from Early Holocene in Central Sahara (Uan Muhuggiag, Tadrart Acacus, Libya)\" American Journal of Physical Anthropology 120: pp. 225–232; doi:10.1002/ajpa.10161" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Mattingly, D. (2000) \"Twelve thousand years of human adaptation in Fezzan (Libyan Sahara)\" in G. Barker, Graeme and Gilbertson, D.D. (eds) The Archaeology of Drylands: Living at the Margin London, Routledge, pp. 160–79;" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Despierres, Gérasime Bonnaire (1987). Alençon lace. Aberdeen: Aberdeen University Press. p. 207. ISBN 978-0-08-034512-3 ." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Duval, Louis (1883). Documents pour servir à l'histoire de la fabrication du point d'Alençon (in French). Alençon: E. Renaut-de Broise. p. 108." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Alexander Russell, ed. (1856). The Natural History of Aleppo (1st ed.). London: Unknown. p. 266." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Paolo Matthiae; Nicoló Marchetti (2013-05-31). Ebla and its Landscape: Early State Formation in the Ancient Near East. p. 501. ISBN 9781611322286." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Trevor Bryce (6 March 2014). Ancient Syria: A Three Thousand Year History. p. 111. ISBN 9780191002922." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Burns, Russ (1999). Monuments of Syria. New York, London. p. 35. ISBN 9781860642449." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Carter, Terry; Dunston, Lara; Humphreys, Andrew (2004). Syria & Lebanon. Lonely Planet. p. 186. ISBN 978-1-86450-333-3. Hammam yalbougha." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Pongratz-Leisten, Beate (2015). Religion and Ideology in Assyria. Walter de Gruyter GmbH & Co KG. p. 110. ISBN 978-1-61451-426-8." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2021 zu-loeoog rasem 15 wã, FFF sakame tɩ b wilg b sẽn na n maan b sẽn tõe n maan b tʋʋmdã." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Sẽn yaa to-to tɩ b pa tõog n maan yʋʋm 2020-21 sasa wã yĩnga, b wilgame tɩ b pa na n paam n paam n kẽng taoor bɩ b pa na ne b sẽn na n kẽng taoor to-to wã ye." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "A Vitré ne a Montpellier (res) paama waoogr n na n pids b tʋʋm sẽn pa be b zĩigẽ wã Championnat National 2 pʋgẽ, sẽn yɩ b sẽn be zĩig a 14 soabã yʋʋm 2019-20 soabã pʋgẽ. B lebga a Trégunc la a Aigues-Mortes" },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2021-22 wã yaa Ararati Armenya sẽn be Armen Premier Leagueã pʋgẽ, tɩ b ra yaa Pyunik n paam n lebg a yiib-n-soaba ne bõn-kãnga, la a Noravank sẽn paam n tõog Armen Cupã." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "A Ajax ra yaa b sẽn da tar n yɩɩd b taabã yʋʋm kob-gĩnd 20 soabã pʋgẽ. Sã n yaa ne tẽn-tẽngã futbã kibay la statistikã federation, Ajax yaa yʋʋm 20 soabã yʋʋm kob-gĩnd a yopoe soabã sẽn paam n yɩɩ Eropã neb wʋsg n yɩɩdã la yʋʋm 1992 wã, b yaa yʋʋmdã dũni wã bɩɩba. [1] Sã n yaa Neema seb-gʋlsd a Kicker wã sẽn togsã, yaa yʋʋm 20 yʋʋm kob-kãng bɩɩb a yiib soaba sẽn paam n yɩ Eropã neb wʋsgo. A yaa sull a nu sẽn paam n na n kell n zã Euro Cupã, la a zã a sãandã. Yʋʋmd 1972 wã, b tõog n tõog n tõog Eredivisie, KNVB Cup la Europ Cupã. B ra leb n paama Europayã Super Cup pipi (f sã n yaa tɩ pa-tʋʋmd ye) ne Rangers yʋʋm 1973 wã. A Ajax sẽn paam n yɩɩdã yaa Intercontinental Cup 1995 wã, UEFA Super Cup 1995 wã la Champions League 1995 wã. A sã n wa tõog Milan sõor sõor sõorã, a sã n wa paam n bas Juventus n bas Ligã sõor sõora. Yʋʋmd 1995 wã, a Ajax paama yʋʋmdã tẽn-bɛdã zʋrnallã yʋʋr sẽn boond tɩ World Soccer." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "A Ajax me yaa tãb a naas sẽn paam n tõog n paam tẽn-tẽngã tãb-biis la Intercontinental Cupã, la b paama b sẽn maan n tõog n tõog n tõoge. A yaa b tãb-biig sẽn tõog n tõoga UEFA tãb-biisã fãa. A yaa a ye n tõoga b sẽn tõog n tõog b sẽn maan b sẽn tõe n tõog n soog taab n tõog n ta tẽn-tẽnsã tãb-bilã. A yaa bãmb a nu n tõoga Intercontinentale Cupã naoor a yiib, sẽn yaa UEFA Cupã, 1991-92 wã, la a Karl Rappan Cupã. A yɩɩ a sẽn deng UEFA Intertoto Cupã yʋʋmd 1962 wã. A Ajax beeda Johan Cruyff Arena wã, sẽn yik n yaa Amsterdam ArenA yʋʋmd 1996 wã, la b leb n boond-a woto yʋʋmd 2018. B ra zoe n maana yɩɩr ne a Zeova Kaset rãmbã. B sẽn sɩng b sẽn beẽ wã, AJAX ra tara yʋʋr sẽn wilgd t'a ra geta a kambã, n get b sẽn tõe n tall b kambã la b bɩɩs b kambã." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Yaa Shellbook Publishing Systems ne SIL sẽn be Afirik ka n naag taab n maan seb kãnga. Shellbook Publishing Systems n deng n maan a pipi tɩ b boonẽ tɩ «Histoires de Kande, Livres 1 à 5, 2004». Yãmb sã n dat n bãng y sẽn na n maan toto ne buud sɛb a taaba ne b sẽn dɩk soɛ niisi SIDAwã bãaga wɛɛngẽ, bɩ y tɩ ges." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "A Abdoul Aziz Kaboré (ra roga yʋʋmd 1994 wakat puge) yaa Burkĩna wãb sẽn yaa b sẽn boond tɩ Burkĩna tẽnga b sẽn boond t'a Titus Pétange. Yʋʋmd 2015 wã la yʋʋmd 2016 wã sʋka, a maana yɩɩr a tãabo Burkina Faso tẽnga taoor soaba." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "A yaa NPP sullã ned a ye, la a yaa MP sẽn get Mion tẽnga. A paama vote 21,552 tɩ Mohammed Abdul Aziz sẽn yaa NDC wã paam vote 14,158. A Abdul Aziz sẽn deeg sullã maana kʋdemdã, bala yaa pipi naoor ning a NPP sẽn paam Mion sullã yʋʋm 28 pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "A yaa NPP sullã ned la a yaa Chereponi sullã tẽnga naaba. A paama goosneerã zĩiga ne koees 19,800 tɩ sẽn da yaa a Samuel Abdulai Jabanyite paam koees 12,859. A yaa petrool komisiõ wã taoor lʋɩtba." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "A Abeiku roga rasem 28 mars 1,973 la a yita Ekumfi Essuehyiam sẽn be Ghana tẽn-sʋka. A kẽnga National Engineering College sẽn be Takoradi, a sẽn paam Construction Technician I yʋʋmd 1995 wã." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Ziiga tara yʋ-sõngo t'a pĩis'a bãngra yĩnga la b paas'a la UNESCO Ãndũni Faado 1985 yʋʋmda pʋge (World Heritage) tɩ lakrɛ ramba sẽn yaa yel-bɛda yĩnga. Lakrɛ bũmb ramba nademr yita 12,000 BCE hal nɩ 100 CE n wʋlgri ziiga rog-n-miki n'a halhaal toeengo." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Tadrart n leb n yaa sitã gãnegre n kõ kʋdgẽ bĩisim sɩribdu pʋkri sẽn yi cerami zugu. Daarenga vɛɛsgo bɩ gesgo wʋlgame tɩ bĩis-kaama yita 7,500 BP." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Jabel Acacus Map and Guide, (Map) (1st ed.). 1:100,000, inset 1:400,000. Tourist and cave art information. Cartography by EWP. EWP. 2006. ISBN 0-906227-93-3 Archived from the original on 2015-04-27. Retrieved 2008-04-20." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Gifford-Gonzalez, Diane (2013). \"Animal Genetics and African Archaeology: Why It Matters\". African Archaeological Review. 30: 1–20. doi:10.1007/s10437-013-9130-7." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Libye : Les salafistes wahhabites libyens détruisent un site de 12.000 ans d'âge, Algeria, 29 April 2014" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Wikidata items must have the Position held (P39) property set Member of the 8th Parliament of the 4th Republic of Ghana with the following qualifiers added:" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Sulli:WikiProject Ghana/Parliament of Ghana/8th Parliament of the 4th Republic of Ghana" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Sulli:7th Parliament of the 4th Republic of Ghana" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "A roga yʋʋmd 1986 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem a 1 la a yita Sang sẽn be Ghana rɩtg zĩiga. A paama a SSSCE yʋʋmd 2005. Yʋʋmd 2017 wã, a paama a Postgraduate Certificate in Public Administration la yʋʋmd 2010 wã, a paama Economics." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "A Abdul-Rashid Pelpuo da roga la yʋʋmd 1964 Sig-noy Kiuug rasma a nu daare la a yita Wa, Ghana soolm sẽn be Upper East Region Ghana pʋge. A paama a Middle sukur bɩ lekolle Sebr yʋumd 1976 wakat. A leb paama a O Level bãngr yʋʋmd 1983 ne A level bãngr yʋʋmd 1986 wakat. A me leb n paama a Diploma in Economics yʋumd 1994 la leb bao taore m paam a Psychology degree yʋumd 1994 puge. Taoore, a leb n paama International Affairs Master's deegre yʋumd 1998. A tara a Development Policy PhD Université of Ghana, African Studies me yʋum 2013." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "A Abdul-Rauf Ibrahim yɩɩ Tass Kalia Enterprise Limited taoor soaba yʋʋmd 1983 n tãag 2016. A yɩɩ a Zeova Kaset rãmbã taoor soaba yʋʋmd 2013 t'a wa yʋʋm 2016. A yaa siglgã siglgã sigls-n-taag soaba,Architect la Quantity Surveyor." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Abdul-Samed Muhamed Gunu (doga tʋʋl-nif kiuugu dahma yoobe yʋʋmde 1966) yaa Ghana politik soab la Ghana Seventh Parliament of the 4th Republic of Ghana Parlament a yopoe soabã sẽn yaa Savelugu pʋga taoor soab sẽn be sa-no-gɛt tẽnga pʋga n yals ko New Patriotic Party ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Abdulai Abanga dogã Sig-noy kiuugu daham pisi-la nu yʋʋmde 1970. A ya Ghana politik neda nyé New Patriotic Party. A lèb n ya parliment wilga n gèt Bibduri saka m'be Ghana yaanga tèmsa a yembre." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Acacus Mountains ya tãnga m'be bĩisra pugin m'be Ghat District, Libya nen-taoore,sahara wã ziig ning.A be yaang ni Ghat galʋ tẽnga pugin,Libya, la a be rɩtgo baobgo ni Algeria toaaga,n na ta kilometr kobga 100km (62mi).Zĩiga tara pĩiga n tar bũmb naande a zugu" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Accra (/əˈkrɑː/; Ga: Ga bɩ Gaga; Twi: Nkran; Dagbani: Ankara) yaa Gana tẽnga la tẽnga sẽn yaa kãseng n yɩɩdã, sẽn be Guinee mogrã sẽn be zĩ-wʋʋʋng n be zĩ-kãsengã zug. [1] [2] Yʋʋmd 2021 wã sõssã pʋgẽ, a Akra tẽnga pʋga sẽn yaa km 2,04, a tara neb 284,124, la a sẽn yaa kãsenga sẽn yaa akra soolmã sẽn yaa km 3,245, a tara neb 5,455,692.[1] Sẽn yɩɩd fãa, b boond tɩ \"Accra\" tɩ \"Accre Metropolitan District\" sẽn da be yʋʋm 2008 soabã sẽn deng n ta yʋʋm 2000 wã. A sẽn da tar zĩiga yaa km2 77.0.[1] Sẽn sɩng ne rẽ, b pʋɩ-a lame n naan pʋɩ-tẽnga: tẽnga pʋga pʋga pʋɩ-sʋka pʋɩ-bɛd 12 (sẽn be zĩigã yaa km 179.0), la tẽnga pʋga sẽn yaa km 20.4 wã. Yaa tẽnga pʋɩ-kãsengã pʋɩ-pʋʋga pʋɩ sẽn paam tẽnga pʋɩ. [1] Tẽnga sẽn yaa km2 199.4 wã sõor yaa 1,782,150 yʋʋm 2021 soabã, la yaa Gana tẽnga pʋga, la tẽnga pʋga sẽn yaa Akra tẽnga tigisgã pʋga (20.4 km2) sẽn yaa tẽnga pʋga." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Akra yã Ghana têng zugu m be nug riʋtgo zĩiga n kolge ko-kãsenga ning yʋʋre n boonda lameere (Gulf of Guinea).A tẽnga yalem ya 225.67km^2. Akra yã Ghana têng zugu bedre.A zagse labsa mi.A zagse mee neere.Be la neb wʋsgo be n yɩɩde tẽmsã fâa n be Ghana." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "KÃnda n be Costa Rica wã, b sẽn naanãsã koodã paasda b sẽn be Maquenque, Corredor Fronterizo, Barra del Colorado la Caño Negro wã. Sẽn yaa to-to tɩ yaa zĩ-kãens sẽn get b yell la pa pa pa pa tẽngr zĩ-bõosã, b pa tõe n maan bũmb wʋsg sẽn pa tõe n yɩ sõma ye. La yaa sɩd tɩ yaa tʋʋm sẽn yaa sõma la b pa tõe ne b tʋʋm nins sẽn get b yellã ye. A Zeova Kaset rãmbã tara zĩ-dãmb sẽn be piis nins b sẽn tigimd zĩigã pʋgẽ wã sẽn yaa ha 358.5 (1.384 km2) la b maand kaset ne satelite wã yʋʋmd 2018 soabã pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Park woglem ya 760km (290sqm) ta tare rũmsi toore tooré m bé we-kãgra Arli ni Pendjari rivers n be Savanna woodland ni Sandstone hills n be Gobnangou chain. N tare 200 wobdo ,200 hippos ni bõn-yẽega. Tib lé tare buffaloes, baboons, mooge ni bengdo wãambse,reto ni wilpeendo toore tooré wa la harterbeest ni walpeoolgo ti le tare bushbucks , yĩisa ni waterbuck." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "The leaves are alternate, obovate, entire, 20–35 cm (7.9–13.8 in) long and 10–15 cm (3.9–5.9 in) broad." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Banfora ya na-tẽnga n be wĩn-goabga taoore Burkina Faso ta neb ya 117,452( yʋʋm 2019 gɛɛla) woto na-tẽnga paasse tẽngsa yoobe n be Burkina Faso pugin ta neb ya wʋsgo. A ligd-zugu n kon Comoe provẽnse. Tẽnga yɩɩga ya 85 kilometr (53 ml) wĩn- goabga taoore Bobo- Dioulasso, di ya Abidjan-Ouagadougou Railway. Cascades de Karfiguéla a ya koom sẽn yiite tãnga zugin rʋʋgre ta yɛgle ni Banfora." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Adama modgre pʋga,a dag kẽnda nao kilometr piso-poe la a nu(75km) ne Ouagadougou Capital la n dag n zoetin sulgda.La a sɩda bũuda neba min gusda la me n yõkr'a n pabr'a hal tɩ police wa kẽ pʋge n deeg'a n kẽng ne'a logtõr.Di wakat la Adama bũuda ges ti'a vɩɩm ne fura na yi yɛli la b kao fura." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Rɩt-kãnga Zũniyã gill zug, Ararat-Armeniya ra pa tõe n yã n yãag a ye ye. A Ararat-Aarmenia ra pa tõe ne a ye ye ye. Zũniyã fãa ra yaa a ye. A Zũniyã sẽn yaa a ye wã, Ararat ne a Armenia ra pa segd n yã ye. A Davidyan yi Ararat-Armeniya ne a taab yam-yãkr kiuug rasem13 daarã, [8] la a Ararat-armenia kẽngame Stockholm n na n zab ne AIK a Zũ-rãmba Arena rasem 17 daarã, n bas ne 3-1 yʋngo, la 4-3 sẽn yaa sõor sẽn naan zĩndã, n kɩt tɩ b lʋɩ UEFA Europa League sorã sorã pʋgẽ. B sẽn wa n lʋɩ UEFA Europa League a yiib-n-soabã raopã pʋgẽ wã, Ararat-Armenian ra yaa ne a Lincoln Red Imps sẽn be Gibraltar National League wã. Pipi meegã maana a Zerevɛn Republican Stadium wã, t'a paam n tõoga Ararat-Armeniya ne 2:0 n yaool n paam a Anton Kobyalko ne a Kódjo. Sẽn na n yɩlẽ tɩ b tõog n tõog n tõog zabrã, b maana yɩɩr kiuug rasem 30 daar a ye, Victoria Stadiõ wã sẽn be Gibraltar." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Zũniyã gill zug, Ararat-Armeniya ra pa tõe n yã n yãag a ye ye. A Ararat-Aarmenia ra pa tõe ne a ye ye ye. Zũniyã fãa ra yaa a ye. A Zũniyã sẽn yaa a ye wã, Ararat ne a Armenia ra pa segd n yã ye. A Davidyan yi Ararat-Armeniya ne a taab yam-yãkr kiuug rasem 13 daarã, [8] la a Ararat-armenia kẽngame Stockholm n na n zab ne AIK a Zũ-rãmba Arena rasem 17 daarã, n bas ne 3-1 yʋngo, la 4-3 sẽn yaa sõor sẽn naan zĩndã, n kɩt tɩ b lʋɩ UEFA Europa League sorã sorã pʋgẽ. B sẽn wa n lʋɩ UEFA Europa League a yiib-n-soabã raopã pʋgẽ wã, Ararat-Armenian ra yaa ne a Lincoln Red Imps sẽn be Gibraltar National League wã. Pipi meegã maana a Zerevɛn Republican Stadium wã, t'a paam n tõoga Ararat-Armeniya ne 2:0 n yaool n paam a Anton Kobyalko ne a Kódjo. Sẽn na n yɩlẽ tɩ b tõog n tõog n tõog zabrã, b maana yɩɩr kiuug rasem 30 daar a ye, Victoria Stadiõ wã sẽn be Gibraltar." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "A Kaboré sẽn dog Ouagadougou wã, a rɩka a karẽn-biis nins sẽn sɩng n be Fransã sẽn boond tɩ Valenciennes la Boulogne wã. A kẽnga Fleury 91 yʋʋmd 2019 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuugã pʋgẽ. Sẽn deng yʋʋm 2019-20 wã, a kẽnga Luxembourg tẽnga tigis a ye, a sẽn boond tɩ Union Titus Pétange." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "A Tapsoba maana a karengã pipi yʋʋm 2020 kiuug rasem 8 wã ne Cercle Brugge. A wa n yɩɩ minit 78 soabã pʋgẽ n na n sõng Maxime Lestienne, tɩ Standard Liège tõog 1-0." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "la kẽng taore n tɩ yi m pʋgde Facilities and Finace kasma n ya New York University m be Gana pʋga (2004 la 2007) wakat.A sẽn dag tʋmde ne Basa Bank [n dag boond Barclays Bank Ghana] wã,a dag yi b taore saoba (2007 -2009) wakat la m'be'a Treasury Department (2009-2012) wakat." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2012 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem 8 wã, a Salbre maana a Lega Pro pipi, n wa lebg n wa n wa n na n wa paam n lebg n wa lebg taoor soaba, a sã n wa tõog a Pergocrema ne a 1-4." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Anderson, William. An Archaeology of Late Antique Pilgrim Flasks, Anatolian Studies, Vol. 54, (2004), pp. 79–93, British Institute at Ankara." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "\"Abu Mena: Indicators\". UNESCO World Heritage Centre. Retrieved 2017-09-17." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "A Egyapa Mercer sẽn yaa tẽnga taoor soab a tʋma ne a nin-buiidã n pids a sẽn da pʋlem-bã. A tʋʋm kẽer sʋka, a kõo ordinatɛɛr dãmb a nu la bũmb a taab sẽn na ta doolaar 4000 n kõ Sekondi sɛbã. Woto ra yaa sẽn na yɩl tɩ karengã la zãmsgã yɩ sõma. A leb n sõngame tɩ b lebs a Sekondi Eleven Wise, sẽn yaa sull a ye ligdi sull sẽn be Ghana tẽnga pʋgẽ wã sẽn da segd ne Ghana Football Association ne ligd sẽn ta GH ₹ 5,000." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Tɩ yaood ning yẽ ni Chelsea ramba n sare ni taab ya Ero wã milyo piig la a naase(£14 million) hal tɩ a yaooda wa paase n wa ta Ero wã milyo pisi la a yiibu(£22million)." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Balé ya tẽng ning n paasd province 45 m be Burkĩna Faso,ti a be Boucle du Mouhoun Region, ti Boromo ya a tẽng-zugu.A tẽnga yalem ya 4,596 kilometr,ti a nin-buiidu ya 297,367 yʋʋmde 2019 sõdga n da sõde.Tẽnga tara wɛɛgo n Booni Deux Balé Forest ti a tar wobdo wʋsgo.Boromo n ya tẽng-zugu n be Ouagadougou sore tɩrg bedre n kẽnd Bono-Dioulasso.Yʋʋnʋmde 2007 la Canada tʋʋm-tʋʋmdba diki kẽng sãnem yɛl da pak sãnem tʋʋb zĩig m paasd a ta m be tẽnga pugin ti be Mana province pugin.Ti sãnema ziig tõog n yeeser $116 miniwõ daare pugin." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2017 sigr kiuug rasem 26 wã, a Traoré sigla a Ligue 1 sullã Olympique Lyonnais yʋʋm a nu n kõ-a yʋʋm a nu ligd sẽn ta milyõ 10 (£ 8.8 milyõ), sẽn paas paas-b-la b sẽn tõe n maan n paas-b ye. A Chelsea me ra na n zãgsame t'a Traore leb n na n kẽnge." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2019 tʋʋl-nif kiuugã pʋgẽ, a Bryan sẽn tũ ne a Bryan Acheampong siglgã kõo GH¢250,000 cheque n kõ Presbyterian University College." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 tʋʋl-nif kiuugã, a kõo ¢820,000 n kõ Afram Plains North, Afram Plains South, Abirem, Mpraeso, Nkawkaw, Abetifi la Suhum." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2021 sigr kiuugã, a kõ pʋʋg teed sẽn ta ¢500,000 n kõ pʋɩtb 6000 sẽn yɩɩd Kwahu Ɛst zĩiga sẽn na yɩl n sõng b pʋʋg tʋʋmdẽ." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2022 tʋʋl-nif kiuugã, a kõo ¢170,000, masĩn-dãmb 42 la pemsem kʋɩl-kɩɩmb 26 n kõ fuug-rãmb la pemsem-dãmb sigls nins sẽn be a sullã pʋgẽ wã." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "A fourth facilitator will increment your leaderboard if a green correct sign, is added by an item you worked on. The green correct sign, shows both Wikipedia and Wikidata item is completed." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Amsterdamsche Football Club Ajax (Holand: Ajax), sẽn boond tɩ AFC Ajax, Ajax Amsterdam, bɩ yaa Ajax balã, yaa Holand tẽnga b sẽn boond tɩ b sẽn boond n boond tɩ Amstɛɛrd wã, sẽn be Eredivisie wã pʋgẽ. Sɩda, AJAX (tõnd sẽn boond tɩ Azezi wã) yaa Nizo-rɛlandã klub sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd fãa, n paam Eredivisie zoob 36 la KNVB zoob 20 n kõ-a. A sẽn sɩng n be Eredivisie wã, a yɩɩla a yembr ne a Feyenoord la a PSV Eindhoven." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "SIDAwã yaa bãag sẽn kʋʋd neb tus a nii daar fãa dũniyã pʋga. A zoe n kʋʋ neb miliõ pisi la a nu. Nin-sables tẽng yelbũnd a yembr n yet yaa: “Waaf sã n kẽ f roogẽ, f ka baood n na n soke a yii yɛ n yaol n kʋ-a ye.” Tɩɩm ka be n toẽ n maag SIDAwã bãag ye, la tõnd n toẽeme t’a bãaga bil da yõk d ye. Wa-y tɩ d kʋ waafã t’a ra wa reng n kʋ-d ye! Neb miliõ pis-naas sʋk sẽn vɩ-b ne bãaga bila dũniyã pʋga, bãmb miliõ pisi la a nu n vɩ tõnd Afirik nin-sables tẽms wĩndga sẽn lʋɩtẽ. Nin-kãens sʋka, bãmb wʋsog meng n ka mɩ tɩ b tara bãaga bila. Tẽms kẽer meng pʋsẽ, nin-yend neb a tãab sʋk n tar bãaga bila n na n ki ne-a. SIDAwã bãag sẽn mii n yõkd neb niis n yɩɩda yaa kãmbã. Dẽe, kãmba ka le tar b ba-rãmbã; yaa rẽ n kɩt tɩ kɩɩbsa sõor ta miliõ piig la yiibu rũnda rũnna Afirik ka. Sẽn paase, tʋmtʋmdb sẽn tar pãng ka le waog zamaana pʋgẽ ye. Woto yaa sul sẽn be ãndũniyã pʋgẽ n zabd ne SIDAwã bãag koeese." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "A Zezi sẽn wa n bee dũniyã zugu, B wilga B nimbãanzoeer ne bãad dãmba la nãong rãmbã. B boonda B tẽedba tɩ b me maan woto. SIDAwã bãag yĩng kɩtame tɩ tõnd zamaana pid ne bãad dãmba la kũum." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Wẽnnaam boonda tõnd tɩ d tal yam. Wẽnnaam Sebra pʋga, B wiligda tõnd d sẽn tõe n vɩɩnd toto tɩ SIDAwã bãag bil da yõk-do wala tɩ tõnd maasem yĩng bɩ a bila da yõk neb a tãab ye. Yʋʋma sẽn loog sẽn ka kaoose, lɔgtor yir bãngdba maoome n na n gɩdg tɩ bãaga bil da yõk neb wʋsog Afirik soolome ye. Neb kẽer wɩsga b pãng n moon tɩ b rɩkd suudã b sẽn boond tɩ kapotã tɩ bãaga bil da yõk b ye. La d sã n mag n gese, d mikdame tɩ sor kãng ka wom biis sõama ye. SIDAwã bãaga bil kel n kẽnga taoore n saage. La sãn ya ne tẽng a yembr b sẽn boond tɩ Ougãnda, sor a yembre b sẽn boond tɩ ABC kɩtame tɩ bãaga bil pãng boog hal wʋsgo, sẽn yɩɩda kom-bɩtsa sẽn zems yʋʋm piig la a nu n tɩ tãag piig la a wɛ wã. Sor kãng rãmba (ABC) goma Wẽnnaam sebrã sagels yell wʋsgo, sẽn yaa tɩ ned fãa da bao pag sẽn deng a yikãadem, ned fãa maan sɩd ne a kãadentaaga la sãn ya ne b rãmb niis sẽn ka maan bãmb rãmbã, bɩ b rɩk suudã." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "SIL sẽn be Afirik ka kosa sebra soab noor n na n dɩk kibayã la maasem buud toor toorã n paas ne a sokdsã n maneg wa sẽn zems wa bãmb vɩɩma sẽn ya toto wã. Yãmb sãn ges sebra baasgẽ, y na yã seb kãense. 5 « Paulines Publications Africa » me naag n manega sebrã. Seb kãnga yaa tʋʋm teoog sẽn tõe n sõng nimbuiidã tɩ b bãng SIDAwã bãag ne a bila sẽn yaa a soaba, tɩ b kɩt t’a pãnga sa, wala kɩt tɩ b tõog n sõng neb niis bãaga sẽn zoe n tarã." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Karensaamba segd n talla seb kãnga ne a «Pok kibarã», n paas ne Wẽnnaam Sebrã sẽn gʋls ne buuda goama. Ka segd n yɩ wakat a yembr pʋgẽ bal la karensaamba na n zãms neba zãmsog a yembr ye. Zãmsog a yembr fãa segd n dɩka lɛɛr a naase n yaol n tõog tɩ sa. Zemsame tɩ a pʋɩ zãmsog a ye fãa zĩis wʋsgo n zãms nebã. Ad zãmsog a ye fãa sẽn segd n kẽn toto:" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Zemsame tɩ y sok sokdes niisa sẽn be seb kãnga pʋgẽwã sẽn na n yɩlẽ n sõng sulla t’a gom kibara b sẽ togsa yell sõama. Sẽn na n yɩlẽ n sõng sõas kẽere, karensaamba toẽ n pʋɩ karembiisa sul bõones pʋsẽ. Ges-y neba sõor sul fãa pʋgẽ. Naor kẽere, sulla fãa tõe n naaga taab n sõse ; la wakat kẽer me, a zemsame tɩ y le pʋɩ b sul bõonse, neb a naas bɩ a yoob yoobe, wala neb a yiib yiib menga." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Rôg-n-miki pʋge, Dagamb yaa tônd moose ma-bi-taase, tɩ b tar daare nina b sɩn boond b goam pʋge tɩ \"Adibo Dali\" (Adibo daare) ." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Adibo zabd-n-taare kânga da zaba Ya Na Andani II (Naam pâng soaba) naam wakata. Zabre kânga pʋge, German nansara ramba kam-bõanse taoor soaba yoore n da ya Lieutenant Valentine von Massow. Dagamba taoor soaba da ya Gbungbaliga naab nina sɩn yʋre da boond tɩ Kanboang-Nakpɛm Ziblim." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Badaare bɩ raar-n-kãnga la ragamb têng'a nɩ Dagamba fâa lebg German nansara ramba tẽn-yãmbga ne b neba." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yʋʋmd yʋʋm-rɩt kiuug rasem 31 daarã, Ararat-Armeniya wilgame tɩ b na n dɩk a Marcos Pizzelli, la yʋʋmd yʋʋm-rʋʋn kiuug rasem 11 daarã, a Ararat-armenia ne a Pizzelli wilgame t'a sẽn paam kibare yĩnga, a na n basa a fotballã." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yʋʋmd Febrary kiuug rasem a 1 daarã, Ararat-Armeniya wilgame tɩ b sigla a Yoan Gouffran. [1]" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yʋʋmd 7 kiuug rasem 23 wã, Ararat-Armenii wilgame tɩ b sigla Alemão ne Oliveirense." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yʋʋmd 7 kiuug rasem 25 wã, Ararat-Armeniya wilgame tɩ b na n paama Sargis Shahinyan sẽn yit Lori." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Yʋʋmd 7 kiuug rasem 30 wã, Ararat-Armenian wilgame tɩ a Gor Malakyan sẽn wa n bas a tʋʋmdã, a sã n wa bas a tʋʋmdã. [1]" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2018 yʋʋm-nif kiuug rasem 27 referendum n deeg tɩ b naan naan naan Ahafo. Sẽn yɩɩd 307,108 n da gʋls n yãk n na n yãk n yãk n kõ-a, b sõor yaa 277,663 la b sõor yɩɩ 276,763 (99,68%) n wilg tɩ b ratame tɩ b naan naan naan naan lebg n naan naan naan pʋga. Sẽn yɩɩd 675 (0.24%) n zãgs n deeg n pa kõ-a la b pa kõ-b n pa kõ ye. B naan naan naan sigr kiuug rasem 13 yʋʋm 2019 ne sigr kiuugã 114. [1] B yãka Goaso tɩ yɩ tẽng ning sẽn na n lebg tẽnga pʋga." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "A Ibrahim sɩng a politikã yʋʋm 2009 sẽn yɩ Ghana tẽnga sorã taoor soab yʋʋm 2008 wã. A yaa Ghana 4th Republic wã tẽnga taoor soab yʋʋm 2009 yʋʋmdã yʋʋmdã yʋʋmd kiuug rasem 7 soabã. A Ibrahim sẽn wa n wa n na n kao a tʋʋm pipi wã poore, a yãka yam n na n yãk a naam n na n yɩ taoor soab yʋʋmd 2013 wã, la a tõoga a Joe Danquah n tõog n kell n zĩnd a zĩigẽ. Yʋʋmd 2015 wã, a ra yaa tẽnga taoor soab n na n zab ne tẽnga taoor dãmb sẽn yaa tẽnga taoor dãmb la tẽnga taoor dãmb n na n maan b sẽn tõe n maan n tõog n yãk tẽnga taoor dãmb a taaba. A sẽn paam n deeg b rãmb a 6167 sẽn yaa 52.03% n yaool n paam a sẽn da zabd ne-a wã b rãmb a 5 660 sẽn yaa 47.76%." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "A Lamisi yaa nin-sabls sull ning sẽn ge National Democratic Congress. A sɩd a David Adakudugu ra yaa Tempane sullã doagd a ye. A sɩdã kũum poore, a yãka yam n na n ledg-a n yɩ member of Parliament a ye. Yʋʋmd 2020 yʋʋm-sar kiuugã, b yãka-a lame t'a yɩ Tempane member of parliament, a sẽn wa n na n yik n na n yɩ National Democratic Congress. A paamame n paam koees 20,939, sẽn yaa koeesã fãa 56.0%. A paama yãkr n yɩɩd Joseph Dindiok Kpemka sẽn yaa New Patriotic Party wã sẽn paam vote 16,462 sẽn yaa 44.0% ne koees nins fãa sẽn yaa sõma wã." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 yʋʋm-sar kiuug rasem 7 wã, b yãk-a lame t'a Boateng na n deeg n yãk neb 20 401 sẽn yaa 73.10% n yiis b sẽn yãk b rãmb 27 910 wã sʋka. Sẽn zems ne b sẽn yãkã, b wilgame t'a yaa tẽnga taoor soab sẽn yãk a soab n naan yɩ Bosome Freho sẽn be Ashanti tẽnga pʋga." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "B votame n yãk a Akwasi Konadu t'a lebg depite ramb soog neda n ko Manhyia North Ka-tẽnga puga ramba yʋʋm 2020 yʋʋm-soabg kiuugã pʋga. B wilgame t'a paama b pʋɩtbã pʋɩɩr n yaool n paam n deeg b sõor sẽn yaa 39 562 sẽn ya 69.9% t'a maood-n-taaga, a Hamza Swallah, sẽn yaa \"National Democratic Congress\" taoor soaba, be poorẽ, n paam n deeg sõor 15,943 sẽn ya 28.2%." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Yʋʋmd 1996 wã, a Bagbin paama vot 12,605 n paam Nadowli North gofneem naama ti yaa tênga neba 16,485 n da voti dɩ yalsa 76.46% tɩ Lawrence Banyen paam vot 2,213 soore tɩ dɩ yals 13.42% tɩ PNC neda Yuoni Moses Vaalandzeri paam 1,490 vot tɩ dɩ yals 9.04% nemboeru la Baslide Kpemaal n yaa NCP neda me paam 177 vota tɩ yals 1.07% neba n vota ." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2000 Ghana gofneem naam yakre wakato , a Bagbin da an kell n zĩnda tẽnga parliament wilga taoor soab sẽn yaa Nadwoli North wã pʋga .A da tõoga a na boore taaba ne vot ne sẽn yaa 9004 tɩ yals 58.60% n nan yê nemboera fãa pʋga tɩ da wilig tɩ a yẽera Dr. Anleu-Mwine D.B, n yaa a tõoren na baora, Clement Kanfuri Senchi m'be Peoples National Congress, Ningkpeng Pauline n yé New Patriotic Party, John Bayon Boniface Wetol, Domayele Marcel Aston n yaa National Reform Party of the United Ghana Movement ti o b paam vot n yaa, 2,089 voto, 718 voto, 145 voto la 0 votes n pʋglgi taaba ." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Yʋʋm 2004, o b sẽn da an na yâk gofneem naam Nadwoli tênga pugin, o da pue tênga sâgsa ayiib rɩ la Nadwoli nen-taoore la yaanga tɩ vota zĩi ya zĩi sa yiibu.A Bagbin n da an yaa ni-nenga b sẽn yãk a Nadowli nen-taoore tẽnga pʋga tɩ a lebg parliament wilga yʋʋm 2004 gofneem naam yakre wakata . A da paama vot 11,296 ne vot 22 349 sẽn zems ne 50.5% .Tenga nem-bʋʋra da yâk la me la o b bahi Clement K. Senchi n yaa People's National Convention, Daniel Anleu-Mwine Baga n yaa New Patriotic Party, Sasuu Bernard Kabawunu n yaa Convention People's Party, Bisung Edward n yaa Democratic People's Party la Dapilaa Ishak n yé independent candidate sulla . O b vot da yaa 625 voto, 5,297 voto, 152 voto, 188 voto, 4,791 voto n pʋg taaba ." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "B tõe n yãa gʋls-vɩɩs a to \"Tõndã gãagrã\" zugu, masã sẽn be Miilã, Poldi Pezzoli Museum pʋgẽ, n dat n yeel tɩ b gʋlsa a yʋʋmd 949 AH/AD 1542-3 wã: Yaa Ghyath ud-Din Jami sẽn maan ne yẽesem n tõog n maan tʋʋm-kãnga sẽn yaa sõma n noom tõnd yʋʋmd 949 wã." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Kasubi Tombs Digital Media Archive (creative commons-licensed photos, laser scans, panoramas), using data from a Skybucket 3D/Plowman-Craven/CyArk research partnership" },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Limõ wã tara fɩtokemikal wʋsg sẽn naag ne polyphenol, terpenes, la tannins. Limõ yũudã tara citric acid sẽn yɩɩd limõ yũudã bilfu (sẽn zems 47 g/L), sẽn kolg citric acid sẽn yɩɩd grapefruit yũudã naoor a yiibu, la sẽn kolg citric acid sẽn be orange yũudã naoor a nu." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "A toaaga dâan tilga yʋʋmde 1943 tõrge laloa modre 4190 SE/F kalse Côte d'Ivoire la 1944 kalse Guinea ramba ningi wã dâan reega mè ti ya bõn vulɩ fãa m'be koaaga yʋʋmde 1980.O b da lagme ma a fãa ti maane a yembre ti be bõol a World Heritage Site yʋʋmde 1981 Guinea la yʋʋmde 1982 Côte d'Ivoire" },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "McCoy, Mark D.; Alderson, Helen A.; Hemi, Richard; Cheng, Hai; Edwards, R. Lawrence (November 2016). \"Earliest direct evidence of monument building at the archaeological site of Nan Madol (Pohnpei, Micronesia) identified using 230Th/U coral dating and geochemical sourcing of megalithic architectural stone\" (PDF). Quaternary Research. 86 (3): 295–303. Bibcode:2016QuRes..86..295M. doi:10.1016/j.yqres.2016.08.002. Retrieved 30 October 2017." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Thomas Isidore Noël Sankara ( French pronunciation: ​[tɔma sɑ̃kaʁa]; 21 yʋʋm-sar kiuugu 1949 – 15 zĩ-likr kiuugu 1987) yaẽ Burkinabé sodaa taoor soaba. A yé Burkina Faso perzidã nya pipi yʋɩmde 1983 hali ni yʋʋmde 1987 la be da kʋwa." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Yeondeunghoe (Korean: 연등회; Hanja: 燃燈會; Korean pronunciation:[jʌnd​ɯ̽ŋɦø]) yaa kibay sẽn maan ne bugum-vɩɩs Korea, n maand a Buddha's Birthday rogem daarã. B wilgame tɩ yʋʋmd a naas kiuug rasem a nii wã yaa yʋʋmd a naas-n-soabã rasem a nii Korean Lunar calendar. Tãnd sẽn lebg n lebg n lebg tɩ \"Yondeunghoe\", \"Yeon Deung Hoe\", la \"Yeondeung Hoe\" wã yaa b sẽn gʋls tɩ \"Yoeung Hoe\". Woto me, gom-biis nins sẽn yaa \"Yeon\", \"Deung\", \"Hoe\" wã võor sẽn yaa to-to wã yaa toor-toore, tɩ b tõe n yeel tɩ \"Lotus Lantern Festival\" la \"fãnã yõogd ne bugum\"." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "\"Council of State met 36 times on new Regions - Nana Otuo Siriboe II\". GhanaCrusader.com - Latest News in Ghana and Beyond. 2017-08-16. Archived from the original on 2017-12-12. Retrieved 2017-12-12." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Alençon lace (UK: /ˈælənsɒn, æˈlɒ̃sɒ̃/, US: /əˈlɛnsɒn, -sən/) yaa point d'Alençon (French: [pwɛ̃ dalɑ̃sɔ̃]) sẽn yaa lace sẽn tar bĩis sẽn yit Alençon, Fãrens. Wakat ninga, b boond-a lame tɩ \"pãntã rĩm-poaka\". B sẽn sɩng n maand laas Alençon yʋʋmd 1600 soabã pʋgẽ wã, a Jean-Baptiste Colbert sẽn da yaa Louis XIV naaba, n lugl Royal Workshop tẽngã pʋgẽ n na n maan laas sẽn yaa wa Venetian-rãmbã yʋʋmd 1665 wã, kɩtame tɩ tẽn-kãng tʋʋm-noor paas tao-tao. Yaa sẽn na yɩl tɩ b tõog n kɩt tɩ goosneema wã pa le teeg tẽn-zẽmsã sẽn da tar ligd wʋsgã ye. A Marthe La Perrière n toeeme, tɩ Alençon lebg wa a sẽn da minim n maandẽ wã yʋʋmd 1675 soabã sẽnese, a Colbert sẽn da so a tʋʋmdã poore. B sẽn da maand-a wã ra yaa wa b sẽn na n maan-a ne zũnd-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zũndẽ, la b na n ning-a-la zĩ-zãrsẽ. A ra tara zũnd-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zãrsẽ, la zĩ-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zãrsẽ." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "A Alex Adomako-Mensah paama a MBA (UK) Leicester inivɛrsite wã, yʋʋmd 2001. A lebga Chartered Institute of Marketing (ACIM), UK yʋʋm 2003 la Chartered Institute of Marketing (UK) kõ-a-la zu-noog Chartered Management Institute (MCMI) yʋʋm 2006." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "A Alex Adomako-Mensah paama a MBA (UK) University of Leicester wã, yʋʋmd 2001. A lebga Chartered Institute of Marketing (ACIM), UK yʋʋm 2003 la Chartered Institute of Marketing (UK) kõ-a-la zu-noog Chartered Management Institute (MCMI) yʋʋm 2006." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Britannia ning sẽn da tar-a wã ra tara karẽngr sẽn tar nand-rɩt n paas nand-rɩɩm sẽn yaa b sẽn boond tɩ Nature, Industry, and Science wã, ne orangeeri sẽn be poorẽ wã (The Gardeners Dictionary, 1764) La nand-rιt sẽn da pak Europe nebã tɩ b lebg kolonialismã biis, b pa tõog n bɩɩs-a Erop ye, hal tɩ tãag a Pieter de la Court (1664-1739) sẽn wa n naan ne pis-kãnga zẽedã sẽn be Leiden tẽngẽ wã. Yʋʋmd 1719 wã, b yiisda nandã tɩɩs n tɩ kõ Angletã log-rãmba, la yʋʋmd 1730 wã, b kõ-b-la Frans rãmb. Angletɛɛrã, b yiisa pipi nandɩ-kẽeng Dorney Court, Dorney sẽn be Buckinghamshire wã, la b me me me me yidga \"ndɩ-kẽn-kẽenga\" sẽn na yɩl n paam tɩ b tɩgã tɩɩsã yʋʋmd 1723 wã, Chelsea Physic Garden. Yʋʋmd 1733 wã, b kõo rĩm a Louis XV sẽn be Fransã nand-a-laag Versailles. Rɩs-rɩsɩɩs soolmẽ wã, a Pɩɛɛr Kãsengã talla a de la Courtã manesem n wa Sankt-Peterbourg yʋʋmd 1720 wã. Yʋʋmd 1730 wã, b tall-a lame n kẽng a Anna sẽn yaa rĩm-poakã roogã sẽn be Moskovã." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Pãndã sẽn yaa bõn-naandã yaa koom sẽn yaa 86%, tɩ karbõidratã yaa 13% la proteɛɛnd yaa 0,5%, la a tara yĩn-gãong sẽn pa tar yõod wʋsg (taabl). B sẽn tar gram 100 n tarã, yaa nand-rɩt sẽn yaa kilojouli 209 (50 kilocalorie) n kõt rɩɩb pãnga, la yaa mangãne (40% daarã yõodẽ, DV) la vitamini C (53% DV) sor sẽn tar wʋsgo, la sã n ka rẽ, pa tar mikrotriins wʋsg ye." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Yʋʋmd 1986 wã, Etazĩni wã, b sãama Pineapple Research Institute wã, la b pʋɩ-a-la Del Monte ne Maui Land la Pineapple. A Del Monte talla '73-114' sẽn boond tɩ 'MD-2' n kẽng a plantãs sẽn be Costa Rica wã, n yã tɩ yaa sõma tɩ b bɩɩs be, la a sɩng n yiis-a pubɛɛr yʋʋmd 1996 n boond t'a 'Gold Extra Sweet', tɩ Del Monte me sɩng n talld '73-50' sẽn boond t' a 'CO-2' n boond t'\"Del Monte Gold\". Maui Pineapple Company sɩngame n wubd buud toor-toorã 73-50 yʋʋmd 1988 wã, la b pʋd-a-la Maui Gold. MPC sẽn lebg a pʋɩɩr soaba, a Hali'imaile Pineapple Company ket n yaa Maui Gold sẽn be Haleakala tãmbẽ wã." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": ") Gambang II – Companion bamboo xylophone" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Yʋʋmd 9 kiuug rasem 18 wã, FFA wã kɩtame tɩ Ararat-Armeniya sẽn be UEFA Europa League kibsẽ wã kɩt tɩ Ararat ne a Yerevan pa le beẽ ye. [1]" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Yʋʋmd 10 kiuug rasem 29 wã, Ararat-Armenian sẽn da rat n maan zabr kiuug rasem 31 ne Alashkert wã, b tõoga b ra-kãnga, bala b paama COVID-19 sẽn pa tar pãng ne a 4 wã. [1]" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Yʋʋmd yʋʋm-nif kiuug rasem 29 daarã, Ararat-Armenian wilgame tɩ a Dan Spătaru paama loogr tɩ b pa na n bas a FC Noah loogrã ye. [1]" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "When you are done editing the Wikipedia page and Wikidata item of an MP," },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "If you do not see any of the correct signs, yellow, purple and green by an item in the list or a facilitator adds next to your signature, then you don't get a point; in which case another participant can come around and work on it to claim the point for that entry, or you may go back to working on the entry, or try a different MP altogether." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "A Abdoul Kader Kobré yaa Burkĩna Faso futbã sẽn yaa karẽn-bi-poakã, sẽn yaa kãsm-bi-dibli Majestic FC la Burkina Faso futbã tẽn-tẽngã taoor soaba." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "A Abdoul Fessal Tapsoba (roogã rasem 23 yʋʋm 2001 soabã) yaa Burkĩna tẽnga b sẽn boond tɩ Burkina Faso tẽnga b sẽn dɩk n dɩk n kõ-a n kõ Ligue 2 tẽnga b sẽn yaa Amiens SC wã." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "A Tapsoba sɩng a karẽn-bi-laarã ne Ivory Coast klub a ye, ASEC Mimosas sẽn be Ivory Coast Ligue 1 wã. Yʋʋmd 2018 yʋʋm-paal kiuug rasem 28 soabã, a Tapsoba talla a pipi gool a sẽn da tar a klubã yĩnga, CAF Champions League pʋgẽ, a sẽn maan ne Mangasportã. A sẽn da wa n tõog n ta a 5 soabã, a ra yaa sõma n tõog n tõoge. Yʋʋmd 2019 sigr kiuugã, a Tapsoba ra rɩkda a meng n dɩk n kõ Belzjam tẽnga sẽn boond t'a Standard Liège wã, la a yɩɩ wʋsg ne b sẽn be n be n be wã. La sã n wa n wa n saaga, a Tapsoba paama lisg wakat fãa ne Standard Liège." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Bourget, Jacques-Marie (2014-04-20), Libye, 12 000 ans effacés au white spirit, Mondafrique, retrieved 2014-05-04" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Sɩpaolg kiuugu yʋʋm 2020 Ntim ni Kwame Asafu Adjei, King parliamentary primaire n kon Nsuta-Kwaman-Beposo Constituency ti Ntim dɩ. Sa- sik kiuugu yʋʋm 2020 ti Ntim tik nugu ta lebg Ghana neda. Nand t'a wa lebg Ghana tẽnga dooga ned a ye, a Ntim basa a tẽng-n-taarã United States of America sigr kiuug yʋʋm 2020 soabã. A dɩ yʋʋm- sar kiuugu yʋʋm 2020 parliamentary vote n yan vote 23,622 sẽn ya 71.7 kʋbg pugin ti NDC ned Newman Dapaah yan vote 9,321 sẽn ya 28.3 kʋbg pugin." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "A paama bill 5664 ne bill 9 275 sẽn yaa sõma. Sẽn na n yɩlẽ t'a tõog n paam 60.85% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Yʋm 2020 Gana vote yãkre wakata, Blankson bao Akrofuom depite naama n naag ne Joseph Azumah n ya NDC partɩ neda, la Prosper Maar n ya NDP partɩ neda.La'a paama vote yãkre 11,992 tɩ'a bilgri kob pʋge ya 58.51% tɩ Joseph Azumah paam vote yãkre 8400 la Prosper Maar me paam vote yãkre 103 tɩ'b vote yãkre bilgri kob pʋge ya 41.5% la 0.5% m pʋg taaba.Alan Kyeremanten dag kõ Alex Blankson Ghana Heavy Equipment Limited kasngo." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Agyekum ra yaa Ghani wã sor-wilgr yʋʋm 2012 wã pʋgẽ, a sẽn yaa a sẽn yaa b New Patriotic Party wã n tõog n paam n yãk a Mpohor tẽnga taoor soab ne vot 7114 sẽn zems ne vot 40 43%. A tõoga b sõor n zab ne tẽnga taoor soab a Anthony Bassaw sẽn deeg n deeg n deeg b sõor sẽn yaa 6,333 n kõ kõ a sõor sẽn ya 35,99% la a Mary Ankoman sẽn kõ a PPP wã a paam n deeg n kõ a sõora sẽn yaa 4,151 n kõ a soab a 23.59%." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2016 Ghana wã, a Agyekum leb n lʋɩɩse n na n paam a Mpohor tẽnga taoor lʋɩtb sull n paam a New Patriotic Party wã n tõog n yãk a naamã. A sẽn maan woto wã, a rɩka a naamã Ghana tẽnga pʋga. A tõoga b sõor n paam n kõ b sõor sõor sõora sẽn yaa 8,364 sẽn yaa 48,72% n yɩɩd a Eric Kweku Kyeremah sẽn yaa n kõ b sẽn yãk n kõ b rãmba wã sẽn yaa 6,947 sẽn yaa 40,46% la a Joseph Benedict Auby sẽn yaa PPP wã paama sõor sõorwa sẽn yaa 1,857 sẽn yaa sõor sõorã sõor sõoras sõor sõore sẽn yaa 10.82% wã. A yaa tẽnga taoor soab n yãk a ye n yɩ kom-bɩɩs, sports la kulturã taoor soaba n na n ges Ghana Football Association yellã yelle." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "A Tetteh lʋɩɩse Sefwi- Akontombra tẽnga pʋga, a sẽn da yaa a Ghani wã tẽnga taoor dãmb n yãk a soab yʋʋm 2016 wã, a sẽn paam n paam n deeg n deeg n yãk n yãk n deeg n kõ a soab a 11 922 n paam n yãk n kõ a soabã. B yãka-a lame n na n dɩ naam a Kenneth Yeboah sẽn yaa National Democratic Congressã taoor soaba.A Herod Cobbina sẽn yaa IND taoor lʋɩtb sull n yãk n na n lʋɩt taoor wã paama vot 4,108 sẽn na n yɩ 14,81% la b sẽn yãk n na n yɩ Convention People's Party n na n wilg tɩ b pa segd n maan b sẽn datã, b paama vot 81 sẽn yaa 0.29% n kõ b sẽn deeg b sẽn deeg n deeg b sẽn kõ wã." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2016 Ghana wã, a Abban ra paasa Gomoa West tẽnga pʋga. A tõoga ne vot 22 741 sẽn yaa vot 49.6% sẽn kõ wã, la a NDC taoor lʋɩtbã taoor lʋɩtb a Samuel Fletcher ra tara vot 21 004 sẽn kõ vot 45.8% sẽn kõ wã. A PPP taoor lʋɩtba a Charles Yawson ra tara vot 2086 sẽn kõ vot 4.6% sẽn kõ kõ wã, tɩ a Stephen Afriyie n yaa CPP neda ra tara vot 0 sẽn kõ vot 0.0% sẽn kõ wã fãa." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Cirio, Norberto Pablo (2008). A pa le wa be ye. ¿Qué es la música afroargentina?. A Federico Sammartino ne a Héctor Rubio (Eds.), Músicas populares: Aproximaciones teóricas, metodológicas y analíticas en la musicología argentina. Córdoba: Universidad Nacional de Córdoba, seb-neng 81-134 la 249 -277." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Carter, Benjamin (2008-01-01). Technology, Society and Change: Shell Artifact Production Among the Manteno (A.D. 800--1532) of Coastal Ecuador. ISBN 9780549646341." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Dead Cities wã yasa pĩiga zãllem vẽenem sẽn boond tɩ Limestone Massif wã. Yi kʋto bãmba monmere yaa 20--40 km (12-25 mi) yalenga la 140 km (87 mi) woglem. Massip wã tara yĩngri vẽenem sull-sulli rãmba tãabo: pipi rɩnda la wĩn-dɩtgosene Mount Simeon la a Mount Kurd sull-sulla; yiib sʋk sull-sulla la Harim Mountains (Tãn-bɛda); ti sẽn paas a tã yaa wĩn-goabg Zawiya Mountains (Tãn-bɛda)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "North East Region ya tẽng ninga n paasda Ghana temse piig la yoobe Ghana pugin tɩ be da yeese a yʋʋre nasaara wã kiuugu pĩig la yiibu 2018 yʋʋmde, tɩ da ya vote la b da maane n weleg North East Region n yeese Northern Region pugin.North East Region tẽng-zugu la Nalerigu.A tara sagse(districts) a yoobe (6).Tẽnga code ya +233,37." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "A Sarah Adwoa Safo ( sẽn dog sigr kiuug rasem 28 yʋʋm 1981 soabã) yaa Ghana Lawyer la politik soaba. A yaa New Patriotic Party Member of Parliament (2013 -2020) sẽn get Dome Kwabenya Contituency wã Greater Accra pʋgẽ. A yɩɩ Minister for gender, Children and Social Protection n tãag yʋʋm 2022 sigr kiuug rasem 28 tɩ Nana Akuffo Addo Danquah yiis-a." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Sẽn na yɩl n paam tɩ b lebg ko-ko-ko-kãnga, b tõe n zãgsda ko-ko wã tɩ yɩ sõma. Kẽer tõe n paama sẽk n yɩɩg n yɩɩg −1 °C la 2 °C (30 °F la 36 °F) ne koom sẽn yaa 90-100%; b tõe n maana woto n kaoosd n ta kiuug a yoob. B sã n tall-a-la ne zu-loees sẽn pa sõma ye, a tõe n kaoosame n ta kiuug a naas. [84]" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Zhusuan yaa bũmb sẽn tar yõod wʋsg ne Sɩn buud-gomdã. Zhusuan tara pãn-tusdg sẽn kẽed ne Siin tẽng ninsabls tẽnsa, wala Siin ninsabls tẽnsa minung, b goama, b sɛba, b remsgo, b meebã, n naan Zhusuan ninsabls tẽnsa. Wala makre, ⁇ Iron Abacus ⁇ (鐵算盤) makda ned sẽn tõe n sõd sõma; ⁇ Plus a tãab zemsa ne a nu n paas a nu la a zãag ne a yiibu ⁇ (三下五除二; +3 = +5 − 2) rat n yeelame tɩ yaa tao-tao la b yãk yam; ⁇ 3 naoor a yopoe zemsa ne 21 ⁇ wilgdame tɩ yaa tao-tao la yãgbre; la zĩis kẽer sẽn be Chine wã, yaa minung tɩ b wilg kambã b sẽn na n maan bũmb ning b vɩɩmã pʋgẽ daar fãa, n kõ-b bũmb toor-toor b sẽn segd n maan b pipi rogmã daarã, la b bas-b tɩ b yãk b sẽn na n maan n bãng b vɩɩmã sẽn na n yɩ to-to. Bũmb ning b sẽn da tarã ra makda yam la arzɛka." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "A Mante yaa logtoɛɛmb sẽn paam lisg ne Ghana Farmazi Rɩk la a yaa Ghana Farmazi Sosiete nin-yende. Yẽ yaa logtoɛɛmb sẽn paam lisg yʋʋmd 2010 wã tɛka. Sẽn sɩng ne yʋʋm 2013 soabã, a Mante tʋmda Kwame Nkrumah inivɛrsite sẽn get siãnsã la teknolozi wã tɩɩm wɛɛngẽ, la a yaa karen-saamba. A yaa Ghana Kom-bɩɩs sull taoor soab (2019 - 2022). Yʋʋmd 2022 soabã, b yãka-a lame t'a yɩ Global Young Academy taoor soab a ye. A paama a yiib-n-soab na-kẽndr yʋʋm 2023. A yaa taoor soab sẽn kẽed ne Gãna lekollã, la logtoɛɛmbã sull sẽn get b yell la b vaeesg yelle (a sẽn yãk yʋʋm 2023) la a yaa Gãna lekollã lekollã taoor soab sullã ned (2023 -2025). A Mante me yaa sull ning sẽn get ãnduni wã bãngdb tigr yʋʋm 2024. A Mante ra yaa ned sẽn nong karẽng la a ra get pagbã sẽn kẽed siãnsã wɛɛngẽ wã yell n na n sõng-b tɩ b kẽng taoor ne b tʋʋma." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-range", "text": "Martin Kares. \"Die Situation des Orgelbaus in Deutschland zu Beginn des 21. Jahrhunderts\". In: Die Orgel zwischen Gestern und Morgen. Bericht über das zehnte Colloquium der Walcker-Stiftung für orgelwissenschaftliche Forschung 23. – 25. September 2003 in Siegen. Veröffentlichungen der Walcker-Stiftung 18. Siegen: Universitätsbibliothek Siegen, 2011, pp. 14–15 (pdf) (in German)" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "B ra tara Burges Foot 18 sẽn da yaa b sẽn da wa n naanã n na n zĩnd Group C pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "B sẽn da wa n na n maan woto wã, b kɩtame tɩ b yiisd b sõor a taab sull a ye pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A Gazélec Ajaccio paama ligd sẽn kɩt tɩ b yiis b sullã n bas b sẽn be n be Championnat National 2 wã." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "B sẽn yãk b sẽn na n maan b sẽn tõe n tõog n tõog n paam n paam n tõog n bãng b sẽn tõe ne b sẽn tõe fãa n tõog n maan b toorẽ wã, b pa tõe n maan b mens n bãng b sã n tõe n maan bũmb sẽn yaa sõma ye." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A facilitator will review your edits and add next to your signature if a Wikipedia article you created or edited meets the contest rules." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A third facilitator will review both Wikipedia and Wikidata items and add . If both Wikipedia and Wikidata items meet the contest rules" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "A tẽedame t'a paoongã na n kõ-a-la vɩɩm sẽn kõn sa." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Zamaana pida ne pʋg-kõap la kɩɩbse sẽn ka mi b sẽn maandga. A Zezi boonda tõnd tɩ d ges b yelle." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Aleppo Galʋ tẽng Kʋdre - sẽn ya galʋ tẽng Kʋdre a lalsẽ wã la sags ne wa gell kʋdre lasa poorẽ - zĩiga yalma taa hɛktaar 350 mamsgo (akre 860; km² 3.5), t'a nin-buiida yɩɩd neb 120 000 sẽn vɩ a pʋga wakat fãa." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Cing sik sing (程式性; Jyutping: cing⁴ sik¹ sing³) – formulaic, formalised." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Heoi ji sing (虛擬性; Jyutping: heoi¹ ji⁵ sing³) – abstraction of reality, distancing from reality." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Sin ming sing (鮮明性; Jyutping: sin¹ ming⁴ sing³) – clear-cut, distinct, unambiguous, well-defined." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Zung hap ngai seot jing sik (綜合藝術形式; Jyutping: zung³ hap⁶ ngai⁶ seot⁶ jing⁴ sik¹) – a composite or synthetic art form." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Sei gung ng faat (四功五法; Pinyin: sì gōng wǔ fǎ, Jyutping: sei³ gung¹ ng⁵ faat³) – the four skills and the five methods." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Siu² Sang¹ (小生): sɩd-sɩd yaa kom-bɩɩga; b boondame t'a yaa karen-bi-bɩɩg." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Siu² Mou⁵ Sang¹ (小武生): Yaa yãagã n da yaa taoor soaba, la yaa tʋʋm sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩd." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Bãngr-goam nins sẽn tar neb a naas n yɩɩd n be level a yembr pʋgẽ wã yaa gãndb sẽn yaa toor-toorã. Wala makre, cincã zut pa piis-biis ye; b sã n get a cincã, b sõorã yaa tres la torre sẽn naag taab (3 + 2 = 5), tɩ level fãa yaa digd a nii n tõe n yã a zugu." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "A sẽn wa n be a Trump poorẽ wã, a paasa a sẽn da zĩ a poorẽ wã fot ye. B sẽn da wa n maand woto wã, b ra yaa neb sẽn da maand b sẽn da nong n maand bũmb ninsã. URL = http ➜" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Ghali (Pars: قالی, lit. \"karpet\"): karpet sẽn yaa kãsenga (190 × 280 cm)." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Maslaghan karpetã yaa bõne (120 × 180 cm), la b maanda b b sẽn boond tɩ b sẽn boond t'a karpetã, b maanda b sẽn boond n'a karpã bɩ b sẽn boond ne b sẽn boond-b tɩ b sẽn dat n maan n kõ-ba. B sẽn boond tɩ \"lobed Göl\" wã, b sẽn yã a sẽn yaa gãndã ne a sẽn yaa tãnga wã, la a yaa ne a sẽn tar bãnd-bõonegã. A Malayer, a Sarouk ne a Feraghan bee taab sʋka. B tũnugda ne b sẽn da yaa b sẽn da maandã ne b sẽn maandã." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Tẽns sẽn yaa kãenkãe wã pʋgẽ, roogã sã n wa lʋɩ n ta zĩ-kãense, a sã n wa kẽedẽ, a sãn ket n kẽedẽ n ta zĩiga, b tara rog-n-tɩr sẽn tar pãng wʋsg n kẽed tẽnga pʋgẽ. Bãagrã yaa sãnem-vɩɩs, b yaa toor-toore, b yaa pɛl-toore; b yaa samd 15-35 (6-14 cm) la b yaa samds 6-16 (2+1⁄2-6+1⁄2 in) sã n yaa yãadmã, b yaa wa lamend-roze, sãn-ka-bãanã toeemda tao-tao n lebg wa wa wĩndg sẽn yaa miuug sẽn yãgdã. La b sã n wa lebg kãnsãnga, b leb n lebga wa b sẽn yaa wa b sẽn pa mi b mensã. Bãada yaa b sẽn naan n naan n naan tɩ b yɩ wa b sẽn naan wa n naan n maan n naan n paam n paam n kõ-b-la b sẽn tõe n paam n deeg b mensã, b sã n yaa wa b sẽn boond tɩ \"bõn-vɩɩs\" wã, b tõe n maana woto, la b yũud-n-taase. Burã buud toor-toor sẽn yɩɩd 500 la b mi, tɩ wʋsg bɩt waoong wakate. La kẽer me kõta kood naoor a yiibu. A sã n wa bɩ, a rɩtame kiis a naas bɩ a nu." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Kẽerã ra beẽe tẽns wʋsg sẽn be zĩ-zãnga la Indus Valley wã yʋʋm tus la tus la yʋʋm. Intu, sẽn yaa Hindus la Indus tẽnga sẽn yaa Dravidien buud toor-toore, gomda a taab sẽn beẽe zĩ-zãnda zĩ-zãndã pʋgẽ wã yelle. [Wõnda sẽn pa tõog n bãnge] Bãngame tɩ b ra tarẽe-zãnda Arábi wã sẽn sɩng n sɩng yʋʋmd 2000 yʋʋm tus a yoob soabã sẽn deng a Zezi rogmã. Kẽer-zãnda wã yʋʋm tus a yiibu wã, dũniyã gill sẽn naan naan naan kogl-zãnda yaa tonni milyõ 8.5 (9,4 × 106 ton sẽn yaa sẽk), tɩ tẽns nins sẽn beẽẽe-zĩngr-zãnda la Afirik kiidã yaa tẽns nins sẽn naanã n yɩɩd nebã. Kẽer yaa \"tẽe-gãm-gãmdã la b yaa makd ne b sẽn maandẽ wã, la b yaa nin-tẽees sẽn beẽed ne b sẽn tũud a Zezi, b sẽn tũud b tũudmã la b sẽn tũud-b a Zezi la b tũudmã" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Dãtã biis yaa wa-wa-wa-wʋs-wʋsg, n tar sẽkã sẽn yaa cm 3-7 (1-3 in) la a yaa cm 2-3 (3⁄4-1+1⁄4 in) diameter, la b sã n bɩ, b yĩn-gãonegã yaa wa roog sẽn yaa miuug n yaa sãnem-yeldo, sẽn zems ne b toor-toorã. Dɩtã wã yaa kug a ye (dɩtã) sẽn tar sẽkã sẽn zems cm 2 ne a 2,5 la a zɩg sẽn zems mm 6-8 (1⁄4 - 5⁄16). Rɩk-rãmb a tãab n be: sẽn yaa yalem (misaal, Medjool); sẽn yaa yaamse (misaal: Deglet Noor) la sẽn yaa yaang (misaal yaa Thoory). [Tõnd sẽn na n tool-y neda]" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "Dɩt-palmã biis tara koom 21% la karbõidratã 75% (63% sukr la 8% fɛɛr sẽn yaa rɩɩb pʋgẽ), poroteen 2% la yĩn-gãong sẽn pa ta 1% (taabl). B sẽn tar gram 100 (3+1⁄2 oz) n tar tɩrɩ wã kõt-b-la kilojouli 1,180 (280 kilocalorie) rɩɩb pãnga, la yaa potasiyɔm sẽn yaa wʋsgo (b sẽn tar tɩrmã fãa yõod sẽn yɩɩd 20% bɩ b sẽn tar tɩrg n yɩɩd a ye) (22% DV) la b sẽn tar pantoteniik kisg, vitamini B6, la rɩ-n-tɩrsã mineral dãmba, magneziim la mangãne (10-19% DV), ne mikrɔgrɩntãr a taab sẽn yaa bilfã (taabl). mos_Latnmos_Latnmos_Latn be be be Karbõidã sẽn yaa pipi yaa karbõid-dãmbã, sẽn tar glikoz (23-30%), fuktose (19-28%), la polisaakariid sẽn pa tar karbõodã (7-10%) sẽn yaa biisã zɩɩm zãng. [34] A sã n tar sakaroze, a pa tar yõod ye.[35] mos_Latnmos_Latnmos_Latn be be be[34][36][37] Glycemic index (GI) sẽn be yam-yãkrã buud toor-toorã sʋka yaa 38-71, ne sẽn ta 53 wã, la yaa sẽn wilgd tɩ yam-yãkre yaa rɩɩb sẽn yaa tɩlɛ n tall yam-yãkgo.[34] Dãm-dĩm biis sẽn tar glisemã (GL) yõod sẽn yaa 9, sẽn get tɩ b rɩt-b biis a tãabo (grame 27) wã yaa 9, sẽn wilgd tɩ dãm-dã tara GL sẽn pa ta zĩigã. [38]" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "A paama a karẽn-saambã kaset yʋʋmd 2000 la a sẽn paam a karẽn-saambã (Basic Education) yʋʋm 2007 la a sẽn paam a karen-saambã (Leadership & Development) yʋʋm 2013." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Grossmann, Peter (1998). \"The Pilgrimage Center of Abû Mînâ\". in D. Frankfurter (ed.), Pilgrimage & Holy Space in Late Antique Egypt. Leiden-Boston-Köln, Brill: p. 282" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "B mii Ahafo soolmã tɩ yaa Gana bur koglgẽ. Tẽngã sẽn yaa to-to wã sõngda tɩ b yiisd rɩɩb la koodã. La b sẽn naanã yaa tẽn-kãsenga sẽn yaa kaako la kaako. [1] Yaa a Mim Cashew & Agric Products LTD sẽn be Mim, Ahafo. [1]" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Agyare da ân dogã Pramkese tênga wa. A zãar-ã MSC in PROCUREMENT & LOGISTIC MANAGEMENT lékolé bang'r kaseta ." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Yɛl sẽn yit b sẽn boond tɩ Ananas comosus var wã (d comosus (Linnaeus) B sẽn naan n yãgd Brazil la Paraguai wã; b sẽn naan tɩ b yãgd Azi wã, Afirik, Ostrali, Megizõ, Central Amerika, West Indies, Zu-soab Amerika rɩtgẽ wã, la tẽn-yũudb toor-toore sẽn be Pasifik koom-koglgã pʋgẽ. a sẽn yaa a soab bɩ a sẽn yaa b) a soab bɩ b) a soabã mikrostacyse (Mez) L.B.Sm. Koos-rɩka ne Paraguay, la a yaa a Ananas comosus var. parguazensis (Camargo & L.B.Sm.) Coppens & F.Leal Colombia, Venezuela, Brezil rɩtg, Guaiana, Frans Guaiana." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Syrian Ministry of Tourism Baba Antakya & Qennesrin" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Korke & Judith interview - Masters of Bachata 2016, b sẽn paam n yiis yʋʋm-sar kiuug rasem 10 yʋʋm 2022" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Holy F4k - Smallgod, Vic Mensa & Ivorian Doll Feat. Black Sherif & Kwaku DMC" },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "yaa Kenya so-pakda sẽn yaa pʋg-paalã sẽn tar dũniyã recordã sẽn be wã, ne a sẽn tar wakat sẽn be 2:09:56 sẽn be Chicago Marathon wã yʋʋm 2024 wã. A yaa 2019 wã dũni wã raab sẽn be maratoonã pʋgẽ, la a yaa Chicago Marathonã sẽn so naoor a tãabo, a sẽn tõog yʋʋm 2021, 2022 la 2024, a sẽn naan n tõog dũniyã recordã. Chepng'etich yaa pag ning pipi sẽn tõog n kao 2:11 la 2:10 gɩdgrã maratoonã pʋgẽla a me zãada pagbã sẽn tar zĩ-soaba sẽn yaa a yoobã n yɩɩd wakat fãa, a sẽn maan hal tɩ tãag sa-asa, minit a 4 la sekõnd a 2 sẽn da be Istanbul Half-Marathonã." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Chepng'etich ra tõoga pagbã sẽn da maandã karẽn-kẽndre, Istanbul Marathon yʋʋm 40 soabã pʋgẽ. A zoeesa 2:18:35, a sã n wa zoe km 10 n pa ta 31:59, a zoeesa km 15 n pa ta 48:15, a zoeesa a sẽn zoe wã wakat n pa ta 1:08:22 la a zoeesa sẽn pa ta 1:37:42 a sẽn pa ta km 30. A Chepng'etich sẽn maan yɩɩ yɩɩll sẽn pa tõe n maan ye. A yɩɩ yɩɩll ning sẽn pa tõe ne a pãng n maan Turki wã pʋgẽ. A Chepng'etich lebga yɩɩg-n-tʋʋmd 10 soabã sẽn" },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "A Chepng'etich sẽn maan Marathon 20 soabã, a kɩtame tɩ b tõog n tõog n maan sẽk sẽk sẽn kaoos sẽk a yiib, minit 17 la segond a nii. Yʋʋmd 2019 wã, a sẽn wa n be Doha, Qatar wã, a tõoga a sẽn na n maan dũniyã karengã ne a sẽn na yɩl n tõog n tõog n yɩɩg a sẽn na maan a sẽn na yɩ to-to wã. A Rose Chelimo sẽn da be Bahrain n paam sãnemde, a paama sãnemde 2:33:46, la a Helalia Johannes sẽn da be Namibia wã paam sãnemda, a sẽn da tar sãnemde. Chepng'etich wakat yɩɩ sẽn pa yɩ sõma n tõog n paam dũniyã naaba. Sẽn yaa to-to wã yĩnga, yaa 40 bal n wa n tõog n kẽng Doha." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2020 kiuug rasem 4 wã, a paama a tãab-n-soabã London Marathonã pʋgẽ. [1] Yʋʋmd 2021 Afrill rasem 4 soabã, Chepng'etich kɩtame tɩ b tõog n maan nus maratoon dũniyã record sẽn yaa 1:04:02 Istanbul Half Marathon wã sẽn be Turki wã, n bas a Ababel Yeshaneh sẽn maan sẽn yɩɩd a soab yʋʋm 2020 wã ne segond 29. A Chepng'etich sẽn da tar n yɩɩdã, a yaa pag a yoob sẽn yaa tao-tao n yɩɩdã sẽn zĩnd dũniyã gill zugã." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2021 kiuug rasem 10 wã, a tõoga a pipi tõogr dũni maratoon-kãsengã pʋgẽ, a sẽn tõog Chicago Maratoon-ã ne wakat sẽn be 2:22:31. [1] A ra bee tao-tao ne pipi pʋɩ-sʋk sẽn be 67:34, la a baas n yɩɩg-a lame ne a yiib-n-soabã sẽn be 74:57, la a kell n tõoga minit a yiib bal n yaool n tõoga." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2022 Chicago Marathon wã pʋgẽ, a Chepng'etich kogla a Chicago wã ne a sẽn tõog n tõog n tõog a naam wakat sẽn yaa 2:14:18, sẽn yaa minit a tãabo n yɩɩ sõma, la a sẽn yɩ a yiib-n-soabã pʋgẽ, la segs a 14 bal n yɩɩd a tẽng-bi-poak a Brigid Kosgei sẽn da tar yʋʋm a 2:14:04 wã. A Chepng'etich zoeesa sõor wʋsg n pa ta dũniyã record ning a sẽn da zoe n zoe n zoe wã ye. A zoeesa a pipi milyaar 10 ne a sẽn maan a sãndã ne a sẽn da tar a sãndã wakat 49:49. A zoeesa pipi sẽk ne 65:44 n yaool n zoees pipi sẽk n kaoos ne 68:34. A sã n tõog n tõog n lebg pʋg-paalã, a lebga pipi pag sẽn tõog n kao 2:18 wã naoor a tãabo." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2024 kiuug rasem 13 wã, Chicago Marathon wã, Chepng'etich kɩtame tɩ b tõog n tõog n tõog dũniyã record a ye, ne wakat sẽn ta 2:09:56. A tigs Assefa sẽn da zoe n tõog n kogl a 2:11:53 wã, n tõoge, n tõog minit a yiib n tãagã. [16] A sẽn maan woto wã, a lebga pipi pag sẽn zoe zoe n yɩɩd a 2:11 la 2:10 wã. A Chepng'etich yeelame t'a rɩka a dũniyã record n kõ a tẽn-tẽnga la a ra-rɩk-n-taarã soab a Kelvin Kiptum, sẽn ki yʋʋmd 2024 tʋʋlg kiuugã pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "sports-time", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2014 sɩngrẽ, a zoeesa minit 8:45.32 n tõog n zoe n kẽng Karlsruhe, n kẽng n kẽng n na n tõog n kẽng n tɩ tõog n kẽng tẽng a taabã. Rẽ poore, a kɩtame tɩ Nedɛland sẽn zoe n kẽng n tõog n tõog n kẽ n kẽng n ta n ta n tãag n ta n kẽng n tãag tẽng a taabã wã, a tõog n tõog tɩ yɩɩg n ta n tõog n ta n kao n tãag yʋʋm 2000 wã. A zoees n yɩɩ pipi minit 4 pʋgẽ n tõog n paam n yɩ a nu soaba Prefontaine Classic pʋgẽ, a sẽn maan wakat sẽn zems 3:59.38 pʋgẽ. A Hassan sẽn da wa n be Paris Diamond League wã, a ra tõoga a sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ning fãa n tõog n tõog n tõoge. A ra tũuda a Zeova ne a sẽn tõog n tõog Glasgow Grand Prix wã, n zãag a Abeba Aregawi. Yʋʋmd 2014 Erop wã wã, a Hassan paama sãnem 1500 m la sãnem 5000 m pʋgẽ. A sẽn wa n na n tõog n yɩɩ kãsenga, a paama a sãambã." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "A zĩnda Minister of Food and Agriculture tʋʋm kãnga hal t'a lebg rɩɩb la tẽn-gãongã ministɛɛr n na n dɩk a Clement Kofi Humado. A sẽn yaa ligd soab tʋʋmd da yaa a sẽn na n sõng Ghana tẽnga siglgã sẽn tʋmd ne koodã wɛɛngẽ wã tɩ b tõog n paas b toodã, b sẽn talld teedã importã, la b sẽn tallg b sẽn talldã. A ra ratame tɩ b kẽes b tʋʋmdã tʋʋmde, n kɩt tɩ b tõog n tʋm ne koodã. A sẽn wa n lebg so-pakrã ministɛɛrã, a Dzifa Ativor sẽn wa n bas a tʋʋmdã, a sẽn wa n wa n paam zu-loees sẽn kẽed ne GHS 3.6m busã sẽn lebg n lebg n lebg tɩ bĩngdã." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Madinatou Rouamba woglem ya 1.73m(5ft 8in) la a wẽed. A wẽem n ko a tẽng ramb ne bal sull yʋʋr m boond\"Etincelles de Ouagadougou." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Mango sẽn nan pa rɩ wã yaa ko-yũud 84%, karbohydrate 15%, poroteẽ 1%, la rasãnd sẽn pa waoog (table). Burkĩnd mangã 100g (3.5oz) pʋgẽ, a pãng yaa 250 kJ (60 calories). Mango sẽn nan yɩll pa tar vitamine C la folat bal sẽn yaa wʋsg daar fãa sẽn zemsã pʋgẽ, sẽn yaa 44% la 11% (table)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Ivanov, V; Koriakina, A; Savvinova, G. R. Anisimov (2018), \" Yakut kʋdemdã Olonkho sẽn yitẽ wã wɛɛngẽ\", Journal of History Culture and Art Research, 7 (1): 194 ⁇ 204, doi:10.7596/taksad.v7i1.1369Kirişçioğlu, Fatih (2003), \"Olonkho Metinlerinin Toplanması ve Araştırılması\", Türkiyat Araştirmalari Dergisi (Turkẽ), 1 (13): 227 - 233" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Yʋʋmd September kiuug rasem 9 wã, Ararat-Armenii wilgame t'a Jeisson Martínez sẽn yi Fuenlabrada poore, a na n paama a loogrã. [1]" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Karensaamba segd n zẽka a koɛɛg n karem kibara fãa, wala a kɩt tɩ karembiig fãa karem bilfu t’a to reege. Yãmb na n yãa kibarã sẽn be karensaamba sebrẽ n naag ne yãmb sẽn tõe n yã-a zĩig ninga karembiiga sebrẽ. Woto, karensaamba na n tõog n sõnga karembiisa tɩ b bãng zĩig ninga b sẽn bewã." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "B kos-a lame wala bűmb sẽn na n yãng b zooda ne taaba, t'a sõng t'a Pol lɛɛg n wa Zerizalɛɛm. Ra yaa bẽdgo la b gãneg yã n na n paam-a n kʋ sorẽ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "A Festus leok-b lame t'a Pol tog n paa Sezare la yaa be la yẽ meng lebd mars-marsã." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "A sẽn wa, Zʋɩf niyns sẽn yi-b Zerizalɛɛma gűbg-a lame n dogend a zugu, yɛl sẽn waooge la sẽn ya tagdo, b mens sẽn ka tar kaset t'a sɩd maaname ye." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "T'a Pol yeele: «Yaa Rom naaba bʋʋd la b na n bʋ maam; dẽn yĩnga yaa ka, pa Zerizalɛɛm ye. M ka maan bűmb sẽn wa ne Zʋɩf rãmba bõne, la y meng mii rẽ neere." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Yʋʋmd 2014yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuugã, karen-saamb Brama Traore,bool-a lame t'a wa zĩnd Burkina Faso tẽnga taoor dãmb taoor lʋɩtb sullẽ, 2014 African Nations Championship. ib wan yiisib lame ibin lue nkis" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "A ya ne m'be 'lands and Forestry' sul pʋge.N leb be sãnem la kʋra wã sul pʋge la leebgo sul-ramba pʋge." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "n kẽere Burkĩna Faso ya $1,900 daare a ye.Neb wʋsgo m be beẽ tʋʋm ya koob, ti neb bilfu be lozind tʋʋm pugin ni nasaar tʋʋm pugin,la a tẽn-gãoga ka kil n sakre kood wʋsgo." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "After beginning his career at Auxerre, he finished his development at Chelsea, and made his debut in a one-and-a-half-year loan at Vitesse in the Eredivisie. After a season in the Premier League with Chelsea, he was loaned back to the Netherlands to play for Ajax in 2016, and a year later signed for Lyon for €10 million." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "A Sit Kok Sin klasikã ra paamda HK$ 105,200 n paas yʋʋmd 2015. Roagdbã sẽn da tar yʋʋm 100 n paas n yã yãetẽ wã, b yãame tɩ b pa tõe n zĩnd ne b biigã n zĩnd ne tãnsã ye, sã n pa ne ligd sẽn yit Sɩngr Opera Tigeng ning sẽn boond tɩ Golden Will wã la a Wan Fai-yin sẽn boond tɩ Christina wã nengẽ ye." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "A Egyapa Mercer sẽn yaa parlamentã, a kẽnga a meng ne a nebã, n pids a pʋlemsã a sẽn maan a raasẽ wã. A sẽn da maan bũmb ninsã sʋka, a kõame kom-bõoneg a nu la a kõ-b-la a Sekondi sɛb-tokorã. Woto ra yaa sẽn na yɩl n sõng nebã tɩ b zãms b mens sõma. A sõngame me tɩ b lebs n yaoog sẽn da yaa Ghana Football Association ne Sekondi Eleven Wise, sẽn yaa diviziõ 1 tigis tigis tigisa sẽn be tigisẽ wã, ne ligd sẽn yaa GH¢5,000; b sẽn deeg a taabã yaoogame tɩ b lebs GH¢1,300 sẽn ketã n kõ-b tʋʋm-no-kãsemsã." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 1987 wã, b sɩngame n na n ningd bõn-vɩɩl b sẽn yãkd rɩɩbã la b sẽn zãad rɩɩbã to-to wã zug n ningd bõn-vɩɩl b sẽn yãkd rɩɩbã pʋgẽ wã. B sã n kõ-a demerit points a yoobe, a na n paama yaood sẽn ta US$400 (HK$2470). B na n kosa ned kam fãa ligdi, a sã n maan yel-wẽn-kãsemse, wala makre, a sã n ning teed sẽn yaa rẽgd rɩɩbã pʋgẽ. Ned sã n pa wilg tɩ b kõ-a-la lisensã, a na n paama ligdi, sẽn zems US$200." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Yʋʋmd 1987 wã, b yãka noy sẽn wilgd tɩ b segd n dɩtẽ la b yel-gɛtẽ wã. A 6 n kõ-b ligd sẽn ta US$ 400 (HK$ 2470). B na n sɩbga ned sã n maan bũmb sẽn yaa wẽng n yɩɩd a taabã, wala b sẽn kɩt tɩ bũmb sẽn yaa rẽgd wa kẽ ne rɩɩb pʋgẽ. Ned sã n pa wilg a sẽn kõ-a lisensã, a na n paama ligd sẽn ta US$ 200 la a na n sɩbg-a. [1]" },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Bõn- bɩʋʋngo kiuugu yʋʋm 2021, Henry yéla ta nan sõnga PSalm Adjetey Fio ni ligidi sẽn ya GH$ 1,500. Henry yéla ti kẽng minga di King déem ziigin Ghana pugin wan ki ta kon woto ligida." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "A ya Gana ned n ye pipi n di ¢8 million Rolls-Royce, la m meng sɩlga-kẽedga tɩ da base tɩ Customs Exercise and Preventive Service- ramb dag vɛɛs'a ne teed sana an paama." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "A Akwasi Konadu yaa Ghana politik soab la a yaa New Patriotic Party sull neda. A yaa depite soab nina sen yalsd Manhyia Ka-tẽnga pʋga (Anglindi: Manhyia North Constituency) ramb taore n-be be Ghana (Anglindi: Ghana) Santɛɛya soolmẽ (Anglindi: Ashanti Region), la a mi bee Ghana Republikã Naas (4th Republic) Parlament Sen Paasra Nii (8TH Parliament) wa pʋgẽ. Masa, yend yaa Ghana Water Company Limited taoor soaba." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "A Collins Adomako-Mensah yaa Gana politik soab la a yaa New Patriotic Party (Nouveau Parti Patriote) sull neda. A yaa depite soab nina sen yalsd Afigya Kwabre North Constituency (Ka-tẽnga pʋga) ramb taore n-be be Gana (Anglindi: Ghana) Republikã Naas (4th Republic) Parlament Sen Paasra Nii (8TH Parliament) wa pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "A Sophia Karen Edem Ackuaku yaa Ghana politik neda, la a yaa National Democratic Congress parti wa neda. A yaa depite soab nina sen yalsd Domeabra-Obom Ka-tẽnga pʋga (Anglindi: Domeabra-Obom Constituency) ramb taore n-be be Ghana Greater Accra Region), la a mi bee Gana Republikã Naas (4th Republic) Parlament Sen Paasra Nii (8TH Parliament) wa pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Gomado ra yaalsa Ghana naanẽ ning sẽn be Akan Constituency wa pʋga, n na n tõog NDC tẽnga taoor lʋɩtb sull pipi n yãk a soab. [1] Gomado tõoga Ghana tẽnga 2020 Sor-Wilgr wã (2020 Elections) n yalsa lʋɩɩsa, National Democratic Congress wã zugu n paam n deeg n yãk n kõ a ning sẽn deng n pa rat n tẽ wã sõor yaa 19,317 (58.69%) la a Alhaji Rashid Bawa sẽn be New Patriotic Party wã paama sõos 13,300 (40.41%) n na n zĩnd Ghana Republic Naas (4th Republic) Parliament Sen Paasra Nii (8TH Parliament) siglgã naabẽ wã pʋgẽ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "A Nialé rogame Bouko yʋʋmd 1962. A paama a BA seri C yʋʋm 1981 la a paama a magisterã sẽn yaa ekonomikã wɛɛngẽ ne a sẽn tõe n maan a zãma wã wɛɛngẽ wã Abidjan-Cocody karẽn-biis roogẽ yʋʋmd 1989. A paama a bãngrã diplôme ne Européen Centre pour la Formation des Statisticiens économiques dans les pays en développement (CESD) la a paama diplôme a paasg sẽn kẽed ne tẽn-tẽnsã ekonomikã la yirifãsã wɛɛngẽ wã, Pari wã Yuniõrbiis 1-Panthéon-Sorbonne wã. Yʋʋmd 1993 wã, a Nialé kẽnga International Monetary Fund (IMf) siglgã sẽn zãmsd b raabã wɛɛngẽ." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Big XII Fellowship, August 2008-June 2009" }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Rôg-n-miki pʋge, Dagamb yaa tônd moose ma-bi-taase, tɩ b tar daare nina b sɩn boond b goam pʋge tɩ \"Adibo Dali\" (Adibo daare) .",
        "Toog bee ne ned ning fãa sẽn tar paoogr la sẽn wɩt taaba,",
        "A lebga logtor yʋʋmd 1979 wã, a sẽn tar yʋʋm 27. A sẽn da wa n paam n deeg a Ba-biis a Dery sẽn da yaa katolik kiris-neb sullã saglg t'a ra bas b tẽng ye, a lebg n wa Tamale n wa sɩng a logtor tʋʋmd Tamale tẽnga logtorẽ wã. Baa a sẽn da rat n yɩ kambã logtorã, a sẽn da yaa bãadã paasa.",
        "Ramadan, Ragab. \"Funding issues threaten preservation of Christian sanctuary\". Egypt Independent. Al-Masry Al-Youm. Retrieved October 30, 2018.",
        "A Abdul-Salam kõ-a-la tõdgr wa tẽnga taoor soab sẽn na n yɩ New Edubease constituency yʋʋm 2021 yʋʋm tus a yopoe la a nii soabã.",
        "A Konadu yaa naong sẽn get naongã tõoge (Anglindi: Poverty Reduction Strategy Committee) la a leb-n be komitẽ ning sẽn getẽ bãagã wɛɛngẽ wã na-kẽndre sull.",
        "Alençon lace (UK: /ˈælənsɒn, æˈlɒ̃sɒ̃/, US: /əˈlɛnsɒn, -sən/) yaa point d'Alençon (French: [pwɛ̃ dalɑ̃sɔ̃]) sẽn yaa lace sẽn tar bĩis sẽn yit Alençon, Fãrens. Wakat ninga, b boond-a lame tɩ \"pãntã rĩm-poaka\". B sẽn sɩng n maand laas Alençon yʋʋmd 1600 soabã pʋgẽ wã, a Jean-Baptiste Colbert sẽn da yaa Louis XIV naaba, n lugl Royal Workshop tẽngã pʋgẽ n na n maan laas sẽn yaa wa Venetian-rãmbã yʋʋmd 1665 wã, kɩtame tɩ tẽn-kãng tʋʋm-noor paas tao-tao. Yaa sẽn na yɩl tɩ b tõog n kɩt tɩ goosneema wã pa le teeg tẽn-zẽmsã sẽn da tar ligd wʋsgã ye. A Marthe La Perrière n toeeme, tɩ Alençon lebg wa a sẽn da minim n maandẽ wã yʋʋmd 1675 soabã sẽnese, a Colbert sẽn da so a tʋʋmdã poore. B sẽn da maand-a wã ra yaa wa b sẽn na n maan-a ne zũnd-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zũndẽ, la b na n ning-a-la zĩ-zãrsẽ. A ra tara zũnd-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zãrsẽ, la zĩ-zũnd sẽn be zũnd-zãrsẽ.",
        "A Hottordze yita Mafi- Kumase. A paama MBA Cape Coast University wã la a paama M.A. ne Social Studies University wã.",
        "A kẽ Ghana depite-rãmb-sooga pʋg yʋʋmd 2008 tɩ o b da ân yãk a Deputy Attorney General yʋʋmd 2003. A da ân lɛta tõolg tozĩi ministr a yebu n ye minisri taor soaba Ghana Upper West Region soolme wa yʋʋmd 2004 hal n taag yʋʋm 2006 la ministr m'be bʋ-kaore zĩiga yʋʋm 2005 hal n taag yʋʋmd 2007 . Hon Dery da ân lebg n ya Deputy Minority Leader n ye Parliment m pãas-ã nu Ghana tênga.",
        "\"Ministry of Tourism, Syria: Aleppine House (in Arabic)\".",
        "A angklung yaa musical instrument sẽn yit Sundanese people nebã sẽn be Indonesia wã sẽn maan ne bamboo tub sẽn yaa toor-toore. B sã n wẽe, b sãnda b sẽn na n maan bũmb n kõ-b pãng n wa kõ-b la b makd-b ne a yopoe wã, wa b sẽn maand ne tẽns a taab pʋsẽ wã. B sã n wẽe, b sãnda b sẽn na n maan bũmb n kõ-b pãng n paasdẽ octaves, la b sãndã yaa wa b sẽn maand ne nug-rãmbã \"handbells\". A rɩtda a nug a yembr n gãd a gãagã, tɩ a nug a to wã wã tãag instrumentã n kɩt tɩ b wʋme. B sẽn da maand yɩɩl toɛy-toɛyã, b fãa ra tara sor n na n yɩɩl yɩɩl a yembr bala, n wa kɩt tɩ b yɩɩl a ye wã wa wa wa n yɩɩl wakat sẽn zems tɩ b tõe n yɩɩl sõma (Ges-y Kotekan).",
        "Mwinkaara yé Charikpong m'be nen-taoore tênga Ghana pugin. A kẽng lékolé yʋʋre n bôon St Anthony's primary school la kẽng tãor n ti lèb n zam's lékolé bang'r Tuolu Senior High School. A sɩn yé bé a légb n kêngà University of Ghana, Legon, bé la a sâ la a déég a kaset n taar Bachelor of Science Degree bé Health service administration.",
        "A Azerbɛdjɛn soolmẽ wã, a Ashigã sẽn maand yɩɩl to-to wã yaa toor ne a sẽn maandẽ. Wala makre, a Ashig fãa sẽn makd Ganja, Kalbajar, Gazakh, Tovuz la Borchali soolmã nebã pa yembr ye. A kelgdame tɩ b minimã yaa toor fasɩ. Naoor wʋsgo, b sã n wa maand a Ashig yɩɩl, b tũuda balaban-tʋʋmd soab la b tigim-n-tɩrsã, la b getame tɩ Ashig yɩɩllã yaa Azeri saz. A Ashigs sẽn yaa naanegã tõe n yɩɩ toor-toorã:",
        "B yãka-a lame n na n yɩ tẽnga taoor soab yʋʋmd 2009. B le yãka-a-la yʋʋmd 2013 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem 7 daare. Yʋʋmd 2016 wã, a paamame t'a paam sɛba fãa sõor sẽn ta 53,15%. A leb n paama yãkr 2020 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuugã sasa, a sẽn paam votã fãa 48.67%.",
        "\"Cádiz, a Bachata sẽn be dũniyã gill zug reemã pʋgẽ wã\". Diariodecadiz.es Yʋʋmd 2012 zĩ-likr rasem 27. B paama seb-kãngã sigr kiuug rasem 20 yʋʋm 2015.",
        "Sẽn paase, b wa n kẽnga zĩis a taab sẽn be Asia soolmẽ wã, sẽn yɩɩd fãa Indochina la Indian soolmẽ wã. Bãngdb kẽer wilgame tɩ b ra mi-b lame tɩ b ra rɩta tɩɩg sẽn yit Kot Diji sẽn be Pakistan. Asia yaanga yaa tẽn-bãngr sẽn yaa kãseng n yɩɩda. Africa tẽnsa pʋsẽ, b yãta bõn-vɩɩs buud toor-toore, tɩ wilgdẽ tɩ b sɩng n kood-b lame.",
        "Bassirou Compaoré, ya sẽn dog yʋʋmd 1998 tʋʋl kiuug rasem 23 wã yaa Burkĩna tẽnga b sẽn boond tɩ Burkina Faso tẽnga b sẽn be n be n be ne Sipãnd tẽnga klubã, a Rayo Majadahonda, sẽn yaa b sẽn be b taoorã.",
        "A Bertrand Isidore Traoré( 09/09/1995) yaa Burkĩna futbã sẽn yaa taoor soab bɩ nug-rɩtg n be Premier League klub a",
        "A Sankara taoor-sobend sẽn zĩnd yʋʋmd 1983 n tãag 1987, a Compaoré yɩɩ a poorẽ soaba, la a yaa Nasyonal Révolutionnaire Council ned. A yɩɩ tẽnga minisr a taoor-sobenegã pʋgẽ, la a wa n yɩɩ tẽnga minisɛɛr sẽn get tɩrlmã.",
        "Bono soolmã yaa Gãna soolmã naan-dãmb 16 sʋka. Yaa sẽn ket n be Brong-Ahafo soolmã pʋgẽ wã n kɩt tɩ b naan naan Bono East la Ahafo soolmã. [1] Sunyani, sẽn boond tɩ Ghana tẽnga sẽn yaa bilga, yaa tẽng-bĩngr tẽnga. [2] [3] Sunyani tõe n talla wuk-m-meng n yeel tɩ yaa tẽnga sẽn yaa sõma n yɩɩd tẽn-kãsemsẽ la tigis-kãsemse zĩiga.",
        "La a Bandé sẽn da wa n be be Anderlecht zabrẽ wã, a gãe a gãagã kõ-a-la a gãag n kʋ a gãag a gãaggã.",
        "Burkĩna Faso le tara province ramba 45,dila;",
        "A Zeova Kaset rãmbã sẽn da nong a Zeova wã, b sẽn da nong-a wã yaa a Zeova Kaset rãmbã.",
        "Pipi wã yaa b sẽn gãneg-a bãnd n gãneg b nugẽ, la b rɩkd-a n tãood sorã zug n maand reemã. Sẽn pʋgl-bã yɩɩda bãmbã, la b get-b-la wa bũmb sẽn be yamleoogo. Yaa ne nus a yiibã bal la b tõe n wẽ. Wakat-wakate, b leb n peebda tãb-biis a taab me: \"macú\" la \"sopipa\". B yiibã fãa yaa tɩɩg gãn-kãnga, pipi wã b sẽn gãneg n gãneg tẽnga, bala a yaa gãn-kãnga sẽn yaa kãseng n yɩɩdã la sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩdã; la \"Sopipa\" wã sẽn yaa bilf la sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩdã, b gãneg-a-la b nugu, bɩ b gãneg-a-la b naowã sʋka.",
        "Dou¹ Maa⁵ Daan² (刀馬旦): Yaa bi-bɩɩg sẽn yaa sodaas tʋʋmde.",
        "Sulli:Wiki World Heritage Intangible Contest for Moore 2023",
        "Contrafort (\"bõonegã\"): b sẽn pa tõe n maan bũmb n sõng ned t'a pa le tõe n maan a sẽn datã.",
        "Newton, Michael & Cheape, Hugh (n.d.) \"The Keening of Women and the Roar of the Pipe: From Clársach to Bagpipe, ca. 1600–1782\". available via academia.edu Archived 25 April 2022 at the Wayback Machine .",
        "Colosi, Francesca; Malinverni, Eva Savina; Trujillo, Francisco James Leon; Pierdicca, Roberto; Orazi, Roberto; Di Stefano, Francesco (August 2022). \"Exploiting HBIM for Historical Mud Architecture: The Huaca Arco Iris in Chan Chan (Peru)\". Digital Heritage. 5 (3). doi:10.3390/heritage5030108. ISSN 2062-2082.",
        "A karãrã pʋgẽ, b naan n maana bõn-kãens a nii n yãk b sẽn na n maan to-to (rãmb a nii la pagbã n yãk a yembr). Neb a yiib bɩ neb a taab sẽn boond tɩ asociaciones (tʋʋmd tigims) n zabd ne taaba. Nebã tõe n yɩɩ tẽns, tẽns la tẽns taoor dãmb n zabd ne taaba. Neb nins sẽn be be zab-n-taarã tara b sẽn tõe n maan to-to wã la b sẽn tõe ne b sẽn maand to-to to wã. [1] [2]",
        "Rũndã-rũndã, b tũnugda ne b sẽn maand b sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ninsã n manegd b zʋgdã. Sɩngr kiuugã la yʋʋm-paalã sasa, Sɩngr nebã wʋsg manegda b meng ne b meng seb-vẽndẽ wã n wilg b sẽn nong-b n na n maan bũmb ning. B leb n dɩka b teedã n maneg b yiri, b yiri, fɩtlã la fɩtl-rãmbã, la b kõt-b-la kũun wʋsgo. Sẽn paase, b sã n ning b seb-vẽngã n ning-a noorẽ wã, b makda sũ-noog. Nin-kãensã sẽn maand woto wã na n manegda b zakã ne b zu-loees nins b sẽn maandã. Rũndã-rũndã, b sẽn yãkd b sẽbgã yaa b sẽn na n manegd b mens ne bũmb ninsã. B sẽn maand woto wã kɩtame tɩ b tõe n maan n kõ nebã kũunã, wall b tõe n kõ-b-la kũunã. B yetame tɩ b sã n ning b seb-n-taagã wall b sẽn ning-a-a-la a noorẽ wã, b na n kɩtame tɩ b paam sũ-noog wʋsgo. B ra tũnugda ne seb-sɛgdb n yãkd b toor-toorã, sẽn yɩɩd fãa b sẽn da maand b sẽn dat n modgd b teedã la b sẽn maand b sẽn boond tɩ laakã. Kom-bɩɩsã tũnugda ne b sẽn da tigim b sebrã ne b teedã n manegd b sebrã.",
        "B kõo koom-koglgã sẽn yaa b sẽn naan ne b sẽn naanã b sẽn tõe n tall-a n yɩɩd b sẽn naan n naan ne b tɩbã. Bãngrã sẽn yaa b sẽn tõe n maan n kõ b sẽn tõe fãa n tõog n tall b sẽn tõe to-to wã, b segd n maana b sẽn tõe tɛka. Tẽns a taabã fãa pʋsẽ, sẽn tar n dat n togs tɩ b yaa gãndb, b yaa gãnda, la b yaa gãmba. Hal tɩ ta rũndã, b ket n maanda koom koglg sẽn yaa bilfã ne tɩɩs n na n maan tɩ logodo.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2005 yʋʋm-paal kiuug rasem 13 wã, a Compaoré sẽn yaa CDP taoor soab n yãk a naamã, a paama vot wʋsg sẽn yɩɩd a soabã. Yʋʋmd 2007 wã, yʋʋm-vẽk kiuugã, b yãk-a lame t'a na n paam pʋ-tẽer a 73 wã.",
        "- David Peñalosa Neb wʋsg sẽn zãmsd b buud-gomdã sakda n deeg tɩ b tõe n yãa rumba wã yẽbgr Havana la Matanzas soolmẽ wã yʋʋmd 1880 wã. Solares wã, b sẽn boond tɩ kuarterías wã yaa ro-kãsems sẽn be Havana la Matanzas tẽn-kɩremsã pʋga. Rumba wã sẽn sɩng ne Malanga n ta Mongo Santamaría wã, b ra zẽka b rãmb wʋsg n boond tɩ solares. Yʋʋmd 1886 wã, b sẽn yiis yembdã Kiba, b boola nin-buiidã tɩ b lebg nin-tɩrsã. B ra boond-b lame tɩ negros de nación. Yaa gom-biig sẽn be rumba yɩɩlẽ wã pʋgẽ.",
        "Mellish, Liz; Green, Nick, eds. (2020a) [20 July 2020]. \"Danubi tẽngre Călușari\". Eliznik.",
        "A Dan Kwaku Botwe rogame yʋʋmd 1958 tʋʋlg kiuug rasem pisi-la yoobe Ghana sẽn be Eastern Region wã. A yaa Abiriw Akuapem neda. A kẽnga Presbiterians Primary la Middle School sẽn be Mabang sẽn be Ahafo-Ano zĩiga, Ashanti soolmẽ wã. A paama a GCE minim minim minim kaset Kumasi Akademi wã pʋgẽ, la a paama a GSE minim minim minim minim sebr Achimota School wã pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 1977. A paama Sɩnd la Teknolozĩ wã Kõosneem sẽn boond tɩ Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology wã pʋgẽ n na n paam Sɩndã diplôme.",
        "A David Vondee le paama tõoge 2020 Ghana nin-buiida fãa yãkr pʋgẽ, a sẽn paam vot 21,416 n lebg n kẽe Ghana na-kẽndr a nii soabã (8th) sullã pʋgẽ, a sẽn paam n zab ne a Ebenezer Obeng Dwamena sẽn yaa New Patriotic Party wã sẽn paam vot 19,594 (47.2%) la a Samuel Kofi Essel sẽn yaa GUM wã sẽn paam vot 541 (1.3%).",
        "B tõe n yãa yɩɩl sẽn wõnd woto Erop yaanga la Balkans soolmã fãa. Balkans tẽns kẽere, b boonda mizik kãnga tɩ scaros bɩ scaru.",
        "Ablah Dzifa Gomashie ya Ghana paga kʋʋsa ni avõka politik ned. A ra ya Depite Minisri n kon gõodem National Democratic Congress ( NDC) pugin yʋʋm 2013 hali ni yʋʋm 2017 di Saha la John Dramani Mahama da ya perizidã. Duma a ya depite rãmb soog n kon NDC Ketu goabg baobgo Constituency n lan ya Naa paga Aflao tẽng bila.",
        "A yaa tẽnga taoor soab yʋʋm 2012 wã, a sẽn da wa n zab n zab ne a Victor Okaikoi sẽn yaa a New Patriotic Party wã. A Vanderpuye ra tara bas-yard wʋsg a sẽn tõe n paam n tõoge. A wilgame yʋʋmd 2012 yʋʋm-rɩt kiuugã tɩ a sã n paam n pa paam n ta votã pʋɩ-sʋk a 65%, a na n kõ-a-la a Okaikoi. A Vanderpuye tõogame n paam n yãk n yãk n kõ a Okaikoi wã, n paam n kõ a Vanderpuie wã, n kõ a Okoikoi wã n paam n deeg n kõ a Okikoi wã. A Vanderpui wã paama n kõ a Konvensã nebã sull ning sẽn boond t'a Emmanuel Odoi wã n paam a vot n kõ a soabã. Yʋʋmd 2016 yʋʋm-rɩt kiuugã, b kell n yãka a Odododiodio tẽnga pʋga, n yãk a soab tɩ b yãk a soab n yãk a soabã. A paama boto 36 606 sẽn yaa 57.04%, la a sẽn yaa a soab n pa tõe n yãk a ning sẽn yaa a soabã, a sẽn yaa Paalgã sull ning sẽn yaa n yãk a soaba, n yãk b ning sẽn yaa 26.671 n yãk a taabã, n yãk 41.56%.A yaa tẽnga taoor soaba la tẽnga taoor soaba, la a yaa tẽnga taoor soab la tẽnga taoor soab.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2012 wã, a leb n paama naam sull a ye pʋgẽ. B yãka-a-la ne koees 27,526 sẽn yi koees 35,221 sẽn zemsã sʋka. Rẽ zemsa ne 78.15% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã. B yãka a Robert Bennett Forkuoh sẽn yaa National Democratic Congress la a Kojo Ego Ayeboafo sẽn yaa independent candidate.B paama vot dãmb 6,226 la 1,469 sẽn zems taaba B yɩɩ 17.68% la 4.17% sẽn zems ne koees nins fãa b sẽn wã.",
        "Geser kẽnga Sɩngr tɩ b kẽ kãadem ne Sɩngr naaba.",
        "Penick, Douglas J (1996). Yaa rĩm a Gesar sẽn yɩ zab-zabd yɩɩlã. Boston, Masasusɛt: Wisdom Publications. ISBN 978-0-86171-113-0 . A sẽn da yaa ninsabls tẽnsa taoor soaba.",
        "A Opoku paama yãkr pipi n kẽ tẽnga na-kẽndr sull a tãab-n-soab sull a naas-n-soab sullẽ wã, a sẽn yɩ Asunafo South sullã na-kẽndr sull sullẽ wã. Baa ne a sẽn kong a zĩiga yãkr ning sẽn pʋglã pʋgẽ wã, b le yãka-a-la tẽnga taoor soab kiuug rasem a 7 yʋʋm 2013 soabã, a sẽn paam tõogr yʋʋm 2012 Ghana nin-buiida fãa yãkrẽ wã n na n yɩ Asunafo South sullã taoor soaba, la a tʋm n tãag yʋʋm 2017 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem a 6. Rẽ poore, b le tũusa a soab yʋʋm 2017 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem a 7 yʋʋm 2016 Ghana tẽnga nin-buiida fãa yãkr poore.",
        "FESTIMA me tara seminar dãmb sẽn gomd yɛl sẽn yaa pĩnd wẽndẽ la buud-goamã yelle, kibayã pʋɩɩrb, kambã zãmsgo la sok-kẽeng wɛɛngẽ.[2][3][7]",
        "“Les Pastoretes” (Bɩ b yãag bi-bõoneg ne kom-bõone sẽn yeelg b toorẽ futu n ki.",
        "B gʋlsa-a-la UNESCO ninsabls tẽnsa pʋɩɩr sẽn ka tõe n bãng n bãng n gʋlsã pʋgẽ yʋʋm 2020 yʋʋm-sar kiuug rasem 17 UNESCO Intergovernmental Committee for the Safeguarding of the Intangible Cultural Heritage tigsgẽ. Wala tẽnga sẽn kõ sorã, Finnish Heritage Agency rɩka sard n na n lagem ne Finnish sauna zãma wã la sauna ninsabls tẽnsa, n na n kogl sauna rog-n-mikã yõodo, la a wilg a yõod sẽn yaa to-to la a yɩ sõma wã. Estonia tẽnga sẽn be UNESCO ninsabls tẽn-kɩremsã pʋga, yaa sɩgaar sauna sẽn sɩng ne yʋʋmd 2014 wã.",
        "A Francisca kẽe lekoll a tãabo a sẽn da zãms bũmb ning sẽn yaa pipi la pipi wã pʋgẽ. A kẽnga Mamponteng Roman Catholic School, n yaool n kẽng Breman Revival Preparatory School la baasgo, a kẽng Supreme Savior International sẽn na yɩl n tõog n paam n sae a karen-dooga yoob a pipi sekollã. A wa n paam n sa a Junior High lekollã Angel Educational Complex pʋgẽ.",
        "A Hannah Montague sẽn yaa bi-bees sẽn be New York wã, n naan n yiis a sɩdã fu-rɩtgã. A sẽn da wa n dat n peeg a sɩdã fuugã fãa wakat fãa, a kaooda a sɩd fuugã n yãk a sẽn na n peeg-a wã n kɩt tɩ b gãd a fuugã. A pa wa n paam n bãng tɩ fuugã pa tar yõod hal tɩ yʋʋm 1930 wã ye.",
        "Kugo (箜篌), yɩɩl sẽn tar zũnd sẽn da be pĩnd wẽndẽ wã, la sẽn pa kaoos la b vʋʋgame",
        "\"Nearly 70 elephants slaughtered by poachers at national park in Africa: officials\". New York Daily News. Tronc. 13 June 2014. OCLC 9541172. Retrieved 6 October 2017.",
        "A George Oduro rogame yʋʋmd 1965 kiuug rasem 10 daarã, a yita Atobiase, Ashanti soolmẽ. A paama a Bachelor of Science degree (Sciences) sẽn kẽed ne tʋʋm la tʋʋm zãab wɛɛngẽ Ghana Institute of Management and Public Administration (GIMPA) yʋʋmd 2013. Yʋʋmd 2015 wã, b paama b magisterã sẽn boond tɩ MBA sẽn yaa tẽn-zẽmsã raab wɛɛngẽ Analt Yuniõasẽ wã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2020 Ghana nin-buiidã yãkr sasa, a le paama sull ning sẽn get \"Abuakwa North Constituency wã ne vot dãmb 17,653 sẽn yaa 53.2% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã, tɩ NDC wã taoor soab a Charles Yeboah Darko paam vot dãmb 15,551 sẽn yaa 46.8% ne koees nins fãa b sẽn kõ wã.",
        "A tɩɩsã na n yɩɩga tɩɩs sẽn tar tɩɩs n tar tɩɩs sẽn yaa wa tɩɩs la b tar tɩɩs-rãmba. A sã n yaa wa roog bɩ a yaa wa bugum, a yũuda wa roog sẽn yaa wa roogã.",
        "B yãka manesem sẽn na yɩl n welg LFS- ne LFS+ bõn-buudã sõma, sẽn tũud ne masa spektrometri, la sẽn tõe n sõng-b tɩ b tall b meng n tall bõn-buudu wʋsgo. B leb n tũnugda ne gas chromatography n mak bõn-buuda sẽn tar lacrymatory faktorã. [50][51] Yʋʋmd 2018 sɩngrẽ, Bayer yiisga pipi bõn-buud sẽn tar LFS-silenced ciib sẽn be koom-koglgã pʋgẽ, n boond tɩ \"Sunions\". [52] B ra yaa yʋʋm 30 sẽn zĩnd b sẽn da tar b mens n dogd taaba, la b pa maan b toor-toor ne b yagensã ye. [53][54][55]",
        "Three Moons of Biyangdo, A sẽn yi n na n yiis yʋʋmd 2022 wã, yaa kaset kaset a tãabo sẽn gomd kom-bi-pogs a tãabo a Kyung-Mi, a Geum-Mi la a Jeong-Mi yelle. B sẽn tar yʋʋm 60 wã, b yaa b yagensã a ye. Dɩt-gʋlsd: Lucy McIntosh ne a Jon Cleave. A Jon Cleave ne a Jay Kim n yiisd filimã.",
        "Yʋʋm piigã sẽn pʋglã pʋgẽ, sullã lebga siglgã babg a ye, la a ra modgdame n teend koosdbã sẽn dat bũmb ningã. La yʋʋmd 1960 soabã sẽnese, goosneema wã sɩnga tʋʋm-wẽnsã la neb nins sẽn da koosd teedã tɩ b pa tar sor n na n maan rẽ wã. Bãagã la bãanã yell me lebga bũmb sẽn tar yõod wʋsg ne goosneema rãmbã, bala so-toakdbã ra pa get tɩ bãanã yaa sõma ye, la b ra nong n kẽeda soayã ne b teedã, baa b sẽn da wa n ning-b lampo wã.",
        "Sẽn paase, b ra tara foto la bõn-naands wʋsg n paas b sẽn da maandã. Yaa tẽn-kãnga sẽn da yaa tẽn-kãense, la sẽn da yaa tẽng-kãnga n da yaa tẽnẽ wã, la sẽn yɩlẽ tɩ b tõog n paam n paas tẽnga la b siglgã pãng wakatẽ wã yĩnga. B sẽn naan n naan n naan tãnga a Popayán wã, b ra miime tɩ b na n maana tʋʋm wʋsg ne sãnem, sãnem la zamarãnd sẽn manegd b bõn-naandsã ne naam-naands la bõn-naandse, b zĩ-n-tɩrsã la b sẽn maand b sẽn pa tõe n maan bũmbã. Indi nebã ra tʋmda ne yembd n yiisd koodã. Tʋmtʋmdbã ra tõe n vɩɩma yʋʋm a tãabo. B ra yetame tɩ ned pa tõe n bas a sor n kẽng Popayán tẽn-bõonegẽ ye, bala yaa nin-buiidã sẽn kiid n da be a soayã zutu. A Hanke, a Louis. A Las Casas ne Spaañ rãmbã sẽn maood n na n paam tɩrlem dũni paalgã pʋgẽ wã. Sẽn yɩɩd fãa, b maana woto yʋʋm kob-gĩnd piig la a yoobã, piig la a yopoe la a nii wã. Wakat ning sẽn da yaa kolonialã wakate, b sẽn da maandã fãa yaa Sipãn dãmba, la a Quito wã yaa Payanese. A ye",
        "Catholic Tigengã ne a taab fãa sẽn yaa zak rãmb sẽn tõe n paam paoongã, b sẽn tar-a wã la b sẽn na n zãag ne a to wã, b sã n dat n maan tũudmã la b zãms nebã yĩnga. b wilgame tɩ tũudmã zãmsg yaa bũmb sẽn pa segd ne tʋʋm-tʋmdã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2025 yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuugã, a John Dramani Mahama yãka a Murtala t'a yɩ ministɛɛr ning sẽn geta koobã, siãnsã la technology wã yelle. A rɩka a tʋʋmdã yʋʋm-vẽkr kiuug rasem piig la a yiibu, t'a taoor soabã sak n deeg-a.",
        "Kibsa wã sɩngame Edo wakatẽ (1751-1764). B tẽedame tɩ yaa tẽn-kãng wẽn-tũudb sẽn da yãkd kug n yiisd a Machiya ko-kãsengã pʋgẽ n tɩ tall n kẽng tẽn-kugrã. B ra zãada kugã ne karɛt n kẽng wẽnd-doogẽ wã, tɩ b yaool n yɩɩl taiko ne kane.",
        "Gyaaman soolmã yaa a 17 soabã pʋgẽ, a sẽn da yaa Akan sull sẽn boond t'a Abron sẽn zoe Asanteman sẽn beẽ wã n zoe n yi Ghana sẽn yaa b sẽn beẽ rũndã-rũndã wã. [1] B sẽn yi Bondoukou wã, a Abron sullã sẽn beẽ n kẽng b soolmã rɩtgẽ wã, a sẽn wa n beẽ wã, b kɩtame tɩ b tõog n soog b naam ne b Diula nin-buiidã sẽn be Bondoukou soolmẽ wã. [2] Bondoukou lebga tẽn-kãseng sẽn yaa arzɛk la a Islam tẽn-kãsengã. [3] Gʋnaama sẽn yaa karen-bi-rãmbã sẽn kẽed ne Korãn wã sẽn yit Afirik Wɛtgã soolmẽ wã, n kẽed karen-biis nins sẽn beẽ.",
        "Yʋʋm kobs 15 soabã sẽn looge, Iznik tẽnga tẽn-gãongdbã sɩngame n maand b toor-toor b sẽn da maand ne b sẽn maand ne b toor-toorã. Pa be sɛb sẽn wilgd bũmb ning sẽn kɩt tɩ b maan woto ye. B sẽn gom a Iznik teedã yell pĩnda wã yaa Tokapi lalgã sẽn yaa a Tokapi wã rɩɩb roog sẽn zĩnd yʋʋmd 1489-1490 wã, tɩ b yãt koom-koglgã koglg 97 sẽn da tar koom-koglgẽ wã. [1] B sẽn yã bũmb ning sẽn deng n be Bursa wã yaa zũnd ne pemsem sẽn yaa bĩng sẽn maan tɩ b yãt a Şehzade Mahmud sẽn yaa a Bayezid II bi-ribl a ye, sẽn ki yʋʋmd 1506 - 1507 wã. [1] [2]",
        "Yʋʋmd 1995 wã, a Naidoo zĩnda taoor soab a Mandela sẽn yãk sull ning sẽn yãkd sẽn na yɩl n sõsd ne neb nins sẽn na n yɩ a taoor lʋɩtb tɩ b yãk-b tɩ b na n yɩ a taoor lʋɩtb sull ning sẽn get sɩdã la zems-n-taar yellã.",
        "Bi-nongre. A Joe Ghartey wilgame t'a datame n na n zab n yɩ NPP taoor soab taoor soab taoor soab sẽn deng 2016 yʋʋmde. A tʋma a sẽn na n yãk-a t'a na n yɩ taoor soabã yʋʋmd 2014 sẽoog kiuug rasem a 7 ne neb a yoob a taabã. A ra yaa tãab soaba, la a yãka yam n pa na n kẽng sull a yiib-n-soaba, la a teega a Nana Addo Dankwa Akuffo-Addo sẽn yɩ taoor soaba.",
        "Bless ya National Democratic Congress ( NDC). Yʋʋm 2012 ta yãnse Nkwanta rɩtg baobgo n kon NDC la dɩ min n paasse depite rãmb soog sẽn paasra yoobe Gana zugu soaba sẽn paasra naase ziigin.",
        "Adda lebga tẽnga bĩng yʋʋm 2003. A sẽn paam n yãk a sẽn yaa Navrongo Central wã n na n maan pʋɩ-peelem n na n yɩ Ghana tẽnga taoor soab a John Achuliwor kibra poore. A kell n zĩnda a zĩiga yʋʋmd 2004 wã parlamentar yãebã pʋgẽ. A paama a New Patriotic Party wã ligd n tõog n na n yɩɩdã. A sẽn yãkã ra yaa pʋga a yiib sẽn yãkã pʋga, a sẽn yãkã yaa pʋga sẽn yãkã sẽn yãkã. A New Patriotic Party tõogame tɩ b paam pʋ-tẽer n paam pʋ-peelmẽ wã pʋ-tẽeb sẽn yaa 128 n zĩnd pʋ-tẽegr pʋ-tẽerã. A paama vot 12,444 ne vot sẽn tar yõod sẽn yɩɩd 31,657. Yaa woto n zems ne vot nins sẽn da paam n kõ wã sẽn yaa 39.3% . A yaa a Gabriel Pwamang sẽn yaa tẽnga taoor soaba, a Andema Emmanuel sẽn yaa tẽnga National Democratic Congress, a Azantinlwo Anemana Jennifer Grace sẽn yaa Convention People's Party tẽnga taoor soaba la a Bagonia Grace sẽn yaa Democratic People's Party tẽnga taoor soaba. B paama b rãmb 6,512, 6,201, 140, 83, 2,262 la 4,015 sẽn zems ne b sẽn kõ wã fãa. Yaa b sẽn yãk n yãk n yãk b sẽn dat n deeg n deeg n kõ wã fãa, tɩ b sõorã zems ne 20.6%, 19.6%, 0.4%, 0.3%, % la 12.7%.",
        "Jultagi (Koreen: 줄타기) yaa Korea nebã sẽn maand n kẽnd ne bĩngã. A beẽ n be Koore-Dĩng tẽngã sẽn tar yõod wʋsg ne nin-buiidã.",
        "Janni, Kevin D, and Joseph W Bastien. 2004. Special Section on Medicinal Plants – Exotic Botanicals in the Kallawaya Pharmacopoeia. Economic Botany. 58: S274.",
        "Kibsa sẽn gʋlsd la bãngd sẽn kẽed ne molekular rogem wã wilgdame tɩ b sẽn naan n kõ-a wã yaa Azi sẽn be Central Azi wã bal.] A yaab-rãmbã sẽn yaa weoogẽ wã tõe n yii Pɛrsi (b sẽn yaa Irã la Afganistã masã), tɩ yaa rẽ n kɩt tɩ b ket n yaa weoog sẽn yaa weoogã.",
        "Yaa vẽeneg tɩ b sẽn da naanã yaa minimãr-dãmb n deng n naanã, bala b sɩngame n na n zĩnd sebrã pʋgẽ la b gʋls sebrã sẽn be b nengẽ wã yʋʋmd 1500 soabã. Yaa woto n kɩt tɩ b sɩng n maand \"sẽn yaa buud toor-toore\" sẽn boond tɩ Islamã. B yãa b sẽn da maand ne b sẽn boond tɩ \"Lechek Tornj\" wã pipi n yeel tɩ \"Medaillon\" la \"Erdon\" wã. Yʋʋmd 1522 wã, a Ismaël I tʋma karẽn-bi-pɛɛlga Kamāl ud-Dīn Behzād sẽn yaa Herat lekollã karẽn-bitre, t'a yɩ rĩm-dãmb raagã taoor soaba. A Behzad tara pãng wʋsg Safaidã meebã wɛɛngẽ. Safaid rãmbã sẽn yaa toor ne b sẽn yã wã pa yembr ne b sẽn wilg-b miniatɛɛrã pʋgẽ wã ye. Woto me yaa sɩda ne Eropã sẽn maandã: b pa makd Anatolii wã rẽnna ye. Rẽnna pa makd ne Eropã rẽnna sẽn maan yʋʋm kob-gĩnd 17 soabã ye. [1] Wala Ardabil karpetã, karpetã kẽer sẽn tar gʋls-b sẽn tar datã, bãngdbã sẽn baood n na n bãng n bãng n wilg tɩ Safavid karpetã sɩngame ne-b: Mam ka tar zĩ-sõng dũni pʋgẽ sã n ka yãmb tãb-soab ye. Dẽn-kãngã bal n na n kogl m zugã. Tʋmtʋmd a Maqsud sẽn da be Kashan soolmẽ wã, yʋʋmd 946 wã.",
        "Tẽns nins sẽn tar pĩnd wẽndẽ ne pĩnd wẽndẽ meebã, wala Pɛrs buud-goam nins sẽn da yaa b rãmbã, b tõe n zãmsa b sẽn miẽ wã, bala b sẽn maand bũmb ninsã yaa zakã rãmb bɩ buud-goambã minimã rẽndã. Yaa woto n tõe n sõng-b tɩ b tall bũmbu. Sẽn na yɩl n tall bõn-naands sẽn yaa sõma n paase, sẽn yɩɩd fãa sẽn yaa sẽn yaa tɩrsã, b getame tɩ b talld bõn-naandbã ne gũusgu, n tall-b ne seb-vẽenega, la b tall-b-la ne seb-no-kãnga. B boondame tɩ karɛt-bilã. A sẽn maand-a tãn-kãnga, a tara a sẽn na n dɩk a sẽn na yɩl n tõog n tall a sẽn tõe n maan to-to wã. Yʋʋm kobs sẽn looge, b pa toeem wʋsg b sẽn da maand bũmb ninsã ye. Rũndã-rũndã, b tũnugda ne kom-bɛɛg n maand b sẽn tõe n dɩk n dɩk b sẽn tõe ne b sẽn tõe fãa n dɩk n tʋm ne b sẽn na n tʋk to-to wã. [Bɩ y ges sẽn yɩ to-to wã.]",
        "Centre, UNESCO World Heritage. \"List of World Heritage in Danger: World Heritage Committee inscribes the Tombs of Buganda Kings (Uganda) and removes Galapagos Islands (Ecuador)\". Retrieved 14 November 2016.",
        "Kenya, kaoreng puge boondame tɩ Republic of Kenya (Swahili gom sẽn boond tɩ Jamhuri ya Kenya), yaa tẽn-kãseng sẽn be East Africa wã, la a tara neb sen yɩɩd milyõ 47.6 ne yʋʋm 2019 nin-buiid sõssã pʋgẽ, [1] Kenya yaa dũni gill tẽn-bɛda pisi la ayopoe soabã. [2]",
        "Bõn-buud nins sẽn be Capsicum buud fãa pʋgẽ wã yaa rɩɩb sẽn tõe n dɩ. Baa ne tɩrgã sẽn yaa bõn-buud a taabã fãa sẽn tar bõn-buudu, pa rẽ ye. [Tõnd sẽn na n togse] B sẽn boond tɩ vãadã tɩ dahon ng sili (tõnd sẽn dat n yeel tɩ \"chili vãad\") wã, b maanda-b wa bõn-buud sẽn yaa wa bĩis Filipins wã. B tũnugda ne-b n dɩd-b-la namse. [42] Kẽer rɩɩb pʋgẽ, b tõe n dɩka a sãnemã n dɩ a kimchi wã. [43] Zã-kẽengã pʋgẽ, b maanda-b tɩ b lebg tɩb-n-tɩrs la b maanda-a ne tsukudani buud sẽn na yɩl n tõog n kogl-a. mos_Latnmos_Latnmos_Latn be be be Meziik nebã rɩɩb wʋsg pʋsẽ, sẽn tar makr-rãmbã sẽn yaa wa chili rellenos wã, b rɩtda chili wã fãa. B tõe n kɩtame tɩ b lebg n dɩd-b-la. A yaa roog sẽn yũud rãam, sẽn yaa rãam la a yaa roog. Meziik soolmã sẽn be Sinaloa la Sonora wã, b tũnugda ne peep sẽn boond tɩ chiltepin (dũniyã peep sẽn yaa wa b sẽn boond tɩ peep) n maand sãnem la supã n paasd rɩɩb tɩb tɩbgo. Meziik soolmã kiidã, b maanda moor-dãmb ne miis sẽn yaa wa ancho la chipotle. B tũnugda ne tιl-kẽmb n kõt-b salsa. Meziik zak rãmb taa n wubd bõn-buud sẽn yaa wa kiidg sẽn na yɩl n tɩg rɩɩb.",
        "Okyere-Agyekum ya Kris-neda (Presbyterian).A fura mẽ n tar kamb a tãabo.[ A Vɩɩm Sɩngre la Kaorengo",
        "Kopačka (Macedonian; English) yaa Macedonian oro, sẽn yaa reem buud sẽn yit Pijanec, sẽn yaa tãens sẽn be Macedonian rɩtgã.",
        "Pĩnd rasem a nii wã, b yõgda b tãmbã n na n yiis zĩ-gãongã n wa paam weerã waoongo, tɩ nebã sẽn kiidã me na n yɩɩl n kɩt tɩ b maan sũ-noog wʋsgo. Tẽns a wãn sẽn be Tonnekens tẽn-tẽngã pʋgẽ, b \"beoogda\" bugum sẽn yaa bilf n wa ne bugum. A Oudenberg wã, b kõt-d-la bugum sẽn yõogd bugum n tɩ wa Marktã, tɩ b maan tɩ tigis-kãnga ra yaa sõma.",
        "n paas sẽn tũud-b yẽ wã n tãag kũum daarã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2019 wã pʋgẽ, Kɩtbã minisrãmb sẽn get laafɩ wã yell tʋg n baoo condom-rãmb ne yel-solemse. Sẽn be yamleoog me yaa tɩ sigls nins b sẽn yiis tɩ b na n kõ-b kondomã pa kẽes b toog n sok sogs-kãensã, sã n mikame tɩ b paka tendɛɛrã tɩ nebã wʋmd a võore, wa sẽn zems ne Public Procurement Act. A leb n yaa sõma tɩ d bãng tɩ kaoolã leb n kẽe a Pharmanova Limited.",
        "A Nyarku yaa karẽn-saamb sẽn be Department of marketing and Supply Chain Management SchoolSchool of Business, University of Cape Coast, Ghana.",
        "Yʋʋm 1912 zabrã poore, b sẽn da wa n na n maan tigrã Kırkpınar wã, b pa le tõe n maan tigrã ye. Rẽ n so tɩ b rɩk tigrã n kẽng Virantekke, sẽn yaa Kapitan Andreevo bãens roog sẽn be Bulgarian.",
        "A Hüseyin Pehlivan paama a tõogr yʋʋm a yopoe sẽn pʋɩta, sẽn sɩng ne yʋʋmd 1935 wã. A Ahmet Taşçı tõoga a ye naoor a nu yʋʋm 11 pʋgẽ. A Ali Gürbüz n tõog n yɩɩ yʋʋm 2021 soabã naaba.",
        "B yeelame tɩ yaa sõma tɩ ned sã n dat n kẽed nin-vɩɩs ne a limun tɩɩgẽ, a segd n kẽe a limun tɩɩgẽ.",
        "Draper, Robert (February 2013). \"New Old Libya\". National Geographic. Photographs by George Steinmetz. Archived from the original on 2020-08-30.",
        "Logtor yaa ned sẽn maagd neb bãag pʋgẽ bɩ logtor yirã. A sẽn yaa logtorã (M.D, sẽn yit Latin Medicinae Doctor wã pʋgẽ) yaa logtor sẽn yaa logtoɛɛg sẽn tar võor sẽn yaa to-to ne tẽns toɛy-toɛyã.",
        "Mahama Asei Seini dogã sɩpaolg kiuugu daham pii la nu yʋʋmde 1960. A ya Ghana politik neda la parliment wilga m pãas-ã Ghana parliment n sɩngi sãoore a nii. Nyé gèt Daboya Mankarigu saka m'be Gonja wĩn-dɩtgo tênga Savannah Region Ghana pugin. A lèb n ya Deputy ministr n gèt laafi zugu.",
        "A Koné talla naoor 18 a 2013–14 koe-moondã pʋgẽ, n sõng tɩ b lebg n wa segl a yiib-n-soabã pʋgẽ. Yʋʋmd 2015 tʋʋlg kiuug rasem 17 wã, a sẽn lebg n wa n yɩɩ taoor soaba, a paama yĩn-kɛglem sẽn yaa toog ne a kolgã, n bas-a tɩ b pa kẽes-a toog kiuug a yoob pʋgẽ. [2]",
        "UNESCO World Heritage Committee (2001). Report on the 24th Session of the World Heritage Committee, Paris.",
        "A Korsah roga yʋʋmd 1978 tʋʋl-nif kiuug rasem 12 la a yita Tekiman sẽn be Bono tẽn-yɩbgã pʋgẽ. A paama a SSSCE yʋʋm 1998 wã, a sẽn karemd goosneerã, kʋdemdã la kiris-neb tũudmã zãmsg pʋgẽ. A paama a karẽn-bi-bɛdã politik bãngrã pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 2005 n yi Ghana inivɛrsite wã la a paam a karẽn-bi-bɛdã politik la tẽn-tẽnga zoodã pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 2007.",
        "Kibay-soay sẽn tar tõkr ne Kosovo Tẽn-kʋdemd-wẽndẽ Naanse sẽn be Wikimedia Kommons",
        "Yʋʋmd 2021 soabã, kiuug rasem 18 wã, a Akhmat Grozny wilgame t'a sigla Konaté yʋʋm a ye bãnd pʋgẽ, n na n paam yʋʋm a yiib sẽn paase.",
        "Morna yaa b sẽn getã n yaa Cape Verde tẽnga mizikã, wa fado sẽn yaa Portugal, tango sẽn yaa Argentine, merengue sẽn yaa Domiinikan tẽnga, rumba sẽn yaa Kuba, la b sẽn boond tɩ.",
        "Mount Nimba Strict Nature Reserve, Guinea and Côte d'Ivoire (UNESCO MAB Biosphere Reserves Directory)",
        "A Ussif roga sigr kiuug rasem 16 yʋʋm 1979 soabã. A yita Tantaala sẽn be North East Region n Ghana rɩtgo. A kẽnga Bagabaga Training College karẽnga la Anglia Ruskin University wã, a sẽn paam a Bachelor of Art degree pʋgẽ International Business la Management yʋʋm 2010 soabã. A kell n kẽnga Gloucestershire university wã, a sẽn wa n Masters degree in Finance and Investment yʋʋm 2011.",
        "Arachis buud yaa tẽng sẽn be Zu-soab Amerika, Andes wã pʋga rɩtgẽ, Peru, Bolivi, Arjantɛn la Brazil soolmẽ wã. Pĩnd sẽn yaa bĩnd (A. hypogaea) yii buud-goam a yiib sẽn yaa bu-zẽms sʋka, n da tẽed tɩ yaa A. duranensis la A. ipaensis. Sɩngrẽ wã, b ra na n yɩɩ bĩnd sẽn pa tar bẽng ye, la b sẽn lebg n lebg n lebg b rogemã, n naan lebg amfidiploid bɩ allotetraploid. [8] Genetic bãngrã wilgdame tɩ b sẽn da wa n yaa bĩnda naoor a yembr bal n dog n kɩt tɩ b lebg A. monticola, sẽn yaa bu -zẽmsã buud sẽn yaa bẽng n be zĩ-kɩr-zẽngr-dãmb bilfu Argentina bɩ Bolivi soolmẽ wã, zĩig ning b sẽn tar bẽnd sẽn yaa buudu, la b b sẽn boond tɩ bẽng tɩ bĩnd-zoodã, la b lebgdẽ ne bẽ n lebg bẽngã.",
        "A sɩngame n zãms b lekollã la a zãmsda b kambã la b kambã. A kẽngame n na n kẽng Angletɛɛr n tɩ zãms a O-level la A-level eksãrnã Lancing College, Sussex, zĩig ning b sẽn boond-a t'a \"Billy\" wã, la a kẽnga Anglikã tẽebo. A sɩngame n zãmsd filozofi, politik la ekonomi wã New College, Oxford yʋʋmd 1962, la a basame. A lebg n wa Gana yʋʋmd 1962 n na n zãms Akkɛɛr Akademi wã, n yaool n kẽng Gana Yuniõrbiisẽ, Legon yʋʋmd 1964, n paam b BSc (Econ) diplôme yʋʋmd 1967. A kẽnga Middle Temple n paam minim tɩ b lebg sɛb-n-taag sẽn kẽed ne karengã sẽn boond tɩ Inns of Court wã pʋgẽ. B bool-a lame tɩ b kẽng Ingliz lagengã (Middle Temple) yʋʋmd 1971 tʋʋlg kiuugã. A paama a Zeova loogr yʋʋmd 1975 t'a wa kẽ Ghana wã. A Akufo-Addo ra tʋmdame ne Amerika sɛb-biis sɛb-rãmbã sẽn boond tɩ Coudert Brothers wã sẽn be Paris wã. Yʋʋmd 1979 wã, a wa n lugla lagem-n-taar siglgã a Prempeh and Co.",
        "Sãn yaa ne ko-bɩɩs sẽn yɩɩd 1200 la b tar b zɩɩm sẽn sɩng ne sẽn pa ta kilogram 1 n ta sẽn yɩɩd kilogram 90 (200 lb); b nemdã tõe n yɩɩ miuugu, rã-vẽenese, sãnem-vẽenese, yaalg bɩ peelem.",
        "“La Wẽnnaam Pebila geer na zĩnd be, la Bãmb nonglõm yembes na sak Bãmba la yẽnd Bãmb nenga.”",
        "A Ötzi a Zĩ-kãnga nao wã sẽn dat n ta yʋʋmd 3300 sẽn deng a Zezi rogmã, ra tara bĩis-kãnga sẽn yaa wa bĩis, la b ra tara gãnd-kãnga n tar bẽedã. A Jotunheimen nao wã paama b sẽn dat n yã yʋʋmd 2006 tʋʋlg kiuugã pʋgẽ: b wilgame tɩ b maana a woto yʋʋmd 1800 n tãag yʋʋmd 1100 sẽn deng a Zeezi rogmã, n kɩt tɩ yaa a Zezi sẽn yãt fu-rãmbã sẽn yaa pipi wã Skandɩnive.",
        "France24 (16 July 2017).Kidnapped US journalist in DR Congo found safe, five wardens killed Archived 2017-07-16 at the Wayback Machine. Retrieved 16 July 2017.",
        "Djenné tẽng kʋda ya pind-pind la zamaan yaog zĩisi n naane taaba m'be Djenné galʋ tẽng pugin m'be Mali solem pugin.A tara pind-pind zĩisi a naase (4),tɩ a yu la Djenné-Djeno,Hambarkétolo,Kaniana la Tonomba.Yʋʋmde 1988 la UNESCO ramba dag dika m paase World Heritage List Ãndũni Faado Zĩisa sõdg pugin.",
        "Baa ne a sẽn lebg kʋdemdã wilgre, Ommegangã ket n tara rog-n-migs wʋsg sẽn yaa sɩd-sɩda, wala Brussels Lineagesã, Crossbowmenã pʋlemsã, la Virgin des Victoiresã, la a ket n yaa bõn-kãseng yʋʋmd fãa sẽn maand Brusɛlse nebã yamẽ.",
        "Galʋ tẽng kãseng ning sẽn be Ouahigouya paasra nu soaba Burkina Faso pʋga, tib tẽnga nin-buiida ya 73153 sõdga sẽn loge yʋʋm 2006 wan.",
        "A Patricia Appiagyei (B sẽn dog nina yʋʋm 1956 Sigr Kiuug rasem pisi la anii raare) yaa Ghana politik soaba, sẽn da yaa Ashanti tẽn-gãonga minisr-soaba, la Kumasi tẽn-gãonga pipi pag sẽn yaa tẽnga naaba. A yaa tẽnga taoor soab (MP) Ghana naaneg sull a yopoe wã la naaneg sull a nii wã pʋgẽ, n yaa Asokwa sullã taoor soaba. A yaa Ghana tẽng-nongr parti paalgã ned a ye.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2022 yʋʋm-vʋʋsg kiuugã, b sẽn maan koobã ra yaa wʋsg Burkina Faso soolmẽ wã. A Damiba paama yʋʋr sẽn boond t'a sẽn dɩkd a sẽn yaa miuugã n maand kõ-ba, la a sẽn maand yɩɩr wakat fãa wã yĩnga. B tẽedame tɩ b sẽn yeelg burã wã kɩtdame tɩ b get Burkina Faso naaba sẽn yaa naaba la sẽn lugl-a wã, a Thomas Sankara, sẽn gomdã me yaa wa a Damiba sẽn gomdã. A Damiba ra zoe n paama pẽgr ne nebã a sẽn maan a zabr ne dʋgdbã hal n deng a sẽn maan wẽnemã.",
        "Piitrivka (sẽn yaa \"Petrykovka\"; Ukrainien: Петриківський розпис) yaa Ukrainian sẽn boond tɩ piitrivkasã sẽn yaa tẽng sẽn boond tɩ Petrykivka wã sẽn be Dnipropetrovsk soolmẽ wã. B sẽn yãt-a wã, b wilgame tɩ b ra yaa nin-tɩrs sẽn tar minim n maand yɩɩr n maand yɩɩre.",
        "B pʋdga buginese wã yʋy b sẽn boond tɩ pinisi wã zĩis wʋsgo, wala:",
        "Italian cuisine – Culinary traditions of Italy",
        "Ross, John F. Mountains of Pain Smithsonian Magazine, November 2000.",
        "A Quyllurit'i kibsã boonda tẽn-kɩremsã neb tus wʋsgo, sẽn naag ne Paucartambo (Quechua-rãmb) sẽn yit tẽn-koomã babs sẽn be wẽnd-doogã rɩtgã, la Quispicanchis (Aymara-rãmb) sẽn yit rũm-kɩɩmbã babs sẽn be goabg la rɩtgã. Tẽns a yiibã fãa neb kẽnda kibsã yʋʋmd fãa, n wat ne neb wʋsg sẽn maand reem la yɩɩla. Neb sull a naas n be tɩ b tʋʋm yaa toor-toore: ch'unchu, qulla, ukuku, la machula. Neb nins sẽn wat tigis-kãnga wã sõor paasdame, tɩ b sʋka, yaa Peruu nin-bɛd la sãamb sẽn yit tẽn-zẽmsã.",
        "Yʋʋm kobs-gĩndẽ wã fãa, sẽn da yaa tɩlae tɩ b maneg n get b sẽn maand b sẽn maandẽ wã, sẽn yɩɩd fãa b sẽn maand bũmb nins sẽn tar pãng n maandẽ wã kɩtame tɩ b tall bas-m-yam ne b ra-kɩtbã la b ra sak n get b ra-kãsemsã yelle.",
        "A David Kinsley (1988). Hindoo wẽn-poak rãmba: B sẽn get wẽn-poak sẽn yaa pag to-to Hindoo tũudmã pʋgẽ. California Inivɛrsite Kibayã. ISBN 978-0-520-90883-3 . A sẽn da yaa ninsabls tẽnsa taoor soaba.",
        "Yaa woto me ne yɩɩlã. Yʋʋmd 1952 wã, bi-bɩɩg a ye sẽn da yɩɩnd n boond t'a Stelios Kazantzidis gʋlsa rebetika yɩɩl a yiibu, tɩ nebã ra nong-ba. Baa a sẽn da na n ket n yɩɩnd woto yʋʋm a wãn pʋgẽ wã, neb nins fãa sẽn da kẽed ne yɩɩlã bãngame tɩ yɩɩlã la a yɩɩlã ra yaa sõma wʋsg tɩ pa tõe n yɩ rebetiko wã ye. Sẽn pa kaoose, yɩɩl-gʋlsdb sẽn tar yʋʋre wa a Kaldaras, a Chiotis, a Klouvatos sɩngame n na n gʋls yɩɩl sẽn tik a Stelios koe-kãsenga zugu, la rẽ kɩtame tɩ yɩɩl-gʋlsdã toeem n paase. Yɩɩn-paalã yɩɩl ra yaa sõma n yɩɩd pĩndã, la b ra nong n yɩɩla ne yɩɩl sẽn be yamleoogo. A Kazantzidis lebga laiki mizikã ãdga. [ citation needed ]",
        "B tõe n maana tigis-kãnga, kug, kug bɩ gãndg n maan tigis-kẽengã, la b maneg wẽnd-doogã la b zagsã ne b wall-pẽndb, teedã la b teedã.",
        "Nand t'a lebg MP, a Dafeamekpor ra yaa Senior Associate Hayibor, Djarbeng and Company Law firm sẽn be Kokomlemle, Accra tẽn-kɩremsã pʋgẽ.",
        "B sã n dat n bãng tɩ b yaa \"tõnd sẽn yaa kãsenga\" bɩ \"tõnda sẽn yaa sũ-bʋgsem\", b sã n dat tɩ b bãng tɩ b tara bũmb sẽn be sʋka. B tũnugda ne b sãnem-n-tɩrsã buud-goam kẽer pʋsẽ, n dat n kɩt tɩ b gãd-b ne b sãn-tɩrse, wala \"tõnd sẽn tar tãnsã\" tɩ sã n yaa ne seb-kãsems sẽn yaa toog tʋʋm wala b sẽn na n yẽesd tẽnga bɩ b sẽn na yɩl n yiis bẽedã, wall b sẽn na n maan ne b sẽn na yɩl n maneg ne b sẽn tõe n maan ne a sẽn yaa koom-koglg bɩ a sẽn tõe n kɩt tɩ b maan ne a wã. Bãagrã wʋsg beẽ n be sʋka, tɩ b tõe n zãag b meng ne b zagsã la b tʋʋmã, sẽn yaa yalem n tõe n yɩ sũ-bʋgsem la n dɩk bugum sẽn yaa bilf me, la sẽn yaa kãenkãe tɩ b tõe n maan bũmb sẽn tar pãng wʋsgo.",
        "La bãag wʋsg n namsd a ye, tɩ yaa bãag sẽn yaa kãsenga, sẽn wat ne sãnem, la sãnemã, la a mog-rãmbã, sẽn wat n yalg ne a bẽedã, n kɩt tɩ tɩɩsã bɩʋʋg pa le paasdẽ la a sãnemã pa le paasd ye. Aster yellow wã yaa bãag-dãmb sẽn wat ne bãag-n-taagã sẽn wat ne vãad-n-tɩrsã sẽn wat n kɩt tɩ b vãadã lebg wẽnsã. Fong bãas yaa fõnd sẽn yaa pulgr la fõnd n yaa fõnda, tɩ kɩt tɩ fẽnda wã wa n kʋ, tɩ b yĩm n kʋ, la b yĩm ne fõnda. Baktɛɛr bãagã yaa Botrytis cinerea, tɩ b tõe n tũnug ne UV-C tɩbsg: Vàsquez et al. 2017b yãame tɩ fẽyilanin amoniyak-yẽg tʋʋmde, fẽnolik siglgã siglgã siglg la B. cinerea sẽn pa tar pãng wã paasda ne UV-C. Laad sẽn yaa wʋsg n be wã tõe n kɩtame tɩ bãad-wẽns la bãad-wɩɩs kẽed ne-a. Zĩigã tõe n yɩɩ yell me, bala, sã n bʋgdẽ, b pa tõe n tõogd ne-b ye. Laag sẽn da bĩngd (b sẽn sɩng ne b sẽn pa tar bĩng n yaool n kẽng n tɩ rɩ) sɩngrẽ wã, yaa sõma tɩ b tõog n maan yɩɩre, la wakat ning fãa, b tõe n wa n wa n yɩɩgame, n kɩt tɩ b lebg n paame, tɩ b womd-b sõma. Zĩigã me yaa bõn-kʋdgd la bãagã zak la tõe n kɩtame tɩ b paam n pa le yãgd ye. B tũnugda ne kʋɩlen-yũudb wʋsg n zab ne zũud-n-tɩrsã. La rẽ kɩtame tɩ b tõog n yiis bõn-buud sẽn pa tar tɩb sẽn pa tar kʋɩl-kɛgdo.",
        "Qatul al-Kisrawi, Nahrawan Canal (Ko-sore) wã wĩn-dɩtg baobgo sẽne yalgra nina sẽn wõngre koom n yit Tigris kʋlg sẽn be Samarra baobg-y wã pakre wʋlgamɩ tɩ nin-buiidu wa be wʋsgo ziigĩ wã yaa sẽn tõe n maane. Ra yaa Yakut al-Hamawi (Mu 'jam, gese \"Qatul\" tẽngre) n maan kibare kada toeem tʋʋm zĩig n kõ Khosrau I (531 - 578). B ra mẽ gãosgo roogo bedre Samarra wĩn-goabga baobgo noore (zamaan-paalga sasa Burj al-Qa'im), la b mẽ na-zaka bɩ na-yir sẽn tar \"arzãna\" tãoosgo pʋʋgo sẽn tiig lalga n be wĩn-goabg baobgo noore (zamaan-paalga sasa Nahr ar-Rasasi) sẽn pẽnege ad-Dawr n yug tʋʋma baasre. Ko-sore paalga, Qatul Abi al-Jund, Abbasid Moeemb taor-sõba a Harun al-Rashid sẽn vɛɛse nina wã da yugamɩ nɩ b nadem n mẽ tẽn-bedre sẽn wẽndẽ rul-tĩisa nii bõndo (Zamaan-paalga sasa Husn al-Qadisiyya), sẽn yʋʋr da boond tɩ al-Mubarak.",
        "A Samuel Erickson Abakah ( da roga zĩ- likr kiuugu rasm 10 yʋʋm 1959) a da ya Ghanaian avõka politik ned n la be New Patriotic Party. A da lé be depite rãmb soog Shama Constituency pugin,wĩn- taoore zãmaane sẽn be Western Region, Ghana.",
        "Wala makre, b rɩkda Zuif-rãmbã n maand bũmb nins sẽn yaa wa bĩis sẽn yaa wa ye, tɩ b rɩkd Sol n maand bũmb ning sẽn yaa wa heliotrope, tɩ b dɩkd Mars n maand bũmb sẽn yaa wa roog sẽn yaa wa jaspe, tɩ b yeel tɩ b rɩk a Ceres n maand bũmb a ye, tɩ yaa wa b rɩkd a Bacchus n maand bũmb n maand bũmb tɩ b tõe n wilg tɩ b yaa wẽn-sakdb la b tõe n maan bũmb ninsã.",
        "Sherifa Gunu ya Ghana yɩɩn-yɩɩnda, tɩ b da roga tɩ a ya na-biiga m be naam zak pugin,Dagbon Ghana rɩtg baobgo.",
        "Alka yaa bõn-yoodr ning b sẽn tũnugd ne zuloeesẽ wã yʋʋr la woto. A yaa bũmb a yiib sẽn tar pãng wa taab sẽn lagem taab ne gãnd-taab a tãab sẽn be zĩig a yembre. B sẽn dat n kʋ-a wã, b rɩk-a lame n gãneg ne wĩir sẽn be rasãndã sʋka. Sẽn naagd-a zabrã (Alkar) rʋʋda a wiidã, n kẽnd ne pãng wʋsgo, n kẽnd n dat n wẽ ne a kãnfãagã sẽn be yaangã. A sã n wa pa tõog n wẽ, a paamda bõn-yend n tãag a tãab bala, la a sã n pa tõog n wẽ, a pa paamd bõn-yend ye.",
        "A Souleymane Koanda ra roga yʋʋmd 1992 bõn-bɩʋʋng kiuug rasem 21 wakat n yaa Burkĩna tẽnga futbã sẽn be tẽngr n be n be n zabd ne tẽnga. A Souleymane Koanda,sõngr sẽn yaa to-to.D rogmã daar Yʋʋmd 1992 sɛt kiuug rasem 21 yʋʋm 30. Biig zĩiga",
        "Baa ne ko-ko-kãnga sẽn tar tar tar tarem wʋsgã, pa nana tɩ d bãng a sẽn yit zĩig ningã ye Yaa b sẽn boond tɩ \"brassicas\" wã yĩnga. B sẽn tõe n yeel tɩ yaa ra-kʋdg n yaa wa b sẽn boond tɩ Brassica oleracea wã, b sẽn da yãt-a Bretã la Erop tẽn-bɛdã, yaa tɩrs sẽn pa tar zu-loees, la ka bõn-naands a taab sẽn na n zab ne-a ye la rẽ kɩtame tɩ b beẽ tãnga pʋgẽ, b zĩ-bɛɛgẽ. La b sã n get b sẽn maand bũmb ning, b tõe n yeelame tɩ b yaa bõn-kʋdgd sẽn yi zĩigã la b yiidã. Sã n yaa ne U-rɩsgo wã sẽn wilgd tɩ b sẽn naan n bãng bũmb nins sẽn be Brassica buud toor-toorã sʋka, B. oleracea la bõn-buud a taab sẽn yaa toor ne taaba (buud-buud, buud-buudu, brokoli, bruksel-buud la buud-guusg) yaa yaab-rãmbã sẽn yit a tãabã sʋka.",
        "Naoor wʋsgo, yel-kãsems nins sẽn tɩ loe ne laafɩ wã, rẽgdo, la yel-gɛtbã zems-n-taarã ka tõe n welg ne wẽgbã ye. Wakat ninga, sogs-kãensã leb n paka buud toor-toore, buud sẽn yaa neb sẽn pa waoog la neb sẽn pa tar ligd wʋsg. 9] Gʋlsg sẽn kẽed ne zĩiga yell wilgdame tɩ nin-kãensã vɩɩmda zĩis nins sẽn tõe n wa ne rẽgdo la rẽgdo, la sẽn tõe n wa ne zu-loees b vɩɩmã pʋgẽ.",
        "Tẽng yidgri zan-daoog soya tara soy n seg taab piig la a yopoe(17) n nam maane tɩ paango la yin-maasem be ni neb ãndũni pugin.A sɩnga yʋm 2015 tɩ ya United National General Assembly(UN-GA) ramba n da tilga ,tɩ b tagsgo ya tɩ diki kẽng yʋʋmde 2030 tɩ o b da wani soy nimsa wã fãa pidi . A soy piig la a yopoe(17) wã yembre la o b nan maane to-to tɩ noongo sa ni neb. Kom me sa ni neb,laafi la belem neere be ni neb,wubri neere be ni neba bangre bao neere la gese n song pagba la raba,ko songo neb nan yur be ni neba la zĩi songo m paasi ni yɛl a taaba wʋsgo m paasi m ayi piri(6 july 2017)SDG ramba dan maana panga ti ya UN ramba n da kẽnga",
        "Taekkyonã tũnugda ne manesem toor-toor sẽn yaa toor-toore, sẽn tar n be n wẽed ne b nusã, b nusã la b yĩn-bõonegã, b wẽed ne taab n wẽed b sẽbgã, b wẽeda ne b sẽbga, b wẽnda ne b gãndã, b ningd b zutã la b wẽed b zutã. B rɩkda b yĩngã tõre n maand a sẽn maand a to wã fãa. Baa ne a Taekkyon sẽn tũnugd ne b sẽn na n wẽed ne nugã, n wẽed n wẽedã, la b sẽn na yɩl n tõog n maan bũmb ning sẽn yaa sõma wã, a tara kʋɩlen-kɛglem, n yãkd n maand bũmb toor-toor n na n sõng-a t'a tõog n maan a sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ningã. Taekkyonã tʋʋmd yaa n paam ned ning sẽn be be a poorẽ wã n pa tõe n maan a sẽn datã ye.",
        "Yaa vẽeneg tɩ sobg-rãmbã yaa sobg-n-tɩrs sẽn maand ne sobg-no-kãnga, la b sã n wa maand ne sobgã, b maanda ne b nus n maand ne sobga. Bõn-buudã sẽn yaa rao la pagã yaa b toor-toor. Ned a yembr sã n sõng-a, a tõe n kɩtame tɩ pag 100 paam tɩ b yɩ bõn-buud sẽn pa tar koomã. Sẽn mik tɩ yaa bõn-vɩɩs bal n tõe n sõng-b tɩ b lebg bõn-vʋʋsdb sẽn tar biisã yĩnga, b minim n yãkd-b tɩ yɩ bõn-vɩt-vɩɩsdb sẽn womd biisã yĩnga. Rɩtb kẽer pa maand tɩ b tɩɩsã yaa rao ye, bala b sã n wa paam tɩ b tɩgs-b-la b tɩɩsã, b tɩgsda b tɩɩsã. B sẽn maand b sẽn tõe n dɩk b mens n tɩ dɩk b mens tɩ b rɩk b mens n dɩk b meng n dɩk b teedã, b maanda woto ne b sẽn mi b sẽn tõe fãa n dɩk b toorẽ wã. Tẽns kẽer wala Irak, b sã n wa tar tɩɩgã, b sãn maand woto, b rɩkda bũmb sẽn na yɩl n tɩg-a tɩ b pa tõe n bas tɩ b lʋɩ tɩ b pa le tõe n lʋɩ tɩ b ra wa n lʋɩ. [Tõnd sẽn na n tool-y neda]",
        "The Song of the Sibyl at the Cathedral of Mallorca in 2009",
        "Travelling and living abroad: Sahel, United Kingdom Foreign and Commonwealth Office, retrieved 1 January 2012",
        "Leo Africanus (1896), The History and Description of Africa (3 Vols), Brown, Robert, editor, London: Hakluyt Society. A facsimile of Pory's English translation of 1600 together with an introduction and notes by the editor. Internet Archive: Volume 1, Volume 2, Volume 3",
        "B boond-a lame tɩ Kirgisi la Kazakistã. B yetame tɩ Kazakistã pʋgẽ bal, neb sẽn maand reemã sõor taa 10 000, tɩ neb sẽn zãmsd reemã sõor ta 200.",
        "Gudbrandsdal soolmẽ wã, b tara kʋɩl-bɛd wala Gausdal, Heidal, Vinstra, la Ottadalen. Zĩ-kãnga tara tãnsob-n-soods sẽn zãr ne mogrã m 200 la tãnsob-n-soods sẽn zãr ne mogrã m 800, tẽn-gãoneg sẽn yaa sõma sẽn be mogrã pʋgẽ, la tãnsob-n-soods sẽn pa tar tɩɩs sẽn be Rondane la Dovrefjell. We-rũngã gũbgda we-rũng-kãensã, la zĩig ning sẽn yɩɩd-a wã, we-rũngã welgdame n lebg tãng sẽn pa tar tɩɩs zĩig ye. Zĩ-kãnga yaa zĩ-kẽeng sẽn boond tɩ seterfjell, sẽn da yaa zĩig sẽn da tar yõod wʋsg wakat ning b sẽn da get-a wa zĩ-kẽengã, la zĩig b sẽn da maand moogo. 23]",
        "Zihgir yaa gom-biis sẽn yit Turke, b sẽn da tũnugd ne-a n na n maan tãnsob-n-soodg Ottoman soolmẽ wã. B ra maand-b-la ne raadã, ne kutã, ne na-rɩtgã, ne kõabã, ne yɩɩlã, bɩ ne gãndgã. Zʋg-kãensã ra wilgdame tɩ ned ning sẽn da zãad-a wã yaa zab-zabd soaba. B wa n lebga nin-kãsems n da be Ottoman soolmẽ wã, la b sãnda sẽn da wa n wa n lebg nin-kãsems n wa n be be wã, b ra manegda b nengã wʋsgo, hal tɩ b ra pa le tõe n tall-b n yõg tãb ye. Naoor wʋsgo, b ra maand-b-la ne kut sẽn tar yõodo, la b ra maneg-b-la sõma. Kẽer me yaa kug-sõma.",
        "Lozind tuuma kiire ya tomat canning lozind tuuma mbe kwalugu, pusu-namongo kolged Bolga Tanga wâ,",
        "A Vincent Ekow Assafuah ( sẽn dog sigr kiuug rasem 27 yʋʋm 1990 soabã) yaa Ghana politikã ned sẽn yaa New Patriotic Party (NPP) ninsa. A ra yaa Public Relations Officer (PRO) ne Ministry of Education. A yaa member of parliament sẽn be Old-Tafo constituency sẽn be Ashanti region wã.",
        "Western Wall (Nen-taoore Lalga) - B le boo'nda la \"Wailing Wall\" (Wõosre Lalga)",
        "Western North Region wa yaa zãmaana paale m-be Ghana zãmaana pii a yoobe wa pugẽ sɩnge 2019 puge. Buum ringa n kiti zãmaana palli naanego yaa Sefwi ramba yelpakere zu gomnanti kiemtoro tuuma n-yi na-teng kudgo(Secondi Takoradi). Woto yĩnga nanamse a yoobe m-be Western North zamaana puge.",
        "Sẽn paase, no-rɛɛsd sẽn yaa na-kẽndre, a tõe n kɩtame tɩ b maan bũmb a taab n tõog n kogl-a. A sẽn tõe n yiis a meng pãngã tara a sẽn tõe n tall a meng n tall a sẽn datã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2004 bõn-bɩʋʋngẽ, a lugla New Designs Charter Schools sẽn be Carlifonia, USA. Sẽn deng rẽ, a tʋma yʋʋm piig la a yembr Matematik la bãngd bãngd lekollẽ n yɩ Manual Arts High School la a lugla International Studies Academy sẽn yaa karen-biis karen-bi-bɩɩs sull sẽn yaa bilfã. A yɩɩ matematã karen-saamb taoor soaba me USC/Manual Arts Neighborhood Academic Initiative (NAI). A ra yaa sull ning sẽn sigl karẽn-biis la karẽn-karẽn-biisa zãmsg saglgã sẽn naan naan naan naan maan karẽn-kɛg la karẽnbiis zãmsg sẽn na n yɩlẽ n tõog n tõog n maan karẽnsaala la karẽnsaambã karẽn-kẽndre la karẽnpoakã karẽn-koɛɛga.",
        "Yʋʋmd 1956, b yãka yūki-tsumugi tɩ yaa bũmb sẽn tar yõod wʋsg Zapõ soolmẽ wã. Yaa sull ning sẽn get Honba Yūki-tsumugi kõbgã koglg yell (本場結城 ⁇ 技術保持会) la b lugl yʋʋmd 1976 n sõngd n paasd la b taasd tʋʋm-te-kãnga. Yūki Daiichi High School sẽn be Yūki wã tara yūki-tsumugi klub. Yʋʋmd 2010, b ninga yūki-tsumugi wã tẽng sẽn yaa ninsaalb laog laog sẽn pa tõe n bãng n bãng n bilg pʋgẽ.",
        "B ra yaa zĩm-dãmb sẽn tar yĩn-m-meng sẽn yaa kãsenga, la b ra pa tar bãens-rɩtgã ye.",
        "Sẽn paase, b tara bĩis wʋsg sẽn be tẽngã gill zugu, sẽn na yɩl n wilg nebã b sẽn tõe n yũ rãamã to-to. B ned kam fãa wilgda bũmb sẽn yaa toor ne Bɛlg rã-yũudã.",
        "B ra maanda remsgã yʋʋmd fãa, Zʋg-sõngã daar hal tɩ ta yʋʋmd 1751. 3] Sẽn zems yʋʋm kobs-tã poore, b leb n talla-a lame n wilg yʋʋmd 1936, la b leb n tall-a lame n wilg yʋʋmd 1999, 2000, 2009, la 2015. A Marjan Kokalj n da so pipi sɩlems a yiibã, la a Borut Gartner n da so yaoolem soabã. Yaa neb 640 sẽn yaa reem-dãmb la reem-dãmb la b maana, tɩ bãmb 80 yaa sodaas sẽn kẽed ne wed-moosã. B ra pʋɩya tablɛy-rãmbã zĩis 20. Sull ning sẽn geta kom-bɩɩbã yell sẽn be Slovɛnya wã kõo a Škofja Loka tãnsoab kũun sẽn yaa toor-toore, a sẽn maan tʋʋm-noor sẽn kẽed ne yamleoogã wɛɛngẽ yʋʋmd 2010 wã, tãnsoabã sẽn da sigl reemã yʋʋmdã poore. Yʋʋmd 2008 soabã pʋgẽ, b kẽesa yɩɩlã Slobɛn soolmã bõn-vɩɩs nins sẽn pa tõe n yã wã sɛb sɛb pʋga. B na n le maana remsgã yʋʋmd 2021. A sẽn maan a sɩbgrã Škofja Loka wã yaa zĩig ning sẽn yaa kãseng n yɩɩdã neb sẽn maand we-rũngã pʋgẽ.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2001 yʋʋm-rɩt kiuugã, b sẽn wa n namsd b rãmbã, a Bergoglio kẽnga ne tẽnga pʋga minisrgã n kos polisã tɩ b kɩt tɩ b ra bas tɩ b maan maan maan-kʋʋdb la b maan tʋʋm-dẽgd sẽn kɩt tɩ b maand maand maand sẽn yaa laafɩ wã ye.",
        "West African Decorative Weaving, Kate P. Kent, African Arts, Vol. 6, No. 1 (Autumn, 1972), pp.&nbsp;22–27+67-70+88 DOI: 10.2307/3334637",
        "A sẽn boond tɩ smockã yaa b sẽn naan n naan n naan ne b nug-vɩɩs n naan n dɩk b sẽn da yaa b sẽn da pa tõe n yã wã. A yaa taab n yãgd ne nug n kɩt tɩ b yãgd a sẽn yaa a soaba. B sẽn da maand woto wã, b wilga b sẽn da segd n maan bũmb ninsã to-to. B wilga b sẽn tõe n maan bũmb ningã. .",
        "A Sirleaf zĩnda minisr sõngo yʋʋm 1972-1973 Tolbert zãma wã pʋgẽ. A basa a tʋʋmdã, a sẽn da pa zems taab goosneema wã ligd wɛɛngẽ wã yĩnga. Rẽ poore, yʋʋm a wãn poore, b yãka a t'a lebg ra-kɩtbã ministɛɛr n tʋm yʋʋmd 1979 n tãag yʋʋmd 1980 yʋʋm-vʋʋsg kiuugã.",
        "2011 Awarded Honorary Doctor of Laws degree from Harvard University",
        "Yʋʋmd 2012 wã saabẽ, a yɩɩ pipi pʋg-paal sẽn da maand b sẽn da boond tɩ Chocolate City wã. A yiisda a pipi yɩɩl a \"Mtoto\" yʋʋmd 2013.[9] Video wã paama kaset Los Angeles pʋgẽ.",
        "A Ibrahim yaa siglgã taoor lʋɩtb sẽn tʋmd a nin-buiidã yʋʋr yĩnga, sẽn yaa Mbororo wã sẽn be Tchadã. A zãmsame n kẽng Tchad tẽnga tẽnga sẽn boond tɩ N'Djamena, la a zĩnda Burkĩna Faso tẽnga neb sẽn yaa kood-dãmb sẽn yaa b sẽn yaa b rãmb n paad b rũmsã. A sẽn paam a zãmsgo, a bãngame tɩ b ningda a meng ne a sor ning b sẽn da ningd a sẽn yaa tẽng zug pagã, la b gɩdgame tɩ b ra paam a Mbororo rãmbã sor ning b ra kõ-a wã ye. Rẽ n so tɩ yʋʋmd 1999 wã, a lugla a sẽn boond t'a \"Asociation of Indigenous Peul Women and Peoples of Chad\" (AFPAT), sẽn yaa tigis sẽn yaa tigs-n-taag sẽn get kom-bɩɩsã la pagb sẽn tar sor n na n sõng b tɩ b tõog n yɩ taoor dãmb la b sõng nin-buiidã tɩ b tõog b mens ne b mens tẽngã wɛɛngẽ. Yʋʋmd 2005 wã, b kõo b siglgã sɛbã tɩ b maan tʋʋm-no-kãsemse, la b kẽes b toog tẽns wʋsg pʋsẽ.",
        "A Katya Scheinberg yaa Risi ne Amerik bãngd sẽn tʋmd ne matematiksã, n bãngd a vaeesg sẽn kẽed ne tʋʋm-noor sẽn nan yɩll n yɩ sõma n paase, la sẽn yɩɩd fãa sẽn kẽed ne tʋʋm-noor sẽn nan yɩll n yɩ sõma n paase. A yaa karen-saamb n be Zĩig ning b sẽn boond tɩ Géorgie Tẽn-tẽn-soab sullẽ wã, sẽn get tʋʋm la teed teedã laog yelle.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2000 soabã pʋgẽ, a Kidjo kẽnga Salvador de Bahia n sɩng a Axe percussion grooves sẽn yaa Afro-Brazilian buud-goamã sẽn yitã. A tʋma yɩɩl gʋlsdb a Carlinhos Brown ne a Vinicius Cantuária. A Gilberto Gil ra naag-a lame \"Refavela\" la a Daniella Mercury \"Tumba\" pʋgẽ. A Dave Matthews yɩɩl n be \"Iwoya\" pʋgẽ.",
        "Grammy nomination for Best Contemporary World Music Album (USA, 2011)",
        "A sẽn wa n paam a doktorã poore, a Cofman maana doktorã poore, t'a yɩ Humboldt karen-bi-bi-poak a Goethe Yuniõrsa wã Frankfurt. A lebga karen-saamb Londõ Imperial College yʋʋmd 1965 la a wa n kẽnga Perugia Yuniõrgr pʋgẽ yʋʋm a yembre. A wa n kẽe Tübingen Yuniõrgã pʋgẽ, Alemayn soolmẽ wã.",
        "A ra yaa wakat fãa karen-biiga la a ra yaa karen-saamb n lʋɩt Matɛmatik sullã taoor, Boğaziçi Inivɛrsite, Istanbul. A yɩɩ sull ning sẽn geta tẽn-zẽmsã yell taoor soaba, la a ra yaa a inivɛrsite wã taoor soab a Erɔp inivɛrsite wã sull pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 2004 n tãag 2007. A yaa Istanbul Center for Mathematical Sciences (IMBM) taoor soab a ye sẽn lugla. A ra yaa bãngdb sull sẽn get bãngrã yell sẽn yaa IMBM, Feza Gürsey Institute, Institut d'Etudes Avancées - Aix Marseille (IMéRA). A yɩɩ TÜBİTAK taoor soab yʋʋm 2008 n tãag yʋʋm 2012.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2024 kiuug rasem 13 wã, Chicago Marathon wã, Chepng'etich kɩtame tɩ b tõog n tõog n tõog dũniyã record a ye, ne wakat sẽn ta 2:09:56. A tigs Assefa sẽn da zoe n tõog n kogl a 2:11:53 wã, n tõoge, n tõog minit a yiib n tãagã. [16] A sẽn maan woto wã, a lebga pipi pag sẽn zoe zoe n yɩɩd a 2:11 la 2:10 wã. A Chepng'etich yeelame t'a rɩka a dũniyã record n kõ a tẽn-tẽnga la a ra-rɩk-n-taarã soab a Kelvin Kiptum, sẽn ki yʋʋmd 2024 tʋʋlg kiuugã pʋgẽ.",
        "Dr Reno Morar, former Chief Operating Officer",
        "A Nyaradzayi Gumbonzvanda rogame la a bɩɩ Magaya tẽnga sẽn be Murehwa, Zimbabwe. Yʋʋmd 1978 wã, a Gumbonzvanda ba wã kiime bãaga sẽn yaa wa b sẽn naan n wa n wa n ki wã yĩnga. Yʋʋmd 1978 wã n tãag 1980, a karen-biis nins sẽn be be be wã sẽn da yaa Rhodesian Bush War wã yĩnga, b sẽn pa le zãmsd b lekollã. A Gumbonzvanda zakã rãmb ra pa tõe n paam lekoll sẽn yaa toor-toorã ye, tɩ kɩt t'a pa kẽng lekoll yʋʋm kãens ye. A Gumbonzvanda wilgame tɩ a roagdbã kãadmã sẽn zĩnd a ma yʋʋm 15 wã, a ba-biisã kũum HIV bãaga yĩnga, la a saam-bi-pogs a yembr sẽn kẽ kãadem a yʋʋm 16 wã yaa a mengã pãn-tusdg a tʋʋmã wɛɛngẽ.",
        "2017: 100 Most Influential Young People in South Africa by Avance media.",
        "A sẽn maand vaeesg pʋgẽ wã, a rɩka yɛl kẽer n dɩk n dɩk n kẽnd n dɩkd sor n na n tall sor n tɩ taasd nebã. A leb n nonga sẽn yaa bũmb ning sẽn tõe n maan tɩ b bãng bũmb ning sẽn yaa bũmb ningã.",
        "Waddell Prize, awarded to the best science student, 1962–66",
        "Kamã-Rutenberg yɩɩ tẽn-zẽms taab karen-saamb Hekima University College, sẽn yaa Katolik Afrɩka Wẽrbɛg karẽn-biis karẽn-kẽndre, Nairobi, Kenya, yʋʋmd 2013 yʋʋm-rɩt kiuugã n tãag yʋʋm-rãmb-naabr kiuugã.",
        "A Kennedy ne a Roman Kossak yaa sebr ning b sẽn boond tɩ Set Teori, Aritmetik la Matematikã Sɩngr: Teorems, Philosophies wã sɛb-gʋlsdb. A Cambridge University Press yiis-a-la yʋʋmd 2012 yʋʋmdã pʋgẽ, a 36 soabã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2012 kiuugã, b yãka-a lame t'a wa zĩnd Goldman Sachs taoor lʋɩtb sullẽ. [11] Yʋʋmd 2014 tʋʋlg rasem 24 wã, b yãka a soab tɩ b yɩ taoor soaba.",
        "A Entusua-Mensah tʋʋmã ra yaa sõngo, sẽn na yɩl tɩ b yãkd b tʋʋm-kãsemsã taoor soaba. A ra yaa taoor soaba sẽn get b bãngrã sẽn na n yɩlẽ tɩ b tõog n tall sor n tall sor tɩ b tõog tɩ b bãngd b bãngrã sõma, n get b bãngdbã la b bãngd-b-la b tʋʋm nins b sẽn tʋmd tẽngã gill zugu. A sẽn da tʋmd tʋʋm-kãsemsã sʋka, yaa Afirik Wɛtg tẽnga tẽnga tẽnga tẽnga tʋʋmde I (2008-2013), tẽnga tẽnga tẽnga tẽn-gãong siglgã tʋʋmde (2008-2017), tẽnga tẽnga tẽnga rɩɩb la ligd sõngre tʋʋmde (2010-2012) ne dũni wã wã la Kanada tẽnga siglgã tʋʋmda, la Afirik Wɛttg tẽnga tẽnga tẽn -gãong sigla tʋʋmde II (2013-2017). A leb n yɩɩ tẽnga taoor soaba, la a sẽn na n maan bũmb ning fãa wã, a na n yɩɩ tẽnga naab sẽn na n sõng n tõog n tõog n sõng tẽnga neba. A sẽn da wa n yaa CSIR taoor soaba, a yii a tʋʋm-tʋmdã pʋgẽ yʋʋmd 2018 pʋgẽ.",
        "Officier de l’Ordre national du Mérite (France) (2004)",
        "Nostalgia is an Extreme Sport: An essay from the collection, Of This Our Country - September 2010",
        "A kẽnga Bedford High School sẽn be Bedfordshire wã, n yaool n paam bĩng n na n paam n paam n kẽng Londr Inivɛrsayẽ wã yʋʋm 15, n paam a Bachelorã matematikkã yʋʋmd 1911 yʋʋm 19 pʋgẽ. A sɩngame n lebg karen-saamb sẽn yaa matematɛk sull sull la sõdg karen-saamba sẽn be Allenswood Akademi wã sẽn be Londr kiidã",
        "A Priscilla Kolibea Mante yaa Ghana neuropharmacolog, n yaa vaeesd la karẽn-saamb ne Kwame Nkrumah Inivɛrsite sẽn get Siãns la Tekinoloji wã, sẽn be Kumasi campusẽ wã. A vaeesg tʋʋmda sẽn kẽed ne tɩɩs sẽn yaa tɩɩm sẽn tõe n sõng tɩ b tõog tɩbsg bãag sẽn yaa tɩɩm sẽn pa tõe n tõog tɩbsg bãag la sẽn pa tõe n paam tɩbsg bãag sẽn yaa neurocysticercosis sẽn yaa tɩɩm sẽn yaa tɩɩm sẽn pa tõe n paam tɩbsg bãagã. A tʋʋmẽ wã, a baooda sẽn yɩɩd fãa n na n bãng alkaloid cryptolepine la a nanoparticules solid-lipidã sẽn tõe n maan tɩ bãag sẽn yit neurocysticercosis pʋgẽ wã ra wa ne bã-kɛgeng ye. A sẽn datã yaa a bãng sẽn na n yɩ to-to n sõng tɩ cryptolepine kẽ bã-longdgã pʋgẽ sõma sẽn na yɩl n boog bã-longdgã yõodo, n sõng bãad dãmbã tɩ b tõog n mao ne b bãagã sõma. A Mante sẽn zãms bãag ning sẽn wat ne yĩn-wɩsgrã toor sẽn ka be, a leb n tʋmame n na n paam tɩbsg sẽn nan yɩll n boog toog ning a sẽn tarã, yɩɩrã la sũ-sãangã.",
        "A Pappus rɩka a karengã pʋga n na n maneg bũmb nins a sẽn get tɩ yaa yel-wẽn Pandrosion karen-biisã pʋgẽ wã. Baa a Pappus sẽn pa wilg tɩ b pa tõe n maan woto ne Pandrosion wã, a tara sor n na n bãnge tɩ b tõe n bãnge n bãnge, la tɩ b tõeeme n bãnge b sẽn na n maan to-to n bãnge. Yaa \"recursive geometric\" looseng ye, la yaa a tãab-n-soaba, la pa tʋm ne a sẽn be yĩngr-bila wã ye.A Pappus yeelame tɩ b pa tar makr sẽn wilgd tɩ b ra tõe n maan bũmb n sõng-a ye. Bũmb a to sẽn be seb-kãng pʋgẽ, la sẽn tõe n yɩ a Pandrosion n kɩt tɩ b maan woto me, yaa a sẽn yaa sõma la sẽn yaa sõma n naan maan a geometri wã sẽn yaa nana n yɩɩd a Pappus sẽn maan a woto wã.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2022 kiuugã pʋgẽ, a Pate paama naam ning sẽn yaa Nizɛɛr tẽnga taoor soab a Muhammadu Buhari sẽn kõ-a wã, ne Nizɛɛr neb 447 a taaba. Yʋʋmd 2023 tʋʋlg kiuugã, a lebga Global Alliance for Vaccines and Immunization (GAVI) taoor soaba.",
        "Our Sister Killjoy: or Reflections from a Black-eyed Squint (novel), Longman, 1977.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2021 soabã pʋgẽ, IUCN World Commission on Environmental Law (WCEL), ne b sẽn tʋmd ne ONU Tʋʋmdã sẽn get zĩ-likrã wɛɛngẽ wã (UNEP), kõo Mrema kũun a Nicholas Robinson sẽn get zĩiga zãab wɛɛngẽ wã yĩnga.",
        "Dãk Mater: Afro-Tõndg kibay (BBC4, 2022) A Eshun sẽn wilg filimã yaa filim sẽn boond tɩ Dark Matter: A History of the Afro-tõndg (BBC4, 2022). Yaa Jean-Michel Basquiat n tãag a Grace Jones sẽn zãmsd neb nins sẽn yaa zoensã sẽn tũnugd ne bãngrã kibayã n vaees b zoensã kibayã la b get b sẽn na n maan beoog-daar toor-toorã.",
        "Ghanaians, Ghanaian-Canadians and Asantes: Citizenship and Identity among Migrants in Toronto? Africa Today 45(3-4): pages 481–494 (1998);",
        "Yʋʋmd 2021 soabã, a kẽnga taoor dãmb sẽn da yaa tẽn-bɛd dãmba la Noobɛl kũunã sẽn paam-b rãmbã sʋka n gʋls lɛtr sẽn pa be b sẽn dat tɩ G7 wã bas COVID-19 koe-moonegã la b lebs n kɩt tɩ b tõog n zab ne SIDA.",
        "Word!Word?Word! Issa Samb and The Undecipherable Form (2013)",
        "An illustrated guide to the flora of Mauritius and the Indian Ocean Islands (2003)",
        "Yʋʋmd 2014 yʋʋm-rɩt kiuugã, b yãka a Lucie Milebou Aubusson t'a wa lebg senɛt tẽnga taoor soab n na n tũ a Rogombé.",
        "A Ryder sẽn sɩng n tʋmdẽ wã ra gomda yɛl nins sẽn tɩ loe ne toeengã la laogã yelle. A ra yaa a Stern Review seb-gʋlsd a ye, sẽn yaa seb-vãoog sẽn yiis yʋʋmd 2006 sẽn gomd ko-maandgã toeeng sẽn tõe n wa ne toeengã yelle.",
        "A Bouri Jean Victor Sanhouidi (sẽn dog yʋʋm 1949), yaa diplomat la ekonomist sẽn yit Burkĩna Faso. A Bouri Sanhouidi paama a karengã Université Laval sẽn be Sainte-Foy, Québec. A yaa Etazĩni nin-kãnga.",
        "On the existence of ad-nilpotent elements, Afrika Matematika (2014), DOI 10.1007/s13370-014-0246-y (with Come Jean Antoine Bere and Nakelgbamba Boukary Pilabre).",
        "A Diallo ra yaa sull ning sẽn geta tẽnga no-tũudba yell sẽn tũ ne sull ning sẽn geta tẽnga no-tũudba yell sẽn zĩnd yʋʋm 2007 tʋʋlg kiuugã, n yɩ sull ning sẽn geta tẽnga no-tũudba yell sẽn boond tɩ Party for Deemocracy and socialism (PDS) sẽn be Senõ provense. A ra yaa PDS nin-yend sẽn tõog n paam zĩiga. A ra yaa sull ning sẽn get b sẽn na n maan to-to n tõog tɩ nin-sabls tẽnsa paam b mensã. A ra yaa sull ning sẽn get b sẽn na n maan to-to tɩ nin-sabls tẽnsa paam b mensã.",
        "Jean-Baptiste Natama (tʋʋmd a 30 yʋʋm 1964 tʋʋl-nif kiuug rasem 18 yʋʋm 2018 tʋʋl n ki) yaa Burkĩna politik soab, diplomat, gʋlsd la taoor lʋɩtb taoor lʋɩtbã taoor lʋɩtba sẽn zĩnd yʋʋm 2015 wã.",
        "A Hassan Hajjaj (b sẽn dog yʋʋmd 1961 wã) yaa Moroc sẽn yaa maan-kɛg la fotogre sẽn vɩ ne a sẽn tʋmd Londõ, sẽn be Etazĩni, la Marrakesh, sẽn be Marok. A mii a foto wã sẽn wilgd bũmb ning sẽn wilgd a sẽn maand bũmb ningã.",
        "A Bellow rogame Bucharest, Romayn soolmẽ wã, yʋʋmd 1935 t'a yʋʋr boond t'a Alexandra Bagdasar. A roagdbã fãa ra yaa logtoɛɛmbã. A ma, a Florica Bagdasar (a sẽn dog a Ciumetti) ra yaa kom-pugl tɩɩm karen-saamb. A ba wã, a Dumitru Bagdasar, ra yaa neurokirɛɛg. A paama a M.S. wã matematikkã pʋgẽ Bucharest karẽn-biis roogẽ yʋʋmd 1957, a sẽn yã la a kẽ kãadem ne a sɩdã, matematikkã Cassius Ionescu-Tulcea. A kẽnga ne a sɩdã Etazĩni yʋʋmd 1957 wã, la a paama a PhD wã Yale Yuniovɛrsẽ yʋʋmd 1959 wã, a Shizuo Kakutani sẽn wilg-a t'a na n maan a tʋʋm-no-kãnga. A sẽn paam a diplôme wã poore, a tʋma wa yel-bũndã karen-biis a Yale yʋʋmd 1959 n tãag yʋʋmd 1961 wã, la a yaa karen-bi-bi-pugl sẽn sõng Pennsylvania Yunivɛrzitetã yʋʋmd 1962 n tãag afe 1964 wã. Yʋʋmd 1964 n tãag 1967, a yɩɩ karẽn-soab Illinois karẽn-biis roogẽ. Yʋʋmd 1967 wã, a kẽnga Northwestern University n lebg matematikk karen-saamb. A zĩnda Northwestern wã hal n tãag a sẽn yi a yõor yaoogẽ yʋʋmd 1996, t'a lebg karen-saamb sẽn yaa karen-bi-poak.",
        "A Ulrike Luise Tillmann FRS yaa matematɛk sẽn yaa algebraik topoloji bãngda, sẽn maan sõngre tɩ b bãng algebraik kurbã moduli zĩiga. A yɩɩ London Mathematical Society taoor soaba yʋʋm 2021-2022 pʋgẽ.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2001 wã, a Wina yãka a Nalolo tẽnga tẽnga taoor soab n yɩ siglgã taoor lʋɩtb sull ning sẽn boond tɩ United Party for National Development wã taoor soaba. A yaa b sẽn yãk-a tɩ b yɩ b sull sull sull ning sẽn geta b mensã yell n get b sẽn segd n maan to-to wã taoor soaba.",
        "Yʋʋmd 2006-07 wakate, a Fernandes kell n zĩnda Siõ wã taoor soaba, n yɩɩ tẽn-sʋka. A ra tara a pipi gool wakat kãnga, a sẽn tõog a FC Naters ne a 3-1 wã pʋgẽ. A Fernandes yaool n maana a sẽn da be Europe wã n na n sõng a Siõ wã, a sã n wa paam n pa le tõe n paam n paam n paame, a sãn wa paam n paam ne a Baer Leverkusen, a sãan yaa ne a sẽn pa le tõe ne a sẽn paam n paam a sẽn pa tõe n paam a sãan ye. A sẽn da wa n na n wa n wa n naaga a Zeova wã, a maana a Zeova raabã. Yʋʋmd 2006 zĩ-likr kiuug rasem 14 wã, a Fernandes talla a pipi gool a sẽn da tar a Siõ wã pʋgẽ, a sẽn da wa n maand a Luzern ne a 1-1. Yʋʋmd 2006-07 siglgã baasgẽ, a paama a yiib-n-soabã sẽn da tõe n paam n kʋ-a wã minit 90 soabã pʋgẽ, a sẽn paam karɩll-wõog pipi kibsã poore. A yɩɩ a sɩnga a poorẽ soab a Sion sẽn da wa n tõog a Saint-Gallen ne 3-0. Yʋʋmd 2006-07 baasgẽ, a Fernandes yɩɩ taoor soab n maan yɩɩr pis-naas la a yembr (35 ne ligã) la a maana bõn-naands naoor a naas ne pʋ-tẽebã fãa.",
        "•Yʋʋmd 2012 soabã, b yãka Betlehɛm tɩ yɩ \"Rãam dãmb 100 sẽn tar pãng\" sẽn be Arise Magazine pʋgẽ, sẽn naan naan Modɛl Afrɩka.",
        "roblématique de l'aide aux pays sous-développés 1976",
        "Yʋʋmd 2014 sɛt kiuug rasem 10 wã, sull a nu sẽn yaa moabg rãmba, sẽn tar n be ne Demokraat Soog ne Ekonomik Piig-n-paalbã wilgame tɩ b ratame tɩ b wilg tɩ b pa tẽed a Mbete ye. Sẽn paase, b sẽn da wa n sõsda ne taab sigr kiuug rasem 16 daarã, b tõoga b sẽn da rat n yeel tɩ b pa le sak n deeg ye. Woto yaa sẽn yɩ to-to tɩ b sẽn da wa n yãk n na n yãk n yãk n bas a Mbete wã poore, b sẽn da na n yãk tɩ b yãk n bas-a wã yĩnga.",
        "A Marwala paama waoogr doctorate sẽn yit Kaʋkaas karẽn-biisẽ Tbilisi, Gɛɛrzi soolmẽ wã, Venda karẽn-bibẽ wã. , Tshwane Teknolozi Yunivɛrzẽ[56] la Pretori Yunivɛrzi wã. A Marwala yɩɩ Harvard Yunivɛrsite wã, Wolfson College, Cambridge, la California Yunivɛssite wã, Berkeley.",
        "A Mohammed rogame yʋʋmd 1963 tʋʋlg kiuug rasem 21 daarã, a sẽn yaa rĩm a Hassan II ne a pagã, a Lalla Latifa biig a yiib soaba la a pipi biiga. B sẽn da yaa b bi-puglã, b ra yaa ned ning sẽn dogd-a wã.",
        "Collar of the Order of the Aztec Eagle of Mexico (11 February 2005)",
        "2024 recipient of the National Order of the Lion by President Macky Sall",
        "A Gilbert Asante rogame yʋʋmd 1987 wã, t'a rog Koforidua, Gana, la a kẽe St. Peter's Boys Senior High School sẽn be Nkwatia wã a sẽn na n paam lekoll sẽn yaa sekondarã. A paama kareng tʋʋma wɛɛngẽ Ghana Telecommunication Technology University.",
        "Ghana pʋg-soab nins sẽn tar raoodã kũun sẽn wõnd tẽn-zẽms pʋg-soaba sẽn tar raood wã kũunã yaa Amerik tẽnga kũun sẽn kõd Etazĩni wã tẽn-zẽnga minisr sẽn kõ Gana pʋg-sɩd nins sẽn wilg tɩ b yaa taoor dãmba, raood dãmba, nin-tɩrs rãmba, la b tʋlg n sak n kõ neb a taabã, sẽn yɩɩd fãa sẽn na yɩl n sõng pagbã sẽn tar noor tɩ b tõog n maan yel-wẽnã."
    ]
}
